{{also|Islámábád|Îslamabad}}
==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{bor|en|ur|اسلام آباد|tr=Islām ābād}}, from {{m|ur|اسلام||Islam}} + {{m|ur|آباد||inhabited place}}. Romanized form {{suffix|en|Islam|abad}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ɪzˈlɑːməˌbɑːd/|/ɪsˈlɑːməˌbɑːd/|/ɪzˈlæməˌbæd/}}
** {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-Islamabad.wav|a=Southern England}}

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun}}

