** {{audio|en|En-au-hello.ogg|a=AU}}
* {{IPA|en|/hɛˈloː/|/həˈloː/|/ˈhɛloː/|/ˈhɛlo/|a=CA}}
* {{rhymes|en|ɛləʊ|s=2}}
