|passage=Yvonne and Lee Swee '''potatoed''' Deputy Lestrade multiple times before Sheriff Moran '''potatoed''' them both. {{...}} Suddenly, Sheriff Moran heard the ''click click'' of an empty weapon. He turned to see that both Mayor Eliza and Kat had run out of ammunition.}}

