* {{R:ar:Freytag|volume=1|pages=48–49, 52}}
* {{R:ar:Lane|pages=75–77, 83–84}}
* {{R:ar:Wehr-4|pages=27–28, 30}}

{{cln|ar|subjunctive particles|negatives|interrogative particles}}
