{{sa-decl-noun-u-n|आ|ल|ā|l}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{der2|sa|आलुक}}

===Etymology 4===
{{rfe|sa|Not attested in etymological dictionaries. Could be related to Etymologies 1 or 2, though it has the same gender as Etymology 3.}}

====Noun====
{{sa-noun|g=n}}

# a [[raft]], [[float]]

=====Declension=====
{{sa-decl-noun-n}}

===Etymology 5===
{{rfe|sa|Not attested in etymological dictionaries. Perhaps related to {{m|sa|उलूक|t=owl}}; see there for more.}}

====Noun====
{{sa-noun|g=m}}

# an [[owl]]

=====Declension=====
{{sa-decl-noun-m}}

