===Etymology===
{|
|-
| [[Image:Phoenician aleph.svg|50px|Phoenician alef]][[Image:Aramaic alap.svg|50px|Aramaic Ālaf]][[Image:Aleph.svg|Aramaic alef]]
|}
Modification of Aramaic {{m|mul|sc=Armi|𐡀|tr=ā, ē||Ālef}}, closely related to Syriac {{m|mul|sc=Syrc|ܐ|tr=’||Ālap, Olaf}} and Arabic {{m|mul|sc=Arab|ا|tr=ā ʾ||alif}}, ultimately from Phoenician {{m|mul|sc=Phnx|𐤀|tr=’||alef}}.

