{{ArabForm2}}

====Usage notes====
* Represents the back vowel phoneme /o/, unless a small [[ٴ|ء]] (hamza) was placed in the beginning of the word. In Kazakh the Hamza marks that all vowels in the following word are fronted. If و is the first letter and is representing a front vowel, it is combined with the hamza and the varient [[ٶ]] is used.

