==Persian==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|fa|/wɑːw/|a=Dari}}
* {{IPA|fa|/vɑːv/|a=Iran}}

===Letter===
{{head|fa|letter|head='''و '''/''' وـ '''/''' ـوـ '''/''' ـو'''|tr=vâv}}

# The thirtieth letter of the [[w:Perso-Arabic alphabet|Perso-Arabic alphabet]]. It is preceded by {{l|fa|ن}} and followed by {{l|fa|ه}}. Its name is {{l|fa|واو}}.

====See also====
* [[w:Persian alphabet|Wikipedia article on the Persian alphabet]]

===Etymology 1===
Both {{inh+|fa|pal|-|nocap=1}} and {{bor+|fa|ar|-|nocap=1}}, hence the multiple pronunciations:
* Pronunciation 1: From {{inh|fa|pal|𐭠𐭥𐭣|ts=ud}}, {{m|pal|𐭠𐭥|ts=u}}; from {{inh|fa|peo|𐎢𐎫𐎠|ts=utā||and}}, from {{inh|fa|iir-pro|*Hutá|*(H)utá}}, from {{m|iir-pro|*Hu|*(H)u}}, from {{der|fa|ine-pro|*h₂ew|*h₂u}}. 
* Pronunciation 2: From {{bor|fa|ar|وَ}}, from {{der|fa|sem-pro|*wa}}. Also the etymology of the written form.

====Pronunciation====
{{q|Pronunciation 1}} {{fa-IPA|‿u}}
* {{audio|fa|Fa-و.ogg|a=Iran}}

{{q|Pronunciation 2}} {{fa-IPA|wa|ir=ʋæ}}

* Both pronunciations are generally interchangeable, with pronunciation 1 being more common in context and pronunciation 2 being more common in formal speech, after a pause and/or for emphasis.
* In poetry, both pronunciations are used based on rhyme, but pronunciation 1 is used more often.

====Conjunction====
{{fa-regional|و|و|[[у]], [[ва]]}}
{{head|fa|conjunction|tr=o, va}}

# [[and]]
#* '''21st century''', {{w|Mohammad Farrokhi Yazdi}}
#*: {{quote|fa|گر چه جیب و جام من از مال '''و''' مِی تُهیست.|tr=Gar če jib '''o''' jām-e man az māl o mey tohist.|Although my pocket '''and''' my cup are empty of money and wine.}}

=====Usage notes=====
* In the contemporary spelling of Persian, the {{l|fa|و|tr=va}} conjunction is not joined to the following word. However, the practice of joining the conjunction to the following word, as it is in Arabic, was not uncommon in early classical texts.

=====Descendants=====
* {{desc|inc-hnd|bor=1}}
*: {{desc|hi|व}}
*: {{desc|ur|و|tr=va, o}}
* {{desc|mr|व|bor=1}}

===Etymology 2===
{{non-lemma}}

====Alternative forms====
* {{alt|fa|رو|tr=ro|qq=between vowels}}

====Pronunciation====
* {{IPA|fa|/o/}}

====Particle====
{{head|fa|particle|tr=-o}}

# {{lb|fa|in|Iran}} {{alt form|fa|را|tr=rā|from=colloquial}}
#: {{ux|fa|دستت'''و''' بلند کن.|tr=dastet'''o''' boland kon.|Raise your hand.}}

