*: Mandarin: {{t+|cmn|阿列夫|tr=ālièfū}}, {{t|cmn|阿利夫|tr=ālìfu}} {{qualifier|Arabic letter also}}, {{t|cmn|艾利夫|tr=àilìfu}}
* Finnish: {{t+|fi|alef}}
