* German: {{qual|Hebrew letter}} {{t|de|Aleph|n}}, {{t|de|Alef|n}}
* Greek: {{t|el|άλεφ|n}}
* Hebrew: {{t+|he|אָלֶף|f|tr=álef|sc=Hebr}}, {{qualifier|symbol}} {{t+|he|א|sc=Hebr}}
* Hindi: {{t|hi|अलिफ़}}
* Italian: {{t|it|alef|m|f}}
* Japanese: {{t|ja|アレフ|tr=arefu|sc=Jpan}}, {{t|ja|アリフ|tr=arifu|sc=Jpan}} {{qualifier|Arabic letter}}
