# The nineteenth [[letter]] of the [[Yoruba]] alphabet in the [[ajami]] script, equivalent to Latin script '''{{m|yo|r}}'''.

====Forms====
{{ArabForm2}}

====See also====
* Previous letter: {{l|yo|پ}}
* Next letter: {{l|yo|س}}
-------- end text --------
Page 12 Appendix:Arabic script: Skipped, no changes
Page 12 Appendix:Arabic script: -------- begin text --------
{{script appendix|Arab}}

There are 28 [[letter]]s used for [[writing]] the [[Arabic]] [[language]]. Derived from the [[Appendix:Phoenician script|Phoenician alphabet]], the Arabic script has been adopted for use in a wide variety of languages other than Arabic, including [[Persian]], [[Kurdish]], [[Malay]] and [[Urdu]].
{{wikipedia}}
===[[Arabic alphabet]]===

