===Modified letters and additional symbols===
* {{l|ar|ء|tr=-}}{{LR}} {{l|ar|هَمْزَة}} ''(standalone)'' - {{l|ar|هَمْزَة القَطْع|tr=hamzat al-qaṭʕ}}
* {{l|ar|ة|tr=-}}{{LR}} - {{l|ar|تَاء مَرْبُوطَة}}
* {{l|ar|ى|tr=-}}{{LR}} - {{l|ar|أَلِف مَقْصُورَة}}, final position only, often used in place of the final {{l|ar|sc=Arab|ي}} by some writers, especially in Egypt.
* {{l|ar|أ|tr=-}}{{LR}} - (hamza over an ʾalif)
* {{l|ar|إ|tr=-}}{{LR}} - (hamza under an ʾalif)
* {{l|ar|ؤ|tr=-}}{{LR}} - (hamza over a wāw)
* {{l|ar|ئ|tr=-}}{{LR}} - (hamza over a dotless yāʾ )
* {{l|ar|آ|tr=-}}{{LR}} - {{l|ar|أَلِف مَدَّة}}
* {{l|ar|ٱ|tr=-}}{{LR}} - {{l|ar|هَمْزَة الوَصْل|tr=hamzat al-waṣl}}

===Diacritics - {{l|ar|تَشْكِيل}}===

* <span style="font-size: 1.26em">{{l|ar|ـَ|tr=-}}</span><span style="font-size: 1.02em">{{LR}} - {{l|ar|فَتْحَة}}</span>

*  <span style="font-size: 1.26em">{{l|ar|ـِ|tr=-}}</span><span style="font-size: 1.02em">{{LR}} - {{l|ar|كَسْرَة}}</span>

*  <span style="font-size: 1.26em">{{l|ar|ـُ|tr=-}}</span><span style="font-size: 1.02em">{{LR}} - {{l|ar|ضَمَّة}}</span>

*  <span style="font-size: 1.26em">{{l|ar|ـْ|tr=-}}</span><span style="font-size: 1.02em">{{LR}} - {{l|ar|سُكُون}}</span>

*  <span style="font-size: 1.26em">{{l|ar|ـّ|tr=-}}</span><span style="font-size: 1.02em">{{LR}} - {{l|ar|شَدَّة}}</span>

*  <span style="font-size: 1.26em">{{l|ar|ـٰ|tr=-}}</span><span style="font-size: 1.02em">{{LR}} - {{l|ar|أَلِف خَنْجَرِيَّة}}</span> - missing on standard keyboards, seldom used, only appears in a small number of words.

===Nunation - {{l|ar|تَنْوِين}}===

*  <span style="font-size: 1.26em">{{l|ar|ـٌ|tr=-}}</span><span style="font-size: 1.02em">{{LR}} - {{l|ar|تَنْوِين الضَّمّ}}</span>

*  <span style="font-size: 1.26em">{{l|ar|ـٍ|tr=-}}</span><span style="font-size: 1.02em">{{LR}} - {{l|ar|تَنْوِين الْكَسْر}}</span>

*  <span style="font-size: 1.26em">{{l|ar|ـً|tr=-}}</span><span style="font-size: 1.02em">{{LR}} - {{l|ar|تَنْوِين الْفَتْح}}</span>

===Others===
* {{l|ar|ـ|tr=-}}{{LR}} - {{l|ar|تَطْوِيل}}, a lengthening symbol, has no phonetic value.

