==Arabic==

===Etymology 1===

====Pronunciation====
* {{sense|letter name}} {{ar-IPA|بَاء}}
* {{sense|phoneme}} {{ar-IPA|بْ}}

====Letter====
{{head|ar|letter|head='''ب '''/''' ب‍ '''/''' ‍ب‍ '''/''' ‍ب'''|tr=bāʔ}}

# The second letter of the [[Arabic]] alphabet. Its name is {{l|ar|بَاء}} and it has the sound of English '''[[b]]'''. It is preceded by {{l|ar|أ}} and followed by {{l|ar|ت}}.

=====See also=====
* [[w:Arabic alphabet|Wikipedia article on the Arabic alphabet]]

====Symbol====
{{head|ar|numeral symbol|head='''ب '''/''' ب‍ '''/''' ‍ب‍ '''/''' ‍ب'''|tr=bāʔ}}

# The second letter in traditional [[abjad]] order, which is used in place of numerals for list numbering ([[abjad numerals]]). It is preceded by {{l|ar|أ}} and followed by {{l|ar|ج}}.

====Noun====
{{head|ar|noun}}

# {{abbr of|ar|باب||chapter}}

===Etymology 2===
Ultimately {{inh|ar|sem-pro|*bV-|t=with, in, at, among}} with likely interrelation with {{inh|ar|sem-pro|*bayt-|t=site, location; nest, house}}; cognates with {{cog|uga|𐎁|}}, {{cog|arc|ב־|}}, {{cog|syc|ܒ-|}}, {{cog|he|בְּ־|tr=bə-}}, {{cog|gez|በ}} and {{cog|egy|bw|}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|بِ}}

====Preposition====
{{ar-prep|بِـ}}

# {{non-gloss definition|denotes an instrument or tool}}, [[with]], [[by]] (a means)
#: {{ux|ar|طَرَقْتُ الْمِسْمَارَ '''بِ'''مِطْرَقَةٍ|subst=بِ/بِ-|t=I hit the nail '''with''' a hammer}}
#: {{ux|ar|رَماهُم '''بِ'''ٱلْحِجَارَةِ|subst=بِ/بِ-|t=He pelted them '''with''' stones.}}
# {{non-gloss definition|denotes the agent of unaccusative forms}}
#: {{ux|ar|هُوَ يَتَقَوَّى '''بِهِ'''|t=He is strengthened '''by it'''}}
#: {{cot|ar|بِوَاسِطَة|pos=denotes the agent of passive forms|q=post-Classical}}
# {{non-gloss definition|denotes accompaniment}}
#: {{cot|ar|مَعَ}}
## [[with]] (a component)
##: {{uxi|ar|قَهْوةٌ '''بِ'''ٱلْحَلِيبِ|subst='''بِ'''/'''بِ-'''|t=coffee '''with''' milk}}
## [[with]] (a quality); [[in]] (a state)
##: {{uxi|ar|'''بِ'''سُرُورٍ|subst=بِ/بِ-|t='''with''' pleasure}}
##: {{uxi|ar|'''بِ'''ٱمْتِيازٍ|subst=بِ/بِ-|t='''with''' success and distinction}}
# {{non-gloss definition|denotes proximity}}, [[with]], [[to]], [[next to]], [[at]] {{gloss|touching on, connected with, concerning}}
#: {{uxi|ar|مَرْبُوطٌ '''بِ'''شَجَرَةٍ|subst=بِ/بِ-|t=tied '''to''' a tree}}
#: {{uxi|ar|لَا عَلاقةَ لَهُ '''بِ'''ٱلْمَوْضُوعِ|subst=بِ/بِ-|t=unrelated '''to''' the subject}}
# {{non-gloss definition|denotes inclusion, surrounding, or location}}, [[within]] (a place); [[in]]; [[on]]; [[at]]
#: {{uxi|ar|'''بِ'''ٱلْأَرْضِ|subst=بِ/بِ-|t='''on''' the earth/'''in''' ''or'' '''inside''' the ground}}
#: {{uxi|ar|'''بِ'''ٱلقَرْيةِ|subst=بِ/بِ-|t='''in''' the village}}
#: {{uxi|ar|'''بِ'''ٱلْمَكْتَبَةِ|subst=بِ/بِ-|t='''at''' the library}}
#: {{uxi|ar|'''بِ'''ٱلْمَكْتَبِ|subst='''بِ'''/'''بِ-'''|t='''at''' the office/'''in''' the desk}}
#: {{syn|ar|فِي}}
# {{non-gloss definition|denotes requital}}, giving or doing in return; [[for]]
#: {{ux|ar|اِشْتَرَيْتُهُ '''بِ'''أَلْفِ رِيَالٍ.|subst=بِ/بِ-|t=I bought it '''for''' a thousand riyals.}}
# {{non-gloss definition|marks the predicate of a negative copula}}
#: {{ux|ar|هُوَ لَيْسَ '''بِ'''شَاهِدٍ وَلَا '''بِ'''قَارِئٍ.|subst=بِ/بِ-,وَلَا/وَ-لَا|t=He is not one who witnessed [it] or read [it].}}

=====Inflection=====
{{ar-prep-auto|بِـ|bi-}}

=====Derived terms=====
* {{l|ar|بِمَا}}
* {{l|ar|بِمَ}}
* {{l|ar|بِمَنْ}}

