{{head|ckb|letter|head='''ب '''/''' ب‍ '''/''' ‍ب‍ '''/''' ‍ب'''|tr=bā}}

# The second letter of the Kurdo-Arabic alphabet. Its name is {{m|ckb|با}} and it has the sound of English '''[[b]]'''. It is preceded by {{m|ckb|ا}} and followed by {{m|ckb|پ}}. Equivalent to '''[[b]]''' in the Kurdo-Latin alphabet.

====See also====
* [[Special:Allpages/ب|Search for entries beginning with {{lang|mul|ب}}]]

