==Hijazi Arabic==

===Etymology 1===

====Pronunciation====
* {{sense|letter name}} {{IPA|acw|/ˈbaːʔ/}}
* {{sense|phoneme}} {{IPA|acw|/b/}}

====Letter====
{{head|acw|letter|head=ب|tr=bāʔ}}

# The second letter of the [[Arabic]] alphabet. Its name is {{l|ar|بَاء}}, and is preceded by {{l|acw|أ|tr=ʔalif}} and followed by {{l|acw|ت|tr=tāʔ}}.

=====Forms=====
{{ArabForm}}

====See also====
* {{l|acw|پ|tr=pāʔ}}

===Etymology 2===
Probably from a shortened form of {{inh|acw|ar|بَغْيْ|t=to want}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{IPA|acw|/bi/}}

====Preposition====
{{acw-prep|head=بِـ|tr=bi}}

# {{senseid|ar|present}} -[[ing]] {{gloss|prefix indicating the present continuous tense}}
#: {{ux|acw|بِيِتْكَلَّم|tr='''bi'''yitkallam|he is '''speaking'''}}

===Etymology 3===
From {{inh|acw|ar|بِ}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{IPA|acw|/bi/}}

====Preposition====
{{acw-prep|head=بِـ|tr=bi}}

# [[with]], [[by]] (a means)
#: {{ux|acw|بِالْمِطْرَقة|tr=bi-l-miṭraga|with a mallet}}

