===Etymology 16===
Abbreviations.

# {{lb|en|stenoscript}} a word-initial letter ⟨a⟩.
# {{lb|en|stenoscript}} the long vowel /eɪ/ at the end of a word, or before a final consonant that is not /dʒ, v, z/. (Note: the final consonant is not written; [ɛə˞] counts as /eɪr/.)
#: Thus the word {{m|en|a}}, plus its inflection {{m|en|an}}.
# {{lb|en|stenoscript}} the word {{m|en|a.m.}}
# {{lb|en|stenoscript}} the prefix {{m|en|ad-}}.

