==Norwegian Bokmål==
[[Image:Latin letter A.svg|250px|thumb|The [[letter]]  '''''a''''' from the [[Norwegian]] alphabet.]]

===Etymology 1===
From {{der|nb|la|a}}, from {{der|nb|grc|-}} {{m|grc|Α||alpha}}, likely through the {{der|nb|ett|-}} language, from {{der|nb|phn|-}} {{m|phn|𐤀}}, from Proto-Canaanite [[Image:Protoalef.svg|20px]], from Proto-Sinaitic [[Image:Proto-semiticA-01.svg|20px]], from {{der|nb|egy|-}} {{m|egy|𓃾}}, representing the head of an [[ox]].

====Pronunciation====
* {{sense|letter name}} {{IPA|nb|/ɑː/}}
* {{sense|phoneme}} {{IPA|nb|/ɑː/|/a/|[æ]|q3=before u or in some Enɡlish loan words}}
* {{audio|nb|Pronunciation of Norwegian Bokmål «A», «a».ogg}}
* {{audio|nb|NB - Pronunciation of Norwegian Bokmål «a (fransk)».ogg}}
* {{hyphenation|nb|a}}
* {{homophones|nb|A|à|A-|a-|ah}}

====Letter====
{{head|nb|letter|uppercase|A}}

# {{Latn-def|nb|letter|1}}

=====See also=====
* {{list:Latin script letters/nb/simple}}

====Noun====
{{head|nb|noun|g=m|definite singular|a-en|indefinite plural|a-er|definite plural|a-ene}}

# the letter {{l|en|a}}, the first letter of the Norwegian alphabet
#: {{ux|nb|[[fra A til B]]|[[from A to B]]|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|nb|[[fra A til Å]]|[[from A to Z]]|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|nb|[[har man sagt a, må man si b]]|if you have said A, you should say B|inline=1}}
#* {{quote-book|nb|year=1999|author={{w|Lars Roar Langslet}}|title=I kamp for norsk kultur|page=234|passage=bruken av a i bestemt form i hunkjønnsord|t=the use of a in the definite form of feminine words}}
# indicates the first or best entry of a [[list]], [[order]] or [[rank]]
#: {{syn|nb|A-|a-}}
#: {{ux|nb|oppgang '''A'''|[[apartment]] entrance '''A'''|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|nb|blodgruppe '''A'''|[[blood group]] '''A'''|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|nb|førerkort i klasse '''A'''|(motorcycle) driver's license in class '''A'''|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|nb|øl i klasse '''A'''|beer in class '''A''' (with 0,0-0,7 volume percent alcohol)|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|nb|'''A''' post|'''A''' post / priority mail|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|nb|'''A'''-aksje|class '''A'''-share|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|nb|hepatitt '''A'''|hepatitis '''A'''|inline=1}}
#* {{quote-book|nb|year=1919|author={{w|Bjørnstjerne Bjørnson}}|title=Samlede digter-verker I|trans-title=Collected poetic works 1|page=454|passage=[bokstavene begynte] at gaa sammen, to og to: a stod og hvilte under et træ, som hedte b|t=[the letters began] to go together, two by two: a stood and rested under a tree called b}}
#* {{quote-book|nb|year=1920|author={{w|Jonas Lie (writer)|Jonas Lie}}|title=Samlede Digterverker V|page=389|passage=begynde paa Ø istedet for A|t=start with Ø instead of A}}
#* {{quote-book|nb|year=1886|author={{w|Arne Garborg}}|title=Mogning og manndom I|page=172|passage=jeg traf sammen med et par generalbanditter, gamle gutter, storartede ranglefanter, 1ste klasse 1 A med stjerne, deilige herremænd|t=I met a couple of general bandits, old boys, great revelers, 1st class 1 A with a star, lovely gentlemen}}
#* {{quote-book|nb|year=1939|author={{w|Knut Hamsun}}|title=Artikler|page=99|passage=historie er hvad A mener til forskel fra B, og hvad C igen mener til forskel baade fra A og B om den samme sag|t=story is what A thinks differently from B and what C again thinks differently from both A and B about the same case}}
# the highest [[grade]] in a [[school]] or [[university]] using the A-F scale
#: {{ux|nb|få A til eksamen|receive an A on an exam}}
#* {{quote-book|nb|year=2019|author={{w|Helene Uri}}|title=Stillheten etterpå|page=14|passage=jeg har gode karakterer. Bare A-er og B-er|t=I have good grades. Only A's and B's}}
# {{lb|nb|music}} designation of the sixth [[note]] from C and the corresponding [[tone]]
#: {{ux|nb|A-dur|[[A major]]}}
#: {{ux|nb|A-moll|[[A minor]]}}
#* {{quote-book|nb|year=1944|author=Børre Qvamme|title=Musikk|page=10|passage=synge en riktig A uten hjelp av et instrument eller stemmegaffel|t=sing a correct A without the aid of an instrument or tuning fork}}
#* {{quote-book|nb|year=1973|author={{w|Finn Havrevold}}|title=Avreisen|page=127|passage=han slår énstrøken a på klaveret|t=he strikes one stroke A on the piano}}
#* {{quote-book|nb|year=1997|author={{w|Tove Nilsen}}|title=G for Georg|page=42|passage=så gal at man virkelig tror at svaler er g-nøkler og bass-nøkler og a’er og c’er som svever rundt hverandre og lager konsert i himmelen|t=so crazy that you really think swallows are g-keys and bass-keys and a's and c's floating around each other and making a concert in the sky}}
# {{lb|nb|physics}} symbol for [[ampere]]
# {{lb|nb|physics}} symbol for [[nucleon number]]
# {{lb|nb|horology}} symbol for [[avance]]
# symbol for {{l|nb|anno}}
# short form of {{l|nb|atom-}}
#: {{syn|nb|a-}}
#: {{ux|nb|a-bombe|atom bomb (a-bomb)}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|nb|a-form||a-form}}, {{l|nb|a-infinitiv||a-infinitive}}, {{l|nb|a-kjendis||A-list celebrity}}

