From Proto-Romanian, from a late {{inh|ro|VL.|*ae(t)}}, from {{inh|ro|la|habet}}.<ref>http://www.lingv.ro/RRL%201-2%202009%20Nevaci,%20Todi.pdf</ref>

====Verb====
{{ro-aux|avea|person=3s|tense=comp}}

# {{n-g|modal auxiliary}}
