# {{alt form|yol|thaaye||they}}
#* {{quote-book|yol|year=1867|title=GLOSSARY OF THE DIALECT OF FORTH AND BARGY|passage='''A''' war cowdealeen wi ooree.|translation='''They''' were scolding with one another.|page=32}}

===Etymology 5===

====Preposition====
