===Letter===
{{head|fa|letter|head='''حـ '''/''' ـحـ '''/''' ‍ـح '''/''' ‍ح'''|tr=h}}

# The eighth letter of the [[w:Perso-Arabic alphabet|Perso-Arabic alphabet]]. It is preceded by {{lang|fa|[[چ#Persian|چ]]}} and followed by {{lang|fa|[[خ#Persian|خ]]}}. Its name is {{lang|fa|حِ}} (he) or {{lang|fa|حی}} (hē).

====Usage notes====
* Most colloquial dialects in Afghanistan have lost the glottal consonants /h/ and /ʔ/. They are either deleted, replaced by /j/ or /w/ (near i/ī or u/ū), or, when proceeded by a {{m|fa|َ|t=zabar}}, replaced by the phoneme /ɑ/.

