==Arabic==

===Etymology===
Derived from {{m|ar|ح}}, and originally written as such (in {{m|en|rasm}}) by analogy with [[Nabatean]] tradition, as Nabatean cognates of Arabic words with /x/ were indiscriminately spelled using {{m|arc|𐢊|tr=ḥ}}.

