==Arabic==

===Etymology===
Derived from {{m|ar|ط}}, and originally written as such (in {{m|en|rasm}}) by analogy with [[Nabatean]] tradition, as Nabatean cognates of Arabic words with /ðˤ/ were indiscriminately spelled using {{m|arc|𐢋|tr=ṭ}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{sense|letter name}} {{ar-IPA|ظَاء}}
* {{sense|phoneme}} {{ar-IPA|ظ}}
* {{sense|Main dialectal variations}} {{IPA|ar|/ðˤ/|/dˤ/|/zˤ/}}

===Letter===
{{head|ar|letter|head='''ظ '''/''' ظ‍ '''/''' ‍ظ‍ '''/''' ‍ظ'''|tr=ẓāʔ}}

