==North Levantine Arabic==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|apc|على|tr=ʕala}} {{q|less common, but not rare, except before the article}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|apc|ar|عَلَى||on, about}} by [[haplology]] before the article {{m|ar|ال|tr=al-}}.

===Preposition===
{{head|apc|preposition}}

# {{alternative form of|apc|عَلَى|tr=ʕala}}

====Usage notes====
* Common or predominant in all contexts, especially before the definite article.
* In writing, the preposition is usually spelt as an isolated letter. However, it is commonly joined to the article, as in {{m|apc||عالبيت|tr=ʕa-l-bayt|t=to the house; home}}.

