==Arabic==

===Pronunciation===
* {{sense|letter name}} {{IPA|ar|/kaːf/}}
* {{a|ar|Kuwaiti Gulf Arabic}} {{sense|letter name}} {{IPA|ar|/kɑːf/}}
* {{sense|phoneme}} {{IPA|ar|/k/}}

===Etymology 1===
From the Nabataean letter {{m|arc-nab|𐢏|tr=k|t=kaph}}, derived from the {{der|ar|phn|-}} letter {{m|phn|𐤊|tr=k|t=kāp}}, from the {{der|ar|egy|-}} hieroglyph {{m|egy|𓂧}}. See also {{m+|syc|ܟ|tr=k|t=kāp}}, {{m+|he|כ|tr=k|t=kap}}, {{m+|grc|Κ}}, {{m+|la|K}}.

====Letter====
{{head|ar|letter|head='''ك '''/''' كـ‍ '''/''' ـ‍ك‍ـ '''/''' ـ‍ك'''|tr=kāf}}

# {{n-g|The twenty-second letter of the [[Arabic]] alphabet. It is preceded by {{l|ar|ق}} and followed by {{l|ar|ل}}.}}

=====See also=====
* {{l|ar|ڪ}}

===Etymology 2===

====Symbol====
{{head|ar|numeral symbol|head='''ك '''/''' كـ‍ '''/''' ـ‍ك‍ـ '''/''' ـ‍ك'''|tr=kāf}}

# {{n-g|The eleventh letter in traditional [[abjad]] order, which is used in place of numerals for list numbering ([[abjad numerals]]). It is preceded by {{l|ar|ى}} and followed by {{l|ar|ل}}.}}

===Etymology 3===
Cognate with {{cog|he|כ-|tr=k<sup>ə</sup>}} and {{cog|uga|𐎋}}.

====Preposition====
{{ar-prep|كَـ|tr=ka-}}

# [[like]], [[as]] {{i|followed by a genitive case}}
#: {{ux|ar|زَيْدٌ '''كَـ'''ٱلْأَسَدِ.|subst=كَ/كَ-|Zayd is '''like''' the lion.}}

=====Synonyms=====
* {{l|ar|مِثْلَ}}

=====Derived terms=====
* {{l|ar|كَذَا}}
* {{l|ar|هَٰكَذَا}}
* {{l|ar|كَهَٰذَا}}
* {{l|ar|كَذَٰلِكَ}}
* {{l|ar|كَمَا}}
* {{l|ar|كَمَنْ}}
* {{l|ar|كَأَنَّ}}
* {{l|ar|كَأَنَّمَا}}

=====See also=====
* {{l|ar|كَمَثَلِ}}

===Etymology 4===
Cognate with {{cog|he|־ך|tr=-ḵ}}.

====Pronoun====
{{head|ar|pronoun|head=ـكَ|g=m-s}} (''enclitic form of'' {{m|ar|أَنْتَ}})

# {{n-g|masculine singular bound object pronoun}}: [[you]], [[your]]
#: {{uxi|ar|لَكَ|to you, for you}}
#: {{uxi|ar|بَيْتُكَ|your (m) house)}}
#: {{uxi|ar|أُحِبُّكَ|I love you (to a male)}}

====Pronoun====
{{head|ar|pronoun|head=ـكِ|g=f-s}} (''enclitic form of'' {{m|ar|أَنْتِ}})

# {{n-g|feminine singular bound object pronoun}}: [[you]], [[your]]
#: {{l|ar|ب|بِكِ|to you}}
#: {{uxi|ar|بَيْتُكِ|your (f) house)}}
#: {{uxi|ar|أُحِبُّكِ|I love you (to a female)}}

===See also===
* {{list:Arabic script letters/ar}}
* [[w:Arabic alphabet|Wikipedia article on the Arabic alphabet]]
* [[Special:Allpages/ك|Search for entries beginning with {{lang|ar|ك}}]]
