{{Variations of letters}}
{{wikipedia|A}}
The letter “[[a]]” is subject to a wide range of variations through the addition of [[diacritic]]s, [[ligature]]s, [[capitalization]], [[punctuation]], use as a [[suffix]] or [[prefix]], and use in different [[script]]s. These include:

==Capitalization, punctuation, prefix and suffix==
{{top5}}
*[[a]] - minuscule (plain)
*[[A]] - majuscule (plain)
*[[a']]
*[[A*]]
*[[a+]]
*[[à +]]
*[[A+]]
*[[a-]]
*[[a.]]
*[[A.]]
*[[aʼ]]
*[[A−]]
*[[A-]]<!--Not the same as A− -->
*[[A♭]]
*[[A♯]]
*[['a]]
*[['a']]
*[[(A)]]
*[[-a]]
*[[-a-]]
*[[-a']]
*[[a=]]
*[[a'-]]
*[[a·-]]
*[[-ʼAʼ]]
*[[ǁʼa]]
{{bottom}}

