{{top5}}
*[[À]] - Majuscule, with [[grave]]
*[[à]] - Minuscule, with grave
*[[Ȁ]] - Majuscule, with [[double grave]]
*[[ȁ]] - Minuscule, with double grave
*[[Á]] - Majuscule, with [[acute]]
*[[á]] - Minuscule, with acute
*[[Â]] - Majuscule, with [[circumflex]]
*[[â]] - Minuscule, with circumflex
*[[Ấ]] - Majuscule, with [[circumflex and acute]]
*[[ấ]] - Minuscule, with circumflex and acute
*[[Ầ]] - Majuscule, with [[circumflex and grave]]
*[[ầ]] - Minuscule, with circumflex and grave
*[[Ẩ]] - Majuscule, with [[circumflex and hook above]]
*[[ẩ]] - Minuscule, with circumflex and hook above
