*[[ǻ]] - Minuscule, with ring above and acute
*[[Å̄]] - Majuscule, with [[ring above and macron]]
*[[å̄]] - Minuscule, with ring above and macron
*[[Ă]] - Majuscule, with [[breve]]
*[[ă]] - Minuscule, with breve
*[[Ằ]] - Majuscule, with [[grave and breve]]
*[[ằ]] - Minuscule, with grave and breve
*[[Ẵ]] - Majuscule, with [[tilde and breve]]
*[[ẵ]] - Minuscule, with tilde and breve
*[[Ẳ]] - Majuscule, with [[hook and breve]]
*[[ẳ]] - Minuscule, with hook and breve
*[[Ặ]] - Majuscule, with [[breve and dot below]]
*[[ặ]] - Minuscule, with breve and dot below
