===Etymology===
From Proto-Canaanite [[Image:Protoalef.svg|20px]], from Proto-Sinaitic [[Image:Proto-semiticA-01.svg|20px]], from {{m+|egy|𓃾}} (see {{m|egy|kꜣ}}) representing an ox head, whence the letter name {{l|phn|𐤀𐤋𐤐|t=head of cattle}}.

