==Urdu==

===Pronunciation===
* {{sense|letter name}} {{IPA|ur|/ɦəm.zɑ(ː)/}}
* {{sense|phoneme}}
** {{sense|predominate|above a vowel}} silent
** {{sense|above he}} {{IPA|ur|/jɪ/|[je]|[ji]}}
** {{sense|independent|rare}} {{IPA|ur|/ʔ/}} or silent
*** Unlike other languages using the Arabic script, Urdu does not commonly use Hamza as a glottal stop. Its primary usage is to act as a [[W:Zero consonant|zero consonant]] to allow two adjacent vowels; {{l|ur|گاؤں}}, for example, is pronounced {{IPAchar|/ɡɑː.õ/}} not {{IPAchar|/ɡɑː.ʔõ/}}.

===Letter===
{{head|ur|letter|tr='|tr2=hamza}}

