===Letter===
{{head|fa|letter|tr=alef madde}}

# alef-e madde
# â-ye bâ-kolâh ({{lang|fa|[[آی]] [[با]][[کلاه]]}} = Alef with hat)

====Usage notes====
* Used word-initially to represent the phoneme {{IPAfont|/ɑː/~/ɒː/}}. Since all word initial vowels are proceeded by a glottal stop, it is almost always pronounced as {{IPAfont|[ʔɑː]~[ʔɒː]}}. It can appear in the middle of the word, but that is uncommon and only occurs in a small number of words; such as {{l|fa|قرآن|tr=qor'ân/qur'ān}} and {{l|fa|کوآلا|tr=ko'âlâ/kō'ālā}}.

====See also====
* {{l|fa|ا}}
* [[w:Perso-Arabic alphabet|Wikipedia article on the Perso-Arabic alphabet]]
