* {{sense|letter name}} {{IPA|kk|/ja/}}
* {{sense|phoneme}} {{IPA|kk|/ə/}} {{qualifier|back}}
* {{sense|phoneme}} {{IPA|kk|/ɘ/|/i/}} {{qualifier|front}}

===Letter===
{{head|kk|letter|tr=ı, i}}

# The twenty-eighth letter of the [[Kazakh]] in Arabic Script. It represents the [[Cyrillic]] letter [[Ы]] or [[І]].

====Forms====
{{ArabForm}}

====Usage notes====
* Represents the back vowel phoneme /ə/, unless a small [[ٴ|ء]] (hamza) was placed in the beginning of the word. In Kazakh the Hamza marks that all vowels in the following word are fronted. If ى is the initial letter of a word and is representing a front vowel, it is combined with the hamza and the variant [[ٸ]] is used.

====See also====
* {{l|kk|ٸ}} (word-initial front-vowel varient)
* Previous letter: {{l|kk|ۆ}}
* Next letter: {{l|kk|ي}}
