==Arabic==

===Pronunciation===
* {{sense|phoneme}} {{IPA|ar|/v/}}

===Letter===
{{head|ar|letter|head=ڤ|}}

# {{n-g|an additional Arabic letter}}

====Usage notes====
{{l|ar|ڤ|}}, that is sometimes used to write foreign names and loanwords with the phoneme {{IPA|ar|/v/}}, is not considered a distinct letter, but a variant of {{l|ar|ف|tr=fāʔ}}. It can be written and pronounced as a {{l|ar|ف|tr=fāʔ}} instead.

====Forms====
{{ArabForm}}

====See also====
* {{l|ar|ڥ|tr=v}}
* {{l|ar|پ|tr=p}}

