* {{sense|phoneme}} {{IPA|acw|/v/}}

===Letter===
{{head|acw|letter|head=ڤ|tr=vāʔ}}

# {{l|acw|ڤ|tr=vāʔ}} (an additional Arabic letter)

====Usage notes====
{{l|acw|ڤ|tr=vāʔ}} is not considered a distinct letter, but a variant of {{l|acw|ف|tr=fāʔ}} that is sometimes used to write foreign names and loanwords with the phoneme /v/. It can be written and pronounced as a {{l|acw|ف|tr=fāʔ}} instead.

====Forms====
{{ArabForm}}

====See also====
{{l|acw|پ|tr=pāʔ}}

