==Hindi==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|hi|-अण||in the vicinity of {{l|sa|र}} and {{l|sa|ष}}}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{hi-IPA}}

===Etymology 1===
{{bor+|hi|sa|-अन}}, from {{der|hi|ine-pro|*-nós|*-onom|pos=verbal noun suffix}}. {{doublet|hi|-ना}}.

====Suffix====
{{hi-suffix}}

# {{n-g|forms [[Sanskritic]] nouns of either gender indicating agent nouns, abstract nouns, tool or means, or location}}
#: {{suffixusex|hi|पराग|परागण|t1=pollen|t2=pollination}}
#: {{suffixusex|hi|बरतना|बर्तन|t1=to make use of|t2=pot, vessel}}
#: {{suffixusex|hi|ऐंठना|ऐंठन|t1=to be twisted|t2=a twist, tension}}

=====Declension=====
{{hi-ndecl|<M>}}
{{hi-ndecl|<F>}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{suffixsee|hi}}

===Etymology 2===
{{bor+|hi|fa-cls|ـًا|tr=-an}}, from {{bor|hi|ar|ـًا|tr=-an|pos=[[triptotic]] indefinite accusative ending}}.

====Suffix====
{{hi-suffix}}

# {{n-g|forms [[adverbs]] from [[Perso-Arabic]] terms}}
#: {{suffixusex|hi|ऐहतियात|ऐहतियातन|t1=precaution|t2=precautionarily}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{suffixsee|hi|id=adverbial}}

[[Category:Hindi noun-forming suffixes]]

==Sanskrit==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|sa|-अण||in the vicinity of {{l|sa|र}} and {{l|sa|ष}}}}

===Alternative scripts===
{{sa-alt}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|sa|ine-pro|*-onom}}, from {{m|ine-pro|*-o-|pos=thematic vowel}} + {{m|ine-pro|*-nós|*-nom|pos=verbal noun suffix}}. Cognate with {{cog|gem-pro|*-aną}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{sa-IPA}}

===Suffix===
{{head|sa|suffix|g1=n|g2=m|cat2=noun-forming suffixes}}

# {{senseid|sa|agent}}{{non-gloss|forms [[masculine]] agent [[noun]]s}}
#: {{suffixusex|sa|गम्|alt1=सम् + गम्|संगमन|t1=to gather|t2=gatherer}}
#: {{suffixusex|sa|दृप्|दर्पण|t1=to become/make proud|t2=mirror < proud-maker}}
# {{senseid|sa|abstract}}{{non-gloss|forms [[neuter]] [[noun]]s denoting}}
## {{non-gloss|verbal abstracta}}
##: {{suffixusex|sa|कृ|करण|t1=to do, make|t2=(act of) doing}}
##: {{suffixusex|sa|मृ|मरण|t1=to die|t2=death}}
## {{senseid|sa|tool}}{{non-gloss|tool or means}}
##: {{suffixusex|sa|ईक्ष्|ईक्षण|t1=to observe|t2=eye}}
##: {{suffixusex|sa|वस्|वसन|t1=to dress|t2=garment}}
##: {{suffixusex|sa|स्कम्भ्|स्कम्भन|t1=to support|t2=pillar}}
## {{senseid|sa|location}}{{non-gloss|location}}
##: {{suffixusex|sa|स्था|स्थान|t1=to stand|t2=place}}
##: {{suffixusex|sa|यज्|यजन|t1=to sacrifice|t2=sacrificial site}}

====Usage notes====
The vowel of the root generally takes the {{m|sa|गुण}} degree, but sometimes takes the {{m|sa|वृद्धि}} degree.

====Declension====
{{sa-decl-noun-m}}
{{sa-decl-noun-n}}

====Derived terms====
{{suffixsee|sa}}

====Descendants====
* {{desc|inc-pra|-𑀅𑀡}}
** {{desc|bn|-না|-অনা}}
** {{desc|hi|-ना}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:sa:Wackernagel|vol=II.2|pages=180-206}}
