|{{lang|ar|[[ى]]}}
|ā ī
|{{IPAfont|a}} {{IPAfont|i}}
|Only used in final position. The use for {{IPAchar|[i]}} is the norm in the Nile Valley, but is spelled as ي in other regions.
|-
|{{lang|ar|[[ء]]}}
|ʔ
|{{IPAfont|ʔ}}
| Only pronounced as a glottal stop.
