|{{lang|ar|ـَ}}
|a
|{{IPAfont|a}}
| Realized as {{IPAchar|[æ]}} in normal environments, but as {{IPAchar|[ɑ]}} when subject to emphasis spreading. Diacritics are normally not used.
|-
|{{lang|ar|ا}}
|ā
|{{IPAfont|aː}}
| Realized as {{IPAchar|[æ(ː)]}} in normal environments, but as {{IPAchar|[ɑ(ː)]}} when subject to emphasis spreading. Shortened in unstressed syllables.
|-
|{{lang|ar|ـُ}}
