|{{IPAfont|i}} {{IPAfont|e}}
| Often realised as {{IPAchar|[e]}}. Diacritics are normally not used.
|-
|{{lang|ar|ـو}}
|aw or ō
|{{IPAfont|aw}} or {{IPAfont|oː}}
| {{IPAfont|oː}} is shortened to {{IPAchar|[o]}} in unstressed syllables.
|-
|{{lang|ar|ـُو}}
|ū
|{{IPAfont|uː}}
| Diacritics are normally not used.
|-
|{{lang|ar|ـی}}
|ay or ē
|{{IPAfont|aj}} or {{IPAfont|eː}}
|{{IPAfont|eː}} is shortened to {{IPAchar|[e]}} in unstressed syllables.
|-
|{{lang|ar|ـِی}}
|ī
|{{IPAfont|i}}
