Equivalent to {{af|fa|دار|tr1=dâr|pos1=present stem of {{m|fa|داشتن|tr=dâštan|t=to have}}|ـا|tr2=-â}}, from {{inh|fa|pal||tr=YHSNN'k'|ts=dārāg}}.

