! colspan="2" | plural
| tí + ''stem'' + u
| {{lang|ajp|تدرسوا}} ('''tú'''drus'''u''')
| t + ''stem'' + u
| {{lang|ajp|تعلّموا}} ('''t'''ʕállim'''u''')
|-
! rowspan="2" | 1st
! colspan="2" | singular
| ʔá + ''stem''
| {{lang|ajp|أدرس}} ('''ʔá'''drus)
| ʔa + ''stem''
| {{lang|ajp|أعلّم}} ('''ʔa'''ʕállim)
|-
! colspan="2" | plural
| ní + ''stem''
| {{lang|ajp|ندرس}} ('''nú'''drus)
| n + ''stem''
| {{lang|ajp|نعلّم}} ('''n'''ʕállim)
|}
* The prefix is stressed in regular and defective verbs in form I and IV, otherwise always unstressed.
* The vowel '''i''' in stressed prefixes assimilates to '''u''', if the stem also has the vowel '''u'''.
* The forms of 3rd person feminine and 2nd person masculine are identical.

===Present tense===
