* Word final short vowels are usually shown proceeding a {{l|fa|ه|tr=hē}}

* The diacritic zēr is often realized as {{ic|[ɛ]}} in many nonstandard dialects outside of Kabul, such as the Herati dialect. However, it is {{ic|/ɪ/}} in standard pronunciation and in the Kabuli dialect. 

