==Persian==

===Etymology===
From {{af|fa|کاو<tr:kâv><pos:present stem of {{m|fa|کاویدن|tr=kâvidan|gloss=to [[burrow]], to [[dig]], to [[search]] [[deeply]], to [[investigate]]}}>|ـاک<tr:-âk><pos:suffix that forms the active participle from the present verb stem>}}.{{ref|{{R:fa:Dehkhoda}}}} The suffix is an alternative form of {{m|fa|ـا|tr=-â}}, which originates from {{der|fa|pal|-ʾk'|ts=-āg}}.{{ref|{{R:pal:Mackenzie:1971|āg|page=6}}}}

Alternatively, it may be from {{der|fa|trk}}.<ref>{{R:fa:Monchi-Zadeh:1990|page=210 A. 42}}</ref>

