====Diacritics====

=====Nuqtā=====
The {{l|sd|़|sc=Deva}} ({{lang|sd|[[नुक़्ता]]}}, [[nuqta|nuqtā]]) diacritic describes sounds not found in Sanskrit, and therefore not represented by standard Devanagari. Most of these sounds are found in Persian and English loanwords.

