==Punjabi==

===Etymology===
From {{af|pa|ان-|مُلّ|ا|pos2=value, price|tr1=-an}}. Compare {{cog|ur|اَنْمول}} / {{cog|hi|अनमोल}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|pa|/ənᵊ.mʊl.läː/|a=pa}}

===Adjective===
{{pa-adj|sha=اَنْمُلّا|tr=anmullā}}

# {{lb|pa|Pakistan}} [[priceless]], [[invaluable]]

====Declension====
{{pa-decl-adj|ਅਨਮੁੱਲ|anmull}}
