===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|nl|dum|ende}}, from {{inh|nl|odt|ande}}, {{m|odt|inde}}, from {{inh|nl|gem-pro|*andi}}, from {{der|nl|ine-pro|*h₂entí}}.

