* {{rhymes|lb|ən|s=1}}
* {{audio|lb|Lb-en.ogg}}

===Article===
{{head|lb|articles|g=m|g2=n}}

# Indefinite article; [[a]], [[an]]
#: {{ux|lb|Ech droen '''en''' Hutt wann et reent.|I wear '''a''' hat when it rains.|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|lb|Hues du '''e''' bloe Stëft?|Do you have '''a''' blue pen?|inline=1}}

====Declension====
{{lb-decl-indefinite article}}

===Pronoun===
{{head|lb|pronouns|cat2=personal pronouns}}

# {{form of|lb|unstressed form|hien}}
