# {{form of|lb|unstressed form|hinnen}}
#: {{ux|lb|Ech hunn et '''e''' gesot.|I told it '''them'''|inline=1}}

====Usage notes====
* Due to the [[w:Eifeler Regel|Eifel Rule]], the final -n is lost when the following word begins with a consonant other than <nowiki><d>, <h>, <n>, <t> or <z></nowiki>.

