# {{non-gloss definition|Evidential suffix, second-hand information. Indicates that the speaker has not directly experienced the information at hand; hearsay}}
#: {{uxi|qu|'''Qusqumantas''' [[kay|ka]]nki.|(They say that) you are '''from Cusco'''.}}
#: {{uxi|qu|Inisqa [[qayna]] '''[[ñaña]]ntas''' [[watukuy|watuku]]sqan.|Inez visited '''her sister''' yesterday (so I heard).}}

