# {{spelling of|ms|Arabic|tu|t=[[that]] {{gloss|that thing}}}}

==Persian==

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|fa|pal|𐭫𐭪|sc=Phli|tr=LK|ts=tō|t=you, thou}}, from {{inh|fa|peo|-}} (compare {{m|peo|𐎬𐎺𐎶|tr=tuvam}}), from {{inh|fa|ira-pro|*tuHám}} (compare {{cog|kmr|tu}}, {{cog|ps|ته|tr=tə}}, {{cog|ae|𐬙𐬏𐬨|tr=tūm}}), from {{inh|fa|iir-pro|*túH|*tuHám}}, from {{inh|fa|ine-pro|*túh₂}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{fa-IPA|tū|cls=tū,tō|ir=tu}}
* {{audio|fa|Fa-تو.ogg|a=Iran}}

====Pronoun====
{{fa-regional|تو|تو|ту}}
{{head|fa|pronoun|tr=to}}

# [[you]], [[thou]] {{qualifier|informal, singular}}
# {{lb|fa|generally with following {{l|fa|را}}}} [[you]], [[thee]]
# {{lb|fa|at the end of an [[ezafe]]}} [[your]], [[thy]]

=====Usage notes=====
* The form {{l|fa|تو را|tr=to râ}} may be contracted into {{l|fa|ترا|tr=torâ}}. In Iranian Persian and Tajik, both forms are pronounced the same regardless.
* some dialects use all regional pronunciations interchangeably

=====See also=====
{{fa-personal pronouns}}
{{prs-personal pronouns}}

====See also====
* {{l|fa|شما|tr=formal, polite, and grammatically plural}}

===Etymology 2===
{{rfe|fa}}

====Pronunciation====
* {{IPA|fa|/tuː/}}

====Noun====
{{fa-noun|tr=tav, tow}} {{tlb|fa|archaic}}

# [[pool]], [[puddle]]

===Etymology 3===
{{rfe|fa}}

====Noun====
{{fa-noun|tr=tô}} {{tlb|fa|archaic}}

# [[fold]], [[twist]], [[turn]]

===Etymology 4===
{{rfe|fa}}

====Pronunciation====
* {{IPA|fa|/tuː/}}

====Noun====
{{fa-noun|tr=tu}}

# {{lb|fa|Iran|or|rare}} [[inside]]; [[interior]]
# {{lb|fa|In some dialects as Luri}} room, especially an outdoor room (Synonymous with {{l|fa|اتاق|tr=otâq, otâq}} which is of Turkic origin)

====Preposition====
{{head|fa|preposition|tr=tu}}

# {{lb|fa|Iran|or|rare}} [[in]]; [[inside]]
#: {{syn|fa|در|tr=dar}}
#* {{quote-song|fa|year=2023|artist=علیرضا طلیسچی|title=پاقدم
|passage= تو رفتی ولی فکر تو، '''تو''' سر من موند / همیشه نبودت من و قلبمو ترسوند|tr=to rafti vali fekr-e to '''tu''' sar-e man mund / hamiše nabudet man o qalbamo tarsund|t=you left but the thought of you remained '''in''' my head / your absence always scared me and my heart}}

=====Usage notes=====
* May be construed with or without ezafe.

====Adverb====
{{head|fa|adverb|tr=tu}}

# {{lb|fa|Iran|or|rare}} [[inside]]

====Adjective====
{{fa-adj|tr=tu}}

# {{lb|fa|Iran|or|rare}} [[within]]; [[interior]]; [[inner]]
#: {{syn|fa|در|tr=dar}}

