#: {{suffixusex|he|שְׁאֵלָה|tr1=sh'elá|t1=a question|שְׁאֵלוֹן|tr2=sh'elón|t2=a questionnaire}}
# {{senseid|he|tools suffix}} {{non-gloss definition|A suffix indicating tools.}}
