==Mozarabic==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|mxi|la|inde||thence}}. Compare {{cog|fr|en|pos=adverb, pronoun}} and  {{cog|it|ne|pos=adverb, pronoun}}.

===Pronoun===
{{head|mxi|pronoun}}

# of [[that]], of [[him]], of [[her]]
#* {{Q|mxi||H24|refn=<ref>{{R:mxi:CorrienteHeb|289}}</ref>|quote=ת'''ן''' שבדיד ונארי|tr=t'''n''' šbdyd wn'ry|trans=I'll know how to give you some '''of it'''}}

===Notes===
Corriente takes ⟨n⟩ to represent a Mozarabic ''en''. His translation also depends on interpreting ⟨šbdy⟩ as a textual corruption for *⟨šbry⟩, hence Mozarabic *''šabréy'' 'I will know [how]'.

===References===
<references/>

==Yiddish==

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|yi|gmh|-en}}, a merger of various terminations in {{inh|yi|goh|-}} reflecting different conjugational patterns, namely {{m|goh|-an}}, {{m|goh|-ien}}, {{m|goh|-on}}, {{m|goh|-en}}, and {{m|goh|-non}}, respectively from {{inh|yi|gem-pro|*-aną}}, {{m|gem-pro|*-janą}}, {{m|gem-pro|*-ōną}}, {{m|gem-pro|*-āną}}, and {{m|gem-pro|*-naną}}.

====Alternative forms====
* {{alt|yi|־ען|q1=often used with Slavic borrowings}}

====Suffix====
{{head|yi|suffix}}

# {{non-gloss definition|The infinitive marker for verbs, which can be appended to a noun or adjective that means ''X'' to create a verb that means ''"to make X"'' or ''"to do X"''}}

=====Derived terms=====
* {{l|yi|־עווען}}
{{suffixsee|yi}}

===Etymology 2===
Compare {{cog|de|-en}}, {{cog|nl|-en}}.

====Suffix====
{{head|yi|suffix}}

# {{non-gloss definition|A plural marker for regular nouns not ending in an unstressed ־ר (''-r''), ־ם (''-m''), ־ן (''-n''), or a vowel.}}

=====See also=====
* {{l|yi|־ס}}

===Etymology 3===
A merger of the nasal inflectional endings of nouns and adjectives of {{der|yi|gmh|-}}: {{m|gmh|-en}}, {{m|gmh|-em}}.

====Suffix====
{{head|yi|suffix}}

# {{non-gloss definition|Used to indicate the [[dative]] and [[accusative]] in the masculine form of adjectives and masculine declined nouns, and the dative in the neuter form of adjectives and feminine declined nouns.}}

===Etymology 4===
From {{der|yi|he|־ָן|tr=-án}}.

====Suffix====
{{head|yi|suffix|g=m}}, ''plural'' {{l-bold|yi|־נים|tr=-onem}}

# {{non-gloss definition|Used to form nouns denoting people of a certain profession or who perform certain habitual actions.}}

===Etymology 5===

====Suffix====
{{head|yi|suffix}}

# {{n-g|Regular termination of the first-person plural present indicative form of verbs.}}
# {{n-g|Regular termination of the third-person plural present indicative form of verbs.}}
