#: {{ux|ajp|[[إذا]] [[شوفير]] [[تكسي|التكسي]] [[حسّ]][[ك]] [[جديد]] [[في]] [[بلد|البلد]]، [[يمكن]] [[كان]] [[استغلّ|يستغلّك]].|tr=iza šufēr it-taksi '''ḥass'''ak jdīd fi il-balad, yumken kān yistaḡellak.|t=If the taxi driver '''sensed''' that you were new in town, maybe he would take advantage of you.}}
# {{ajp-cprep|[[مع]] or [[في]]}} to [[feel for]], to [[sympathize]]
