===Etymology===
{{affix|ar|تُرُْنْج|ـَان|t1=citron}} because it resembles the citron olfactorily and texturally.<!-- ترنگان turungân looks like a ghost word by which Persian lexicographers explain the Arabic, and also according to Expiración García Sánchez Ciencias de la naturaleza en al-Andalus p. 189 the Arabic ترنجان is from Arabic ترنج-->

