===Noun===
{{ota-noun|tr=kalkan}}

# [[shield]], especially a [[rondache]] or [[roundshield]], a [[circular]] [[shield]] made of [[fig]]-[[wood]] [[covered]] with [[cord]]s
#: {{syn|ota|ترس|t1=türs|درقه|tr2=daraka|سپر|t3=siper}}

