==Assyrian Neo-Aramaic==

===Etymology===
Cognate with {{cog|he|־ָן|tr=-án}} and {{cog|ar|ـَان}}. {{rfe|aii}}.

===Suffix===
{{aii-suffix|-ܵܢܵܐ|g=m-s|f=-ܵܢܝܼܬܵܐ|pl=-ܵܢܹ̈ܐ}}

# {{senseid|aii|forming nouns or adjectives}} [[-er]], [[-ic]], [[-y]]: {{n-g|suffix forming nouns and adjectives denoting having the properties of the noun the suffix is attached to}}
#: {{afex|aii|ܫܹܐܕ݂ܵܐ|t1=demon|-ܢܐ|tr2=-ānā|ܫܹܐܕ݂ܵܢܵܐ<t:'''having''' a demon, demon'''ic'''>}}
#: {{afex|aii|ܡܲܝ̈ܵܐ|t1=water|-ܢܐ|tr2=-ānā|ܡܲܝܵܢܵܐ<t:'''having''' water, water'''y'''>}}
