From {{inh|sv|non|-an}}.

====Suffix====
{{head|sv|suffix}}

# {{senseid|sv|verbal noun}} {{n-g|making a noun from a verb, similar to {{m|sv|-ing}} and {{m|sv|-ning}}, having ''-ningar'' as the plural.}}
#: {{suffixusex|sv|predika|t1=to preach|predikan|t2=a sermon}}

===Etymology 2===
Ultimately from {{der|sv|la|-anus}}.

====Suffix====
{{head|sv|suffix}}

# {{l|en|-an}}; {{n-g|making a noun, describing a person by belief or nationality}}
