* {{gloss|suggesting degree}} {{l|en|-some}}
* {{gloss|likeness or resemblance}} {{l|en|-oid}}, {{l|en|quasi-}}, {{l|en|para-}}, {{l|en|-form}}/{{l|en|-iform}}, {{l|en|-esque}}, {{l|en|-some}}, {{lb|en|restricted to casual registers}} {{l|en|-ass|id=resembling}}, {{qualifier|forms adjectives from nouns only}} {{l|en|-like}}

