===Noun===
{{head|az|noun}}

# {{spelling of|az|Arabic|işan}}

==Chagatai==

===Etymology===
{{bor+|chg|fa-cls|ایشَان|t=they}}.<ref>{{cite-book|title=Islam|editor=Yijiu JIN|year=2017|url=https://books.google.com/books?id=Q-PzDQAAQBAJ|pages=234–235}}</ref>

===Noun===
{{head|chg|noun}}

# [[ishan]]

====Descendants====
