==Persian==

===Etymology===
Colloquial contraction of {{m|fa|اِی|tr=ī}} + {{m|fa|سو|tr=sū}} both of which are colloquial pronunciations of {{m|fa|این|tr=īn}} and {{m|fa|سوی|tr=sōy}} respectively.

