==Bashkir==
[[File:Broth.jpg|thumb|Һурпа (sense 2)]]

===Etymology===
Ultimately from {{der|ba|fa|شوربا|tr=šurbâ||a kind of soup}}, compound of {{m|fa|شور|tr=šur||salty}} and {{m|fa|با|tr=bâ||soup}}.

The development of initial ''h-'' in Bashkir remains to be explained.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|ba|[hurˈpɑ]}}
* {{hyphenation|ba|һур|па}}

===Noun===
{{ba-noun}}

# [[broth]], [[bouillon]]
#: {{ux|ba|Тауыҡ '''һурпаһы'''.|translation=Chicken '''stock'''.}}
#: {{ux|ba|Ҡайнап торған '''һурпаға''' кесерткән япрағын, ҡыҙҙырылған йәшелсәләрҙе, йәшел һуғанды өҫтәп, 20-25 минут ҡайнатығыҙ.|translation=Add nettle leaves, fried vegetables, green onion '''to''' the boiling '''broth''', and boil it for 20-25 minutes.}}
