Page 25 دو تا هندوانه را با یک دست برداشتن: -------- begin text --------
==Persian==

===Alternative forms===
Various forms exist, with {{m|fa|[[سه]] [[تا]]|tr=se tâ||three}} or {{m|fa|[[چند]] [[تا]]|tr=čand tâ||several}} instead of {{m|fa|[[دو]] [[تا]]|tr=do tâ||two}}, {{m|fa|با هم|tr=bâ ham||together, at the same time}} instead of {{m|fa|[[با]] [[یک]] [[دست]]|tr=bâ yek dast||using one hand}} and {{m|fa|بلند کردن|tr=boland kardan||to lift, to pick up}} instead of {{m|fa|برداشتن|tr=bardâštan||to pick up}}.

===Verb===
{{fa-verb|tr=do tâ hendevâne râ bâ yek dast bardâštan|pres=دو تا هندوانه را با یک دست بردار}}

# {{lb|fa|literally}} to pick up or lift two [[watermelon]]s using one hand
# {{lb|fa|idiomatic}} to start or try to do two difficult tasks simultaneously and not to succeed in either one
