==Persian==

===Etymology 1===
{{clipping|fa|اندرون|tr=andarun}}, from {{inh|fa|pal||tr=ʾndlwn'|ts=andarōn|t=inside, within|sc=Phlv}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{fa-IPA|da`rūn}}

====Noun====
{{fa-noun|tr=darun}}

# [[interior]], [[inside]], [[inner]], [[inward]], [[bowels]], [[core]], [[heart]]

=====Descendants=====
* {{desc|ota|درون|tr=derun|bor=1}}
* {{desc|kmr|derûn|bor=1}}

====Preposition====
{{head|fa|preposition|tr=darun}} {{lb|fa|chiefly with {{m|fa|با|tr=bâ}}, but also other prepositions or none}}

# [[in]], [[inside]]
# [[amongst]], [[within]], [[between]]
# [[into]], [[directionally]] [[inside]]

====Adverb====
{{head|fa|adverb|tr=darun}}

# [[inside]], from the [[inner]]

====Related terms====
* {{l|fa|درونه|tr=darune}}

===Etymology 2===
From {{inh|fa|pal||tr=dlwn'|ts=drōn|t=consecrated bread; a kind of ritual in which consecrated bread is used|sc=Phlv}}, also attested in  {{cog|syc|ܕܪܘܢ|tr=drōn|t=consecrated bread; a kind of ritual in which consecrated bread is used}} and a derivative  {{m|syc|ܕܪܘܢܝܐ|tr=drōnāyyā|t=a kind of attendant serving sacred bread}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{fa-IPA|du`rūn|cls=da`rūn,du`rūn}}

====Noun====
{{fa-noun|tr=dorun}}

# {{C|fa|Units of measure|Breads}} a kind of [[dry measure|corn measure]]
# {{C|fa|Zoroastrianism}} a certain [[ritual]] by the [[Zoroastrian]]s {{rfclarify|fa}}

===References===
* {{R:CAL|drwn|N}}
** {{R:CAL|drwny)|N}}
* {{R:syc:Ciancaglini|url=https://sedra.bethmardutho.org/lexeme/get/9086|page=156}}
* {{R:fa:Steingass|page=515}}
* {{R:fa:Vullers|L|I|page=837}}
* {{R:fa:Wolff:1935|pages=376–377}}
* {{R:fa:Wolff:1991|page=99}}
