{{dum-noun|head=bêen|n}}

# [[leg]]
# [[foot]]
# [[bone]]

====Inflection====
{{rfinfl|dum|noun}}

====Alternative forms====
* {{l|dum|bein}} {{q|Limburgish}}

====Descendants====
* {{desctree|nl|been}}
* {{desc|li|bein}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:VMNW|ID85581}}
