===Etymology 2===
From {{der|enm|fro|-}} and {{der|enm|ML.|-}}, from {{der|enm|ar|بَان||ben tree}}.

====Noun====
{{head|enm|noun}}

# [[ben]] {{gl|moringa tree}}

=====Descendants=====
* {{desc|en|ben}}

====References====
* {{R:MED Online|bēn|n|MED4047}}

===Etymology 3===
From {{inh|enm|ang|bēon}}, nominative plural form of {{m|enm|bēo}}, from {{inh|enm|gem-pro|*bijōniz}}, nominative plural form of {{m|gem-pro|*bijǭ}}. Equivalent to {{af|enm|bee|-en|pos2=plural suffix|id2=noun plural}}.

====Noun====
{{head|enm|noun form}}

# {{plural of|enm|bee||bee}}

===Etymology 4===
From {{inh|enm|ang|ġebēon}}, past participle of {{m|ang|bēon|t=to be}}; equivalent to {{af|enm|y-|be|-en|id3=participial|pos3=participial suffix}}.

====Alternative forms====
* {{alter|enm|ybeen|ybe}}

====Verb====
{{head|enm|verb form}}

# {{senseid|enm|participle}} {{past participle of|enm|been|t=to be|id=to be}}

=====Descendants=====
* {{desc|en|been}}
* {{desc|sco|been}}

===Etymology 5===
From (with the ''-þ'' replaced with an ''-n'' leveled in from the past and subjunctive) {{inh|enm|ang|bēoþ}}, present plural of {{m|ang|bēon|t=to be}}, from {{inh|enm|gem-pro|*biunþi}}, third-person present plural of {{m|gem-pro|*beuną|t=to be, become}}.

====Alternative forms====
* {{alter|enm|be}}

====Verb====
{{head|enm|verb form}}

# {{inflection of|enm|been||p|pres|ind|t=to be|id=to be}}

=====Usage notes=====
The usual plural form of {{m|enm|been}} is {{m|enm|aren}} in the North, '''''been''''' in the Midlands, and {{m|enm|beth}} in the South; {{m|enm|sind}} also existed, especially early on, but was not the predominant form in any area.

=====Descendants=====
* {{desc|en|been}} {{q|obsolete as the plural}}

===Etymology 6===
From {{inh|enm|ang|bēon}}, present subjunctive plural of {{m|ang|bēon|t=to be}}, from {{inh|enm|gem-pro|*biwīn}}, third-person present subjunctive plural of {{m|gem-pro|*beuną|t=to be, become}}.

====Verb====
{{head|enm|verb form}}

# {{inflection of|enm|been||p|pres|sub|t=to be|id=to be}}

=====Descendants=====
* {{desc|en|be}}
* {{desc|sco|be}}

===Etymology 7===

====Noun====
{{enm-noun|beenes|pl2=beenen}}

# {{alt form|enm|bene||bean}}

{{c|enm|Brassicales order plants}}

