===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|nl|dum|roof}}, from {{inh|nl|odt|*rōf}}, {{m|odt|*rouf}}, from {{inh|nl|gmw-pro|*raub}}, from {{inh|nl|gem-pro|*raubaz}}. More at {{l|en|robe}}.

