===Etymology 2===
{{dercat|nl|odt|gem-pro|ine-pro|inh=2}}
From {{inh|nl|dum|rōve}}. Cognate with {{cog|goh|ruf}} ({{cog|lb|Roff}}), {{cog|non|hrufa}} ({{cog|en|dandruff}}). Ultimately from {{der|nl|ine-pro|*krewp-}}.

