===Etymology===
From {{inh|af|nl|pan}}, from {{inh|af|dum|panne}}, from {{inh|af|odt|*panna}}, from {{der|af|la|panna}}, contraction of {{m|la|patina}}. The sense “lake, pond” is likely borrowed from or influenced by {{der|af|en|pan}}.

