==Arabic==

===Etymology 1===
Compare with {{cog|he|בֵּין|tr=béin}}, {{cog|arc|𐡁𐡉𐡍|ts=bēn}}, {{cog|uga|𐎁𐎐}}, {{cog|gez|በይነ}}, {{cog|sem-srb|𐩨𐩺𐩬}}, {{m|sem-srb|𐩨𐩬}}. Synchronically like an {{adverbial accusative|ar|بَيْن|t=interstice|nocap=1}} from the root {{ar-root|ب ي ن}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|بَيْنَ}}
* {{audio|ar|Ar-بين.ogg}}
** {{IPA|acw|/beːn/|[be̞ːn]|a=Hijazi}}

====Preposition====
{{ar-prep|بَيْنَ}}

# {{l|en|between|gloss=in the position or interval that separates two things}}
#: {{ux|ar|بَيْنِي وَبَيْنَكَ|tr=baynī wa-bayna-ka|t=between me and you|inline=t}}

=====Inflection=====
{{ar-prep-auto|بَيْنَ}}

=====Derived terms=====
* {{l|ar|مِنْ بَيْنِ}}
* {{l|ar|بَيْنَمَا}}
* {{l|ar|بَيْنَ بَيْنَ}}
* {{l|ar|بَيْنَا}}
* {{l|ar|بَيْنَ يَدَيْ}}

