* {{l|ary|بين بين|tr=bayn bayn, bīn bīn}}

===Etymology 2===
{{ary-rootbox|ب ي ن}}
From {{inh|ary|ar|بَيَّنَ}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{IPA|ary|/bij.jan/}}

====Verb====
{{ary-verb|II|tr=biyyan|np=يبين|nptr=ybiyyan}}

# to make clear, to [[explain]], to [[outline]], to [[illustrate]]

=====Conjugation=====
{{ary-conj-fiʕʕal-yfiʕʕal|ب|ي|ن|b|y|n}}

==South Levantine Arabic==

===Etymology 1===
{{Wiktionary:Picture dictionary/ajp:prep-place}}
From {{inh|ajp|ar|بَيْنَ}}.

====Alternative forms====
* {{alter|ajp|بينات|tr=bēnāt}}

====Pronunciation====
* {{ajp-IPA|bēn<p:beːn>}}
* {{audio|ajp|LL-Q55633582 (ajp)-MahmoudM (AdrianAbdulBaha)-بين.wav|a=Jerusalem}}

====Preposition====
{{ajp-prep|tr=bēn}}

# [[between]] {{q|in the position or interval that separates two things}}
#: {{ux|ajp|[[فيه]] [[خلاف]] [[بين]][[ي]] [[و]][[بين]][[ك]].|tr=fīh ḵilāf '''bēn'''i u-'''bēn'''ak|t=There is a disagreement '''between''' us.}}
#: {{ux|ajp|[[حطّ]][[ه]] [[بين]] [[باب|الباب]] [[و]][[شبّاك|الشبّاك]].|tr=ḥaṭṭo '''bēn''' il-bāb w-iš-šubbāk|t=I've placed it '''between''' the door and the window.}}

=====Usage notes=====
* {{m-self|ajp|بين|tr=bēn}} may be repeated if the second part is a pronoun.

=====Inflection=====
{{ajp-prep-inflection
|base={{l-self|ajp|بين|tr=bēn}}
|1s={{l|ajp|بيني|tr=bēni}}
|2ms={{l|ajp|بينك|tr=bēnak}}
|2fs={{l|ajp|بينك|tr=bēnek}}
|3ms={{l|ajp|بينه|tr=bēno}}
|3fs={{l|ajp|بينها|tr=bēnha}}
|1p={{l|ajp|بينّا|tr=bēnna}}
|2p={{l|ajp|بينكم|tr=bēnkom}}
|3p={{l|ajp|بينهم|tr=bēnhom}}
}}

===Etymology 2===
{{ajp-root|ب ي ن}}
From {{inh|ajp|ar|بَيَّنَ}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{ajp-IPA|bayyan<p:ˈbaj.jan>}}
* {{audio|ajp|LL-Q55633582 (ajp)-Khalil.rantissi-بَيَّن.wav|a=al-Lidd}}

====Verb====
{{ajp-verb|head=بيّن|II|tr=bayyan|pres=ببيّن|prestr=bibayyen}}

# to [[appear]], to be [[visible]]
#: {{syn|ajp|ظهر|tr=ẓahar|بان|tr2=bān}}
#: {{ux|ajp|[[هادي]] [[أوّل]] [[مرّة]] [[عرف|بعرف]] [[إنّه]] [[بحر|البحر]] [[ممكن]] [[بيّن|يبيّن]] [[من]] [[رام الله]].|tr=hādi ʔawwal marra baʕref ʔinno il-baḥr mumkin '''ybayyen''' min rām-allah|t=This is the first time I know that the sea '''could be seen''' from Ramallah.}}
#: {{ux|ajp|[[ليش]] [[ما]] [[عمّ]] [[بيّن|بتبيّن]]؟|tr=lēš mā ʕamm '''bitbayyen'''|t=Why don't we see you anymore?|lit=Why aren't you '''being visible'''?}}
#: {{ux|ajp|[[ما]] [[حبّ|بحبّ]] [[بيّن|أبيّن]].|tr=mā baḥebb '''abayyen'''|t=I don't like to be conspicuous.|lit=I don't like to be visible.}}

=====Conjugation=====
{{ajp-conj/2A|ب|ي|ن|b|y|n}}
