Professional noun from {{m|aii|ܒܵܢܹܐ|t=to build}}; compare {{cog|ar|بَانٍ}} and {{cog|he|בַּנַּאי|tr=banái}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{IPA|aii|[bannaːjaː]|a=Standard}}

