{{aii-noun|ܒܲܢܵܝܵܐ|m|f=ܒܲܢܵܝܬܵܐ|pl=ܒܲܢܵܝܹ̈ܐ}}

# [[builder]], [[constructor]] {{gloss|worker who constructs or repairs houses or develops a particular thing}}

