==Arabic==

===Etymology 1===
{{denominal verb|ar|إِبَّان|t=time}}.

====Verb====
{{ar-verb|II}}

# to [[eulogize]], to pay [[homage]] to a [[dead]] person, to [[commemorate]] the times of
# {{lb|ar|obsolete}} to be on the tracks of, to follow the [[trace]]s of
# {{lb|ar|obsolete}} to watch, to observe, to wait for

