{{denominal verb|ar|بَنَّة|t=odour in particular from lodging-places due to cattle}}, or a previous meaning “ground” of {{m|ar|بُنّ|id=coffee}}, {{cog|acx|بُون|tr=būn|t=origin, root}}.

