==Persian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|fa|پارسیوان|فارسی بان|فارسیوان}}

===Etymology===
{{uncertain|fa}}. But possibly from {{der|fa|ps|پارسیوان|tr=pârsiwân}}, especially as {{m|prs|پارسی|tr=pārsī}} is generally less common than {{m|prs|فارسی|tr=fārsī}} in Persian, so this term being predominantly spelt with a {{m|prs|پ}} would be unusual if not from Pashto.

===Pronunciation===
{{fa-IPA|pārsī bān}}

===Noun===
{{fa-noun|tr=pārsī bān}} {{tlb|fa|Dari}}

# A [[Persian]] [[speaker]] {{gl|from Afghanistan, i.e. A [[Dari]] speaker}}

===Adjective===
{{fa-adj|tr=pārsī bān}} {{tlb|fa|Dari}}

# [[Persian]]/[[Dari]] [[speaking]] 

===Further reading===
* {{R:wp|fa|پارسیوان}}
* {{R:prs:Bulkin|page=68}}
