==Arabic==

===Root===
{{ar-root}}

# related to getting [[close]] to something and [[shape|shaping]] therewith

====Derived terms====
{{ar-verb forms|I=to pare, to cut into form|I-vn-head=بَرْي|III=to vie with|III-vn-head=مُبَارَاة|IV=to put dust on|V=to come forward, to advance|VI=to vie with each other|VI-pp=-|VII=to be pared; to oppose oneself, to break out and aggress|VIII=to pare, to cut into form}}

* {{l|ar|مِبْرَاة|t=instrument for paring; sharpener}}
* {{l|ar|بَرَّايَة|t=instrument for paring; sharpener}}
* {{l|ar|بُرَايَة|t=chips, parings}}
* {{l|ar|بَرًى|t=soil, dust, upper crust of the earth}}
* {{l|ar|بَرَّاء|t=who works on paring things, shaper, fashioner}}
* {{l|ar|بَرِيّ|t=formed by cutting}}

===References===
* {{R:ar:Dozy|volume=1|page=80}}
* {{R:ar:Freytag|volume=1|page=116}}
* {{R:ar:Kazimirski|volume=1|page=119–120}}
* {{R:ar:Lane|page=197–198}}
* {{R:ar:Wehr-5-de|pages=85–86}}
