==Arabic==

===Root===
{{ar-root}}

# related to keeping one’s stance

====Derived terms====
{{ar-verb forms|I= to be [[pious]], to be [[reverent]], to be [[respectful]], to be [[kind]], to be [[true]], to be [[sincere]]|I-vn-head=بِرّ|II=to justify|III=to do good to|IV=to [[perform]], to [[execute]], to [[confirm]] by [[fulfilment]]; to [[overcome]], to be [[refractory]] and [[subdue]], to [[surpass]]|V=to endeavour to characterize oneself by [[piety]]|V-pp=-|VI=to do good to each other, to practise mutual kindness|VI-pp=-}}

* {{l|ar|مَبَرَّة|g=f-np|t=good deed, charity|pos=noun}}
* {{l|ar|بَرّ|g=m-np|t=dry land, outside|pos=noun}}
* {{l|ar|بَرَّة|g=f-np|t=dry land, outside; obedience|pos=noun}}
* {{l|ar|بَرّ|t=[[pious]], [[reverent]], [[respectful]], [[kind]], [[true]], [[sincere]]|pos=adjective}}
* {{l|ar|بَرِير|t=[[pious]], [[reverent]], [[respectful]], [[kind]], [[true]], [[sincere]]|pos=adjective}}
