Page 2 humid: Skipped, no changes
Page 2 humid: -------- begin text --------
==English==

===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*wegʷ-}}
Borrowed from {{der|en|fro|humide}}, from {{der|en|la|humidus|t=moist}}. Via {{der|en|ine-pro|*wegʷ-|t=wet}} related to {{cog|en|weaky}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈhjuːmɪd/}}
* {{audio|en|en-us-humid.ogg|a=US}}
* {{rhymes|en|uːmɪd|s=2}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|er}}

# Containing perceptible [[moisture]] (usually describing air or atmosphere); [[damp]]; [[moist]]; somewhat wet or [[watery]].
#: {{syn|en|damp|moist|Thesaurus:wet}}
#: {{ux|en|'''humid''' earth}}
