#: {{uxi|nl|de schoonheid en'''er''' vrouw|the beauty '''of''' a woman}}
# {{lb|nl|archaic|except in fixed expressions}} {{n-g|Used to form the (strong) feminine singular dative.}}
#: {{uxi|nl|[[te goed'''er''' trouw]]|t=in good faith}}

=====Usage notes=====
