===Etymology===
From {{inh|fa|pal||tr=tlk’|ts=tarrag|t=vegetable}}, from {{m|pal||tr=tl’|ts=tarr|t=wet, moist}}, compare {{m|fa|تر|tr=tar|t=wet}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{fa-IPA|tara,tarra}}

===Noun===
{{fa-noun|tr=tarre, tare|تره‌ها}}

# {{lb|fa|archaic}} [[garden]] [[herb]] in [[general]], especially [[beet]]s, [[spinach]], [[cress]]es, [[leek]], [[parsley]], [[pot]]-[[herb]]
# {{lb|fa|Iran}} {{vern|Iranian leek}}, {{vern|Persian leek}} ({{taxlink|Allium ampeloprasum subsp. persicum|subspecies}}, a specific cultivar of the {{vern|great-headed garlic}}, {{taxfmt|Allium ampeloprasum|species}})

