Circa 1600, from {{bor|hu|ota|تارخانه|tr=tarhana}}, from {{der|hu|fa|ترخانه|tr=tarxâne||tarhana}}, from {{m|fa|تر|tr=tar||wet}} + {{m|fa|خوان|tr=xwân||food, tablecloth, dining table}}. The modern Turkish spelling is {{m|tr|tarhana}}.

