==Turkish==

===Etymology===
{{inh+|tr|ota|تره یاغی|tr=tere yağı}},<ref name=Redhouse>{{R:ota:Redhouse|تره یاغی|page=540}}</ref><ref>{{R:ota:Kelekian|تره یاغی|page=365}}</ref><ref>{{R:ota:Sami:1899|401|تره یاغی}}</ref> some sources claim it is derived from {{der|tr|fa|کره|tr=kare|t=butter|nocat=1}}<ref name=Redhouse></ref><ref>{{R:tr:OTK|page=4752}}</ref> (compare {{noncog|az|kərə yağı}}), however others dispute the consonant shift from '''/k/''' to '''/t/''' as impossible, and claim the origin to be {{der|tr|fa|تر|tr=ter|t=humid, wet; fresh}},<ref>{{R:tr:Nişanyan|gamze}}</ref><ref>BAYDAR, Arzu Sema ERTANE. "Tereyağ/Tereyağı Üzerine." ''Türk Dünyası İncelemeleri Dergisi'' 17.2 (2017): 213-222.</ref> indicating an earlier adjectival form {{m|tr|tere yağ|t=fresh butter}}. Compare {{m|tr|tere|t=cress, watercress}} from the same origin.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|tr|/teˈɾe.jɑː/|[t̟ʰe̞ˈɾe̞.jɑː]}} 
* ɾe̞.jɑː]
* {{hyph|tr|te|re|ya|ğı}}
* {{audio|tr|LL-Q256 (tur)-ToprakM-tereyağı.wav}}

===Noun===
