==Arabic==
{{ar-rootbox|ر ء ي}}

===Alternative forms===
* {{qualifier|archaic}} {{l|ar|رَءَا}}

===Etymology===
Cognate with {{cog|hbo|רָאָה|tr=rāʾâ}} and {{cog|gez|ርእየ}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|رَأَى}}
* {{audio|ar|Ar-رأى.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ar-verb|I|a|a}}

# {{lb|ar|transitive}} to [[see]] {{gloss|to perceive with the eyes}}
#: {{ux|ar|لَا '''أَرَى''' شَيْئًا.|I can't '''see''' anything.}}
# to [[see]] [[again]] in one's [[mind]], to [[play]] back a [[memory]], to [[look]] [[back]] [[on]]

====Conjugation====
{{ar-conj|I|a|a|vn=رُؤْيَة}}

===Verb===
{{ar-verb|I|a|a}}

# to [[deem]] [[true]], to [[opine]] or [[hold]] the [[opinion]] of, to have that [[outlook]] on something, to [[see]] or [[view]] it that [[way]], to be of that [[think]]ing or to have such [[thought]]s
#* {{RQ:Qur'an|37|102
|passage= فَلَمَّا بَلَغَ مَعَهُ ٱلسَّعْيَ قَالَ يَا بُنَيَّ إِنِّي أَرَى فِي ٱلْمَنَامِ أَنِّي أَذْبَحُكَ فَٱنْظُرْ مَاذَا '''تَرَى''' قَالَ يَا أَبَتِ ٱفْعَلْ مَا تُؤْمَرُ سَتَجِدُنِي إِنْ شَاءَ اللَّٰهُ مِنَ ٱلصَّابِرِينَ}}
# to [[review]] in one's [[mind]], to [[consider]] it, to [[reflect]] on it, to [[contemplate]], to [[review]] something to see its [[deep]]er [[significance]], to [[look]] [[back]] [[over]], to [[speculate]] upon
# to [[plant]] a [[flag]] or [[banner]] in the [[ground]], to [[place]] [[down]] one's [[ensign]] or [[mark]]
# {{lb|ar|transitive|obsolete}} to [[hit]] someone's lung, to [[complain]] of [[pain]] in one's [[lung]]s

====Conjugation====
{{ar-conj|I|a|a|vn=رَأْي}}

===Verb===
