==Arabic==
{{wp|lang=ar}}

===Etymology===
Found from the sixteenth century, variant of {{m|ar|شَرْبُوش}}. The dissimilation is speculated to have been motivated by {{bor|ar|qwm|تر|tr=tär|t=sweat}}, the headpiece being fit to conceal ({{m|fa|پوشیدن|بوش|tr=pôš}}) perspiration.

