# [[plummet]], [[plumb line]], a [[cord]] with a [[weight]] attached, used to produce a [[vertical]] line
#: {{syn|ota|اسقندیل|tr1=iskandil|سونده|tr2=sonda|گز|tr3=gez|مطمار|tr4=mıtmar}}

====Derived terms====
{{col2|ota
|{{l|ota|شاقوللامق|tr=şakullamak|t=to measure with a plummet}}
|{{l|ota|شاقولی|tr=şakuli|t=perpendicular}}
}}

====Descendants====
* {{desc|tr|şakul}}, {{l|tr|çekül}}

