{{also|ترنجبین}}
==Arabic==

===Etymology===
From {{bor|ar|fa-cls|ترنگبین|tr=tarangubin, tarangabin}}, {{l|fa-cls|ترانگبین|tr=tar-angubin, tar-angabin|t={{vern|Persian manna}}}}, from {{m|fa-cls|تر|tr=tar|t=moist}} + {{m|fa-cls|انگبین|tr=angabin, angubin|t=honey}}.

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|تَرَنْجَبِين|m|head2=تَرَنْجُبِين}}

# {{vern|Persian mannaplant}}, {{taxlink|Alhagi maurorum|species}} syn. {{taxlink|Alhagi persarum|species}}
# a [[saccharine]] [[honeydew]] forming on this plant, effective as a [[laxative]], [[cholagogue]] and [[immunostimulant]]

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-noun|تَرَنْجَبِين|head2=تَرَنْجُبِين}}

====Descendants====
* {{desc|la-med|tereniabin|bor=1}}
* {{desc|fa|ترنجبین|tr=taranjabin, taranjobin|bor=1}}
* {{desc|ota|ترنجبین|tr=terencebin, terencübin|bor=1}}

