==Hindi==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|hi|तर-ओ-ताज़ा}}

===Etymology===
{{bor+|hi|fa|تر و تازه|tr=tar-o-tâze}}, from {{af|fa|تر|و|تازه|tr1=tar|tr2=o|tr3=tâze|t1=moist|t2=and|t3=fresh|nocat=1}}. Compare {{cog|pa|ਤਰੋਤਾਜ਼ਾ}} / {{m|pa|تَروتازہ}}.

===Pronunciation===
