* Related to {{der|tr|ar|طُرْفَة||novelty, rarity|nocat=1}},<ref>{{R:tr:Nişanyan|turfanda}}</ref>
* Derived from the name of the city {{w|Turpan|Turfan}}, which is famous for high quality fresh fruits and vegetables,<ref>Sarıkaya, Mahmut. "ÖTÜKEN’DEN ANADOLU’YA: KIRŞEHİR YÖRESİNDE DİLE YANSIYAN KÜLTÜR ÖGELERİ." ''Karadeniz Araştırmaları'' 74 (2022): 429-443.</ref>
* Derived from {{der|tr|fa|تر|tr=tar|t=fresh; wet, humid|nocat=1}}.<ref name=Sami></ref><ref>{{R:tr:OTK|page=4913}}</ref>

