==French==

===Etymology===
{{bor+|fr|pt|casta}}, if of {{der|fr|gem|-}} origin, possibly from {{der|fr|got|𐌺𐌰𐍃𐍄𐍃}}, from {{der|fr|gem-pro|*kastuz}}, from {{inh|fr|ine-pro|*h₂ǵ-es-||to throw}}, similar to {{cog|en|cast}}. Or, alternatively from a derivative of {{der|fr|la|castus}}.

