* {{sense|discard}} {{l|en|bin}}, {{l|en|dump}}, {{l|en|scrap}}; see also [[Thesaurus:junk]]
* {{sense|shut up}} {{l|en|can it}}, {{l|en|stifle}}; see also [[Thesaurus:stop talking]] or [[Thesaurus:make silent]]
* {{sense|dismiss an employee}} {{l|en|axe}}, {{l|en|let go}}, {{l|en|sack}}; see also [[Thesaurus:lay off]]

