#* {{quote-web|en|url=http://www.theguardian.com/commentisfree/2021/feb/23/brexit-machine-perpetual-grievance-britain-brussels|title=Brexit is a machine to generate perpetual grievance. It's doing its job perfectly|author=Rafael Behr|date=2021-02-23|work=The Guardian|passage=Leavers will be attracted to that story because it spares them the discomfort of admitting that they voted for a '''con''', and then made a prime minister of the con artist.}}

