==Proto-Tocharian==

===Etymology===
{{root|ine-toc-pro|ine-pro|*h₂enh₁-|*h₁eh₁t-}}
From {{inh|ine-toc-pro|ine-pro|*h₂en(h₁)tmen-}}, itself from {{m|ine-pro|*h₂enh₁-||to breathe}} + {{m|ine-pro|*[[h₁eh₁t-|h₁éh₁t-men-]]||breath; soul}}, whence also {{cog|sa| आत्मन्}}. For similar semantic derivation, {{cog|grc|ψῡχή}}, {{m|grc|θῡμός}}, {{cog|la|animus}} and {{cog|fa|جان}}.

===Noun===
{{head|ine-toc-pro|noun}}

# {{topic|ine-toc-pro|Religion}}[[self]], [[soul]]

====Related terms====
* {{l|ine-toc-pro|*ān-}}

====Descendants====
* {{desc|xto|āñcäm}}
* {{desc|txb|āñme}}

