==Turkish==

===Etymology===
{{inh+|tr|ota|جان باش ایله|tr=can baş ile}},<ref>{{R:ota:Redhouse|جان باش ایله|page=638}}</ref> from {{m|ota|جان|tr=cān, can}} and {{m|ota|باش|tr=baş}},<ref>{{R:tr:Nişanyan|can}}</ref><ref>{{R:tr:Nişanyan|baş}}</ref> equivalent to {{af|tr|can<gloss:life, soul, heart>|-la<pos:instrumental suffix>|baş<gloss:head>|-la|lit=with soul/life and head}}, or {{m|tr|can}} + {{m|tr|ile}} + {{m|tr|baş}} + {{m|tr|ile}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|tr|/ˈd͡ʒan.ɫa.baʃ.ɫa/}}
* {{hyphenation|tr|can|la|baş|la}}

===Adverb===
