{{inh+|gu|inc-pra|𑀚𑀡𑁆𑀡𑀸}}, from {{inh|gu|sa|जन्य|tr=jánya}}. {{dbt|gu|જન}}. Cognate with {{cog|raj|जान|tr=jān}}, {{cog|sd|ڄَڃَ }} / {{m|sd|𑋃𑋅}} and {{cog|pa|جنج|tr=jaṉj}} / {{m|pa|ਜੰਞ}}.

====Noun====
{{gu-noun|g=f}}

# [[baraat]] {{gl|a [[wedding]] procession by the [[bridegroom]]'s side}}
#: {{syn|gu|વરાત}}

===Etymology 2===
{{bor+|gu|fa-cls|جان|tr=jān}}. Compare {{cog|bn|জান}}, {{cog|hi|जान}}, {{cog|pa|ਜਾਨ}}.

====Noun====
