* {{q|nautical}}
* {{q|position (something) by folding it back on itself}}:
* {{s|become}} {{l|en|become}}, {{l|en|get}}, {{l|en|go}}
* {{s|rebel}} {{l|en|rebel}}, {{l|en|revolt}}
* {{s|shape on a lathe}} {{l|en|lathe}}
* {{s|go bad}} {{l|en|go bad}}, {{l|en|go off}}, {{l|en|sour}}, {{l|en|spoil}}
* {{s|complete}} {{l|en|complete}}

