==Hungarian==

===Pronunciation===
* {{hu-IPA}}
* {{rhymes|hu|ɛd|s=1}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{affix|hu|-e-|-d|pos1=linking vowel|pos2=possessive suffix|nocat=y}}.

====Suffix====
{{head|hu|suffix}}

# {{senseid|hu|possessive}} {{lb|hu|possessive suffix}} [[your]] {{gl|second-person singular, single possession}}
#: {{afex|hu|kert|t1=garden|kert'''ed'''|t2='''your''' (''singular, informal'') garden}}
#: {{uxi|hu|Megbízol engem '''a kerted''' gondozásával?|Will you entrust me with the care of '''your garden'''?}}

=====Usage notes=====
{{U:hu:pos-d}}

===Etymology 2===
From {{affix|hu|-e-|-d|pos1=linking vowel|pos2=personal suffix|nocat=y}}.

====Suffix====
{{head|hu|suffix}}

# {{senseid|hu|personal}} {{lb|hu|personal suffix}} {{ngd|Forms the [[Appendix:Glossary#definite|definite]] [[Appendix:Glossary#second person|second-person]] singular indicative present of verbs.}}
#: {{afex|hu|fest|t1=to paint|fest'''ed'''|t2='''you''' paint [him/her/it], '''you are''' paint'''ing''' [him/her/it]}}
#: {{uxi|hu|Mikor '''fested''' a kerítést?|When do '''you paint''' the fence?}}

=====Usage notes=====
* {{q|personal suffix}} See harmonic variants in the table below.
{{U:hu:conj-pres-def}}

===Etymology 3===
From {{affix|hu|-e-|-d|pos1=linking vowel|pos2=fraction-forming and verb-forming suffix|nocat=y}}.

====Suffix====
{{head|hu|suffix}}

# {{senseid|hu|fraction}} {{lb|hu|fraction-forming suffix}} [[-th]] {{gl|added to a [[cardinal number]] to form a [[fraction]]}}
#: {{afex|hu|ezer|t1=thousand|ezr'''ed'''|t2=thousand'''th'''}}
# {{senseid|hu|verb}} {{lb|hu|frequentative verb-forming suffix}} Added to a stem to form a [[verb]] to indicate repetitive action. No longer productive.
#: {{m|hu|szenv'''ed'''|t=to suffer}}

=====Usage notes=====
* {{q|fraction-forming suffix}} Variants:
*: '''{{l|hu|-d|id=fraction}}''' is added to words ending in a vowel
*: '''{{l|hu|-ad|id=fraction}}''' is added to some back-vowel words ending in a consonant
*: '''{{l|hu|-od|id=fraction}}''' is added to some other back-vowel words ending in a consonant
*: '''{{l-self|hu|-ed|id=fraction}}''' is added to unrounded front-vowel words ending in a consonant
*: '''{{l|hu|-öd|id=fraction}}''' is added to rounded front-vowel words ending in a consonant
* {{q|frequentative suffix}} Variants:
*: '''{{l|hu|-d|id=verb}}''' is found only in a few words as an obscured suffix
*:: {{m|hu|mon'''d'''|t=to say, tell}}, {{m|hu|kez'''d'''|t=to begin}}
*: '''{{l|hu|-od|id=verb}}''' is added to back-vowel words
*:: {{m|hu|tap'''od'''|t=to tread on something}}
*: '''{{l|hu|-ad|id=verb}}''' is added to back-vowel words
*: '''{{l-self|hu|-ed|id=verb}}''' is added to unrounded front-vowel words
*:: {{m|hu|szenv'''ed'''|t=to suffer}}
*: '''{{l|hu|-öd|id=verb}}''' is added to rounded front-vowel words
*:: {{m|hu|bök'''öd'''|t=to repeatedly poke at something}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{suffixsee|hu|pos=fractional number}}

