#: {{suffixusex|cy|pump|t1=five|pumed|t2=fifth}}
#: {{suffixusex|cy|chwech|t1=six|chweched|t2=sixth}}

===Etymology 3===
Ultimately from {{der|cy|ine-pro|*-tis}} or {{der|cy|ine-pro|*-tus}}.<ref>{{R:cy:WGHC|section=203 iii 8}}</ref>

