===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{lb|en|countable}} An act or instance of wandering.
#: {{ux|en|to go for a '''wander''' in the park}}
# {{lb|en|uncountable|of a value, signal or similar}} Deviation from a correct or normal value.
#: {{hypo|en|polar wander}}
