===Suffix===
{{es-noun|m|f=+}}<br />
{{es-adj}}

# [[-er]], [[-or]] {{non-gloss definition|forms nouns (usually [[agent noun]]s) and adjectives from verbs}}
#: {{suffixusex|es|abrir|gloss1=open|abridor|gloss2=opener}}
#: {{suffixusex|es|contaminar|gloss1=pollute|contaminador|gloss2=polluter}}
#: {{suffixusex|es|coordinar|gloss1=coordinate|coordinador|gloss2=coordinator}}
#: {{suffixusex|es|maltratar|gloss1=beat / abuse / batter|maltratador|gloss2=beater / abuser / batterer}}
# {{non-gloss definition|forms derivatives of other nouns}}
#: {{suffixusex|es|leña|gloss1=firewood|leñador|gloss2=wood cutter}}

====Usage notes====
* The vowel before the suffix depends on the conjugation of the verb to which the suffix is added: {{m|es|-ar}} verbs use {{m|es|-ador}} ({{m|es|-adora}}), {{m|es|-er}} verbs use {{m|es|-edor}} ({{m|es|-edora}}){{,}} and {{m|es|-ir}} verbs use {{m|es|-idor}} ({{m|es|-idora}}).

====Derived terms====
{{suffixsee|es}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:es:DRAE}}

