==Persian==

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|fa|pal|drwd|tr=drōd||well-being, health, welfare}}, from {{inh|fa|peo|sc=Latn|*druwatā-}}, from {{m|peo|𐎯𐎢𐎽𐎢𐎺𐎠|𐎯𐎢𐎽𐎢𐎺|ts=duruva-|secure, healthy}}, from  {{inh|fa|ira-pro|*druwáh}}. Compare {{cog|ae|𐬛𐬭𐬎𐬎𐬀𐬙𐬁𐬝||health}} (from {{m|ae|𐬛𐬭𐬎𐬎𐬀|𐬛𐬭𐬎𐬎𐬀-}}) and {{cog|sa|ध्रुव|tr=dhruvá|t=fixed, immovable; firm}}. Related to Old Armenian {{m|xcl|դրուատ}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{fa-IPA|darōd,darūd,durūd|ir=darūd,durūd|dari=darūd,durūd}}

