From {{inh|fa|ira-pro|*dā́ru}}, from {{inh|fa|iir-pro|*dā́ru}}, from {{inh|fa|ine-pro|*dóru}}. Also see {{l|fa|دار|tr=dâr}}, {{l|fa|درخت|tr=deraxt}}. {{cog|xag|𐔳𐕒𐕡𐕙𐕒𐕡𐔳}} is an Iranian borrowing.

====Pronunciation====
{{fa-IPA|darūd,durūd}}

====Noun====
{{fa-noun|tr=dorud}}

