==Arabic==

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|بَالَ}}
** {{IPA|ar|/boːl/|a=Central Asia}}<ref>Cowan, W. (1960). Arabic evidence for Proto-Semitic*/awa/and*/ō. Language, 60-62.</ref>

===Etymology 1===
Found in dictionaries as if from the root {{ar-root|ب و ل|nocat=1}}, but actually not relatable to any root. It is explained as reanalysis of {{univerbation|ar|notext=1|[[بَاءَ]] [[ل|لِي]]|t1=it has come upon me}}; predating Arabic literature by a millennium at least since there is {{cog|arc-bib|בָּל|t=mind, heed|tr=bāl}}.

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|بَال|m}}

# [[mind]], [[state]]
# [[attention]], [[mindfulness]], [[heed]]

=====Declension=====
{{ar-decl-noun|بَال}}

=====Derived terms=====
* {{l|ar|مَا بَال}}

=====Related terms=====
* {{l|ar|بَالَى}}

===Etymology 2===
From the root {{ar-root|ب و ل}} related to [[urine]].

====Verb====
{{ar-verb|I|a|u}}

# to [[urinate]]

=====Conjugation=====
{{ar-conj|I|a|u|vn=بَوْل}}

=====Descendants=====
* {{desc|mt|biel}}

===Etymology 3===
{{nonlemma}}

