===Etymology===
A false [[back-formation]] introduced during the Reza Shah regime's [[Persianization]] program, from {{l|fa|ارتشدار|tr=artešdâr|t=soldier}}. Erroneously analyzed as a compound word made from two parts with the latter component as {{l|fa|دار|tr=dâr|t=haver}}, the [[solecism]] was nonetheless officially approved.

Displaced [[Turkic]] {{l|fa|اردو|tr=ordu}} in {{w|Iranian Persian}}.

