==Turkish==

===Etymology===
Neologism, coined as part of Atatürk’s language reforms, from the locative ''önde'' of {{m|tr|ön||front}} + {{m|tr|-r}}, with the form probably also influenced by the earlier loan {{m|tr|lider}} or by the Persian suffix {{m|fa|ـدار|tr=-dâr}}, compare {{w|Turkish}} {{m|tr|dindar}}. [[CAT:Turkish coinages]]

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|tr|/øn.dæɾ/|[ø̞ᵝn̟.d̟æɾ̞̊]}}
* {{audio|tr|LL-Q256 (tur)-ToprakM-önder.wav}}

===Noun===
{{tr-noun|i|ler}}

