===Etymology===
{{bor+|sh|ota|خزنه‌دار|tr=haznadar}}, from {{m|ota|خزنه|tr=hazna}}, {{m|ota|خزینه|t=treasury|tr=hazine}} (Turkish {{m|tr|hazne}}, {{m|tr|hazine}}) + {{der|sh|fa|ـدار|tr=-dâr}}, present stem of {{m|fa|داشتن|tr=dâštan|t=to have}}. Akin to {{m|sh|hȁzna||treasury}}.

===Pronunciation===
