==Arabic==
[[File:Calicotome villosa kz12.jpg|thumb|right|{{lang|ar|دارشيشعان}} – {{taxlink|Calicotome villosa|species}}|upright=1.4]]

===Etymology===
From {{bor|ar|fa|دار شیشعان|tr=dâr šiša'ân}}. The beginning of this term renders {{m|fa|دار|tr=dâr|t=tree, wood}}, the end is unclear, suspected {{der|ar|trk}} {{m|trk-pro|*čeček|t=flower}} or {{m|trk-pro|*ïgač|*agaç|t=tree}}, but the attestation is early for a Turkic borrowing, otherwise after Vullers {{der|ar|sa|चोचक}}, {{m|sa|चोच|t=cinnamon-bark}} in comparison of the woody branches.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|دَارْشِيشَعَان}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|دَارْشِيشَعَان|m}}

# {{taxlink|Calicotome|genus}} spp.

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-noun|دَارْشِيشَعَان}}

====Descendants====
* {{desc|bor=1|ML.|darsisaban|darsisan}}
* {{desc|axm|դարշիշան|bor=1|alts=1}}

===References===
* {{RQ:Janah:2020|page=411|section=223 (fol. 21r,7–22r,2)|instead=1|lang=en}}
* {{cite-book|title=Moses Maimonides' Glossary of Drug Names|last=Dienstag|first=Jacob Israel|first2=Joseph|last2=Dana|publisher=Maimonides Research Institute|year=1995|page=73}}
* {{R:ar:Dozy|volume=1|page=420}}
* {{R:Lagarde-Mitt.|volume=2|page=20}}
* {{R:fa:Vullers|L|I|page=786a}}

{{topics|ar|Genisteae tribe plants}}
