==Punjabi==

===Etymology===
{{bor+|pa|fa-cls|ـدار|tr=-dār}}. Compare {{cog|hi|-दार}}.

===Suffix===
{{head|pa|suffix}}

# [[having]], [[possessing]], [[holding]]
#: {{suffixusex|pa|ਝਿਰੀ|t1=slot, groove|ਝਿਰੀਦਾਰ|t2=slotted, grooved}}

====Usage notes====
Added to nouns to form both adjectives and nouns. Masculine nouns of the {{w|Punjabi_grammar#Nouns|extended declensional subtype}} (that is, those ending in -ਆ ''-ā'') usually take an {{glossary|oblique case}} ending before the suffix. For instance:
: {{m|pa|ਰਿਸ਼ਤਾ||relation|tr=riśt'''ā'''}} → {{m|pa|ਰਿਸ਼ਤੇਦਾਰ||relative|tr=riśt'''e'''dār}}.
: {{m|pa|ਪੱਤਾ ||leaf|tr=patt'''ā'''}} → {{m|pa|ਪੱਤੇਦਾਰ||leafy|tr=patt'''e'''dār}}.

====Derived terms====
{{suffixsee|pa}}
