==Persian==

===Etymology===
From {{af|fa|جاه|tr1=jâh|t1=rank, office, honor|دار|tr2=dâr|pos2=present stem of {{m|fa|داشتن|tr=dâštan|t=to have}}}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{fa-IPA|jāhˈdār}}

===Noun===
{{fa-noun|tr=jâhdâr}}

# {{lb|fa|obsolete}} [[dignitary]]; [[holder]] of [[rank]]

===References===
* {{R:fa:Steingass}}
-------- end text --------
