==Gujarati==
{{gu-alt|gu=દાર|a=دار}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{gu-IPA}}
* {{rhyme|gu|ɑɾ|s=1}}

===Etymology 1===
{{inh+|gu|sa|द्वार}}, from {{inh|gu|inc-pro|*dwā́ram}}, from {{inh|gu|iir-pro|*dʰwā́ram}}, from {{inh|gu|ine-pro|*dʰworom|t=enclosure, courtyard, i.e. something enclosed by the door}}, accusative of {{m|ine-pro|*dʰwer-}}. {{dbt|gu|દ્વાર|બારણું}}

====Noun====
{{gu-noun|g=m}}

# [[door]], [[gate]]
#: {{syn|gu|દ્વાર|બારણું|દરવાજો}}

===Etymology 2===
{{bor+|gu|fa-cls|ـدار|tr=dār}}, from {{der|gu|pal|tr=dʾl|t=tree, gallows; wood}}, from {{der|gu|peo|𐎭𐎠𐎽𐎢𐎺|ts=dāruv}}, from {{der|gu|ira-pro|*dā́ru}}, from {{der|gu|iir-pro|*dāru}}, from {{der|gu|ine-pro|*dóru}}.

====Noun====
{{gu-noun|g=f}}

# [[timber]]

===Etymology 3===
{{bor+|gu|fa-cls|دار|tr=dār}}, from {{der|gu|ar|دَار}}. {{root|gu|ar|د و ر}}

====Noun====
{{gu-noun|g=m}}

# [[house]]
#: {{syn|gu|ઘર}}
-------- end text --------
