==English==
{{wp}}
{{wp|human tooth}}
[[Image:Lower wisdom tooth.jpg|thumb|A tooth]]

===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*h₃ed- (bite)}}
From {{inh|en|enm|tothe}}, {{m|enm|toth}}, {{m|enm|tooth}}, from {{inh|en|ang|tōþ||tooth}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*tanþ}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*tanþs||tooth}}, from {{inh|en|ine-pro|*h₃dónts||tooth}}. Related to {{m|en|tusk}}. {{doublet|en|dent|dens|tind|tine}}.

{{rel-top|Cognates:}}
Cognate with {{cog|sco|tuth}}, {{m|sco|tuith||tooth}}, {{cog|frr|toth}}, {{m|frr|tos||tooth}}, {{cog|nl|tand||tooth}}, {{cog|de|Zahn||tooth}}, {{cog|da|tand||tooth}}, {{cog|sv|tand||tooth}}, {{cog|no|tann||tooth}}, {{cog|is|tönn||tooth}}, {{cog|cy|dant||tooth}}, {{cog|la|dēns||tooth}}, {{cog|lt|dantìs||tooth}}, {{cog|grc|ὀδούς}}/{{m|grc|ὀδών||tooth}}, {{cog|hy|ատամ}}, {{cog|fa|دندان||tr=dandân}}, {{cog|sa|दत्||tr=dát}}, {{m|sa|दन्त||tooth}}.
{{rel-bottom}}

