* {{enPR|to͞oth|a=RP}}, {{IPA|en|/tuːθ/|/tʊθ/|q2=uncommon}}
** {{audio|en|En-uk-tooth.ogg|a=RP,London}}
** {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Back ache-tooth.wav|a=London}}
* {{IPA|en|/tuθ/|a=GA}}
** {{audio|en|En-us-tooth.ogg|a=GA}}
