====Verb====
{{en-verb}}

# {{lb|en|transitive}} To [[plant]] or [[sow]] an area with [[#Noun|seed]]s.
#: {{ux|en|I '''seeded''' my lawn with bluegrass.}}
# {{lb|en|transitive}} To cover thinly with something scattered; to ornament with seedlike decorations.
#* {{RQ:Jonson Coronation Triumph|page=846|passage=AGRYPNIA, or ''Vigilance'', in yellow, a ſable mantle '''ſeeded''' with waking eyes, and ſiluer fringe: {{...}}}}
# {{lb|en|transitive}} To [[start]]; to provide, assign or determine the [[initial]] resources for, position of, state of.
#: {{ux|en|A venture capitalist '''seeds''' young companies.}}
#: {{ux|en|The tournament coordinator will '''seed''' the starting lineup with the best competitors from the qualifying round.}}
#: {{ux|en|The programmer '''seeded''' fresh, uncorrupted data into the database before running unit tests.}}
# {{lb|en|sports|gaming}} To [[allocate]] a [[seeding]] to a competitor.
#* {{quote-journal|en|work=The New York Times|title=Reflection on the Seedings Fills Pause at Wimbledon|date=July 2, 1979|url=https://www.nytimes.com/1979/07/02/archives/reflection-on-the-seedings-fills-pause-at-wimbledon.html|passage=Everybody likes to second‐guess computers, including who '''seed''' the pros. Nothing could have better exposed the vulnerability of the computer seeding than the spectacle of clay‐court experts looking like weekend hackers on grass.}}
# {{lb|en|internet|transitive}} To leave ([[file]]s) available for others to [[download]] through [[peer-to-peer]] file sharing protocols (e.g. [[BitTorrent]]).
# {{lb|en|intransitive}} To be qualified to compete, especially in a quarter-final, semi-final{{,}} or final.
#: {{ux|en|The tennis player '''seeded''' into the quarters.}}
# {{lb|en|meteorology}} To [[scatter]] small [[particle]]s within (a [[cloud]] or [[airmass]]) in order to trigger the formation of [[rain]].
#: {{ux|en|A number of clouds were '''seeded''' to help provide rain to a drought-stricken area.}}
# {{lb|en|intransitive}} To produce [[#Noun|seed]].
# {{lb|en|intransitive}} To [[grow]] to [[maturity]].
# {{lb|en|slang|vulgar}} To [[ejaculate]] inside the [[penetratee]] during [[intercourse]], especially in the [[rectum]].

