* {{alt|ota|շէմ՚տան|շամտան||Armn}}

===Etymology===
{{bor+|ota|fa|شمعدان|tr=šam'dân|t=candlestick}}, a compound of {{m|fa|شمع|tr=šam'|t=candle}} + {{m|fa|ـدان|tr=-dân|t=holder}}.

===Noun===
{{head|ota|noun|tr=şemʼdan|definite accusative|شمعدانی|plural|شمعدانلر|f1tr=şemʼdanı|f2tr=şemʼdanlar}}

# [[candlestick]], [[candle holder]], a [[holder]] with a [[socket]] or [[spike]] for a [[candle]]

