==Proto-Iranian==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|ira-pro|iir-pro|*Hdántā}}, from {{inh|ira-pro|ine-pro||*h₃dént-ō ~ *h₃dn̥t-nés}}, from {{af|ine-pro|*h₃dónts|alt1=*h₃dent-|t1=tooth|*-ō|nocat=1}}.

===Noun===
{{head|ira-pro|noun|g=m}}<ref>{{R:ira:ESIJa|head=*dant-|page=329}}</ref>

# [[tooth]]

====Descendants====
{{top3}}
* Central Iranian:
