===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# {{senseid|en|v-tr-servefood}} {{lb|en|transitive}} To put in a dish or dishes; [[serve]], usually food.
# {{lb|en|informal|slang}} To [[gossip]]; to relay information about the personal situation of another.
# {{lb|en|transitive}} To make [[concave]], or [[depress]] in the middle, like a dish.
#: {{ux|en|to '''dish''' a wheel by inclining the spokes}}
# {{lb|en|slang|archaic|transitive}} To [[frustrate]]; to [[beat]]; to [[outwit]] or [[defeat]].

