===Etymology===
{{root|pa|ine-pro|*gʰerdʰ-}}
{{dercat|pa|inc-pro|iir-pro|ine-pro|inh=3}}
{{inh+|pa|inc-pra|𑀖𑀭}}, from {{inh|pa|inc-ash|*𑀕𑀭𑁆𑀳}}, from a metathesized form of {{inh|pa|sa|गृह|tr=gṛhá}}, from {{inh|pa|iir-pro|*gʰr̥dʰás||house}}, from {{inh|pa|ine-pro||*gʰr̥dʰ-ó-s}}, from {{m|ine-pro|*gʰerdʰ-||[[enclosure]]}}. Compare {{cog|hno|[[کہار|کَہار]]|tr=kahār}}. Far cognate with {{cog|fa|کرت|tr=kart}} and {{cog|en|garth}} / {{m|en|yard}}, {{cog|gd|gàrradh||[[garden]]; [[wall]]}} and {{cog|ga|garraí||[[garden]]; small [[enclosure]]; [[halo]]}}, among others. {{doublet|pa|گَڑھ}}.

===Pronunciation===
