# [[house]], [[home]]
#: {{syn|pa|مَکاݨ|t=[[house]]; [[building]]|کُلّا|q2=[[hut]], modest [[home]]}}
#* {{quote-book|pa|author=pa:غلام حسین ساجد<tr:G̲h̲ulām Ḥusain Sājid>|title=pa:نیندر بھنی رات<tr:Nīndar bhinnī rāt>|page=69|passage=تے اوہ کِسے وی قیمت تے کِسے نوں اپنے '''گھر''' واڑن لئی راضی نہیں سی ہُوئی۔|translation=And she wasn't prepared to let anyone inside her '''house''', at any cost.|transliteration=te oh kise vī qīmat te kise nūṉ apṇe '''ghar''' vāṛaṇ la'ī rāẓī nahīṉ sī hū'ī.|year=2006|publisher=pa:سانجھ<tr:Sānjh>|location=w:Lahore|pageurl=https://www.google.co.uk/books/edition/نىندر_بھنى_رات/UuNjAAAAMAAJ?hl=en&gbpv=1&dq=گھر&pg=69|isbn=9789698957087}}
# {{lb|pa|by extension}} [[household]]
#: {{syn|pa|خاندان|گَھرانا}}
#* {{quote-book|pa|title=pa:راوی<tr:rāvī>|pageurl=https://www.google.co.uk/books/edition/R%C4%81v%C4%AB/pKNGAAAAMAAJ?hl=en&gbpv=1&bsq=%DA%AF%DA%BE%D8%B1+%D8%AF%D8%A7&dq=%DA%AF%DA%BE%D8%B1+%D8%AF%D8%A7&printsec=frontcover|passage=جے غریب ماں پے بالاں دی وجہ توں گھر دی آمدن ودھا لیندے نیں تے ایہدے وچ حرج ای کیہ اے۔|translation=What bother is it if [some] poor parents decide to increase the '''household''' income through their children.|transliteration=je ġarīb māṉ pe bālāṉ dī vajah toṉ '''ghar''' dī āmadan vadhā lainde neṉ te aehde vicc ḥaraj ī kīh ae.|year=2000|publisher=Government College|location=w:Lahore|volume=87|oclc=1608162}}
