From {{inh|fa|pal||tr=zwl|ts=zōr}}, which Pokorny derives from {{inh|fa|ine-pro|*gew-|t=to hasten}} and compares to {{cog|sh|žúriti|t=to hurry, rush}} and {{cog|non|keyra|t=to whip, lash; to ride}}. See also {{cog|xcl|զօր|զաւր}}, an Iranian borrowing.

====Pronunciation====
{{fa-IPA|zōr}}

====Noun====
{{fa-regional|زور|زور|зӯр}}
{{fa-noun|tr=zur}}

# [[force]], [[strength]], [[power]], [[might]]
#* {{RQ:Masnavi|I|3560|چار جوی جنت اندر حکم ماست<br>این نه '''زور''' ما ز فرمان خداست‌‌|čār jōy-i-jannat andar hukm-i-mā-st<br>īn na '''zōr'''-i-mā za farmān-i-xudā-st|The four rivers of Paradise are under our control;<br>this is not (by) our '''might''', ’tis (by) the command of God}}
# [[violence]], [[force]]

=====Derived terms=====
{{a|fa|verbs}}
{{col2|fa|زور گفتن<tr:zur goftan>|زور آوردن<tr:zur âvardan>|زور دادن<tr:zur dâdan>|زور زدن<tr:zur zadan>}}
{{a|fa|leading}}
{{col2|fa|زورمند<tr:zurmand>|زورخانه<tr:zurxâne>|زورآزما<tr:zur-âzmâ>|زورآور<tr:zur-âvar>|زوراً<tr:zuran>|زورگو<tr:zur-gu>|زورکی<tr:zuraki>|زورورزی<tr:zur-varzi>}}
{{a|fa|trailing}} 
{{col2|fa|پرزور<tr:por-zur>|به زور<tr:be zur>|بی زور<tr:bi zur>|کمزور<tr:kam-zur>|پیل زور<tr:pil zur>|گاو زور<tr:gâv zur>}}

