===Etymology 2===
From {{inh|fa|pal||tr=zwhl|ts=zōhr}}, from {{inh|fa|ine-pro||*ǵʰéw-tlo-}}, from {{m|ine-pro|*ǵʰew-|t=to pour}}. Compare {{cog|en|god}}, {{m|en|God}}. See also {{cog|fa|ژون|tr=žun|t=idol}}.

