==Ottoman Turkish==

===Etymology 1===
{{bor+|ota|fa|زر|tr=zar|t=gold}}, from {{der|ota|pal|*zarr||gold}}.

====Noun====
{{head|ota|noun|tr=zer}}

# [[gold]], a yellow [[chemical element]] of great [[value]] and one of the [[noble metal]]s
#: {{syn|ota|آلتون|tr1=altun, altın|ذهب|tr2=zeheb}}
# [[coin]], a [[piece]] of [[currency]], usually [[metallic]] and in the [[shape]] of a [[disc]]
#: {{syn|ota|آقچه|tr1=akçe|سكه|tr2=sikke}}
# [[money]], a generally accepted [[means]] of [[exchange]] and [[measure]] of [[value]]
#: {{syn|ota|پاره|tr=pare, para}}

====Adjective====
{{head|ota|adjective|tr=zer}}

# [[yellow]], possessing a [[color]] which stands between [[gree]] and [[orange]] on the [[visible spectrum]]
#: {{syn|ota|صاری|tr=sarı}}

