==Persian==

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|fa|pal|lʾc|tr=rāz||secret, mystery}}, from {{inh|fa|peo|*𐎼𐎠𐏀|tr=*rāza-}}, from {{inh|fa|iir-pro|*raȷ́ʰ-||secret, mystery; to abandon}}. Related to {{l|fa|رستن|tr=rastan|t=set free, leave, escape}}, and {{l|fa|رها|tr=rahâ|t=free, liberated}}.

Cognates with {{cog|xpr|𐫡𐫀𐫉|ts=rāz|sc=Mani}}, and {{cog|sa|रहस्य||secret, mystery, clandestine}}.

Also compare {{cog|xcl|երազ}}, {{cog|arc-imp|𐡀𐡓𐡆𐡀|t=mystery}},  {{cog|he|רָז|tr=rāz}}, {{cog|syc|ܐܪܙܐ|tr=ʾərāzā}}, Iranian borrowings.

