===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|en|enm|hon|gloss=whetstone}}, from {{inh|en|ang|hān}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*hainō}} (compare {{cog|nl|heen}}, {{cog|no|hein}}), from {{der|en|ine-pro|*ḱeh₃i-|t=to sharpen}} (compare {{cog|grc|κῶνος|t=cone}}, {{cog|fa|سان|tr=sân|t=whetstone}}).

====Noun====
{{en-noun}}

# A [[sharpen]]ing [[stone]] composed of extra-fine [[grit]] used for removing the [[burr]] or [[curl]] from the [[blade]] of a [[razor]] or some other [[edge tool]].
# A [[machine tool]] used in the manufacture of precision [[bore|bores]].

