{{ar-decl-noun|سَنّ}}

===Etymology 3===
From {{inh|ar|sem-pro|*šinn-}}. Cognate with {{cognate|akk|šinnum|𒅗|tr=šinnum}}, {{cognate|arc|שנא|tr=šinā’}}, {{cognate|gez|ስን}}, and {{cognate|he|שֵׁן|tr=shén}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|سِنّ}}
* {{audio|ar|Ar-سن.ogg}}

====Noun====
{{ar-noun|سِنّ|f|pl=أَسْنَان|pl2=أَسِنَّة|pl3=أَسُنّ}}

# [[tooth]], [[tusk]], [[fang]]
#: {{uxi|ar|أُنَظِّفُ أَسْنَانِي|I am brushing my teeth}}
