[[Category:hy:Swords]]

==Old Armenian==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|xcl|ine-pro||*ḱeh₃ro-}}, grown from {{m|ine-pro|*ḱeh₃-||to sharpen}}. Cognates include {{cog|sa|शूल||any sharp instrument or pointed dart, lance, pike, spear}}, {{cog|fa|سان||whetstone|tr=sân}}, {{cog|la|cōs||whetstone}}, {{m|la|catus||clever, shrewd}}.

