Compare also {{cog|hy|հեսան}}, from {{cog|xcl|յեսան}}, which formerly was considered as the source of the Kurdish word.<ref>{{R:xcl:HAB|յեսան|vol=III|page=397a}}</ref><ref>{{R:zza:Asatrian:1987|page=163}}</ref>

