==Sanskrit==

===Alternative scripts===
{{sa-alt}}

===Etymology===
{{dercat|sa|inc-pro|inh=1}}
{{root|sa|sa|स्था}}
{{root|sa|ine-pro|*steh₂-}}
From {{inh|sa|iir-pro|*stáHnam}}, from {{inh|sa|ine-pro||*stéh₂-no-m}}, from {{m|ine-pro|*steh₂-||to stand}}. Cognate with {{cog|ae|𐬯𐬙𐬁𐬥𐬀}}, {{cog|peo|𐎿𐎫𐎠𐎴|ts=stāna}}, {{cog|fa|ـستان|tr=-estân||place}}. {{surf|sa|स्था|-अन}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{sa-IPA|a=1}}

===Noun===
{{sa-noun|tr=sthā́na|g=n}}

# the act of [[standing]], standing firmly, being fixed or stationary
# [[position]] or [[posture]] of the body (in shooting etc.)
# [[staying]], [[abiding]], being in or on (in locative or compound)
# storing-place or storage (of goods)
# firm bearing (of troops), sustaining a charge (as opposed to {{m|sa|युद्ध||charging}})
# [[state]], [[condition]] (at the end of compound = "being in the state of")
# continued existence, [[continuance]] in the same state (i.e. in a kind of neutral state unmarked by loss or gain), continuing as or as long as (with instrumental)
# a state of perfect [[tranquility]]
# [[station]], [[rank]], [[office]], [[appointment]], [[dignity]], [[degree]]
# place of standing or staying, any [[place]], [[spot]], [[locality]], [[abode]], [[dwelling]], [[house]], [[site]]
#: {{lang|sa|स्थाने स्थाने}} (sthāne sthāne) or {{lang|sa|स्थाने स्थानेषु}} (sthāne sthāneṣu) — ''in different places; here and there''
#* [[Rigveda|RV]] [[s:The Rig Veda/Mandala 7/Hymn 70|7.70.3]]
#: {{lang|sa|यानि '''सथानान्यश्विना''' दधाथे दिवो यह्वीष्वोषधीषु विक्षु}} |
#: {{lang|sa|नि पर्वतस्य मूर्धनि सदन्तेषं जनाय दाशुषेवहन्ता}} ||
#: {{lang|sa|चनिष्टं देवा ओषधीष्वप्सु यद योग्या अश्नवैथे रषीणाम}} |
#:: {{lang|und|yāni '''sthānānyaśvinā''' dadhāthe divo yahvīṣvoṣadhīṣu vikṣu}} |
#:: {{lang|und|ni parvatasya mūrdhani sadanteṣaṃ janāya dāśuṣevahantā}} ||
#:: {{lang|und|caniṣṭaṃ devā oṣadhīṣvapsu yad yoghyā aśnavaithe ṛṣīṇām}} |
#::: Whatever '''dwellings ye possess''', O Aśvins, in fields of men or in the streams of heaven,
#::: Resting upon the summit of the mountain, or bringing food to him who gives oblation,
#::: Delight yourselves, ye Gods, in plants and waters when Ṛṣis give them and ye find they suit You.
# place or [[room]], [[stead]]
#: {{lang|sa|स्थाने}} (sthā́ne) (with genitive or at the end of compound) — ''in place of, instead of, in lieu of''
#: {{lang|sa|[[रिपु]][[स्थाने]][[वर्तते]]}} (ripu-sthāne-√vṛt) — ''to act in the place of an enemy''
#: {{lang|sa|[[विलोचन]][[स्थ्āन]][[गत]]}} (vilocana-sthāna-gata) — ''acting the part of eyes''
# (''at the end of a compound'') "taking the place of", "acting as", "representing" or "represented by"
#: {{m|sa|पितृस्थान|tr=pitṛ́-sthāna}} — ''acting as a father; represented by a father''
#: {{lang|sa|इयङुवङ्स्थान}} (iyaṅ-uvaṅ-sthāna) — ''represented by 'iy' or 'uv'''' (as ''ī'' and ''ū'', Pāṇini 1-4, 4)
# in Pāṇini's grammar the genitive case is often used alone, when the word ''sthāne'' has to be supplied:
#: {{m|sa||हन्तेर् जः|tr=hanter jaḥ}} — ''{{m|sa|ज}} is to be substituted in place of {{m|sa|हन्}}''
# place for, receptacle of (+ genitive)
# proper or right place
#: {{m|sa|स्थाने|tr=sthā́ne}} — ''in the right place or at the right time, seasonably, justly''
# [[province]], [[region]], [[domain]], [[sphere]] (of gods or virtuous men; said to be in one of three places, namely "earth" or "atmosphere" or "heaven"; according to some that of virtuous [[Brahmin]]s is called {{m|sa|प्राजापत्य}}; of [[Kshatriya]]s, {{m|sa|ऐन्द्र}}; of [[Vaishya]]s, {{m|sa|मारुत}}; of [[Shudra]]s, {{m|sa|गान्धर्व}})
# the main [[support]] or [[strength]] or chief [[constituent]] of a kingdom (said to be four, namely "army", "treasury", "city", "territory")
# a [[stronghold]], [[fortress]]
# the [[place]] or organ of [[utterance]] of any sound (said to be 8 in number, namely {{m|sa|कण्ठ||throat}}; {{m|sa|तालु||palate}}; {{m|sa|मूर्धन्||top of palate}}; {{m|sa|दन्त||teeth}}; {{m|sa|ओष्ठ||lips}}; {{m|sa|कण्ठतालु|tr=kaṇṭha-tālu||throat and palate}}; {{m|sa|कण्ठोष्ठ|tr=kaṇṭh-oṣṭha||throat and lips}}; {{m|sa|दन्तोष्ठ|tr=dant-oṣṭha||teeth and lips}}; to which are added {{m|sa|नासिका||nose}}, said to be the place of utterance of true [[anusvāra]], and {{m|sa|उरस्||chest}}, of [[visarga]])
# any [[organ]] of [[sense]] (e.g. the eye)
# the [[pitch]] or [[key]] of the voice, [[note]], [[tone]] (of which according to Rigveda-Pratishakhya there are three (see {{m|sa|मन्द्र}}), or according to Taittirīya-Pratishakya, seven)
#: {{lang|sa|वीना च्युता स्थानात्}} (vīnā cyutā sthānāt) — ''a lute out of tune''
# [[shape]], [[form]], [[appearance]] (as of the moon)
# the part or [[character]] of an actor
# [[case]], [[occurrence]]
#: {{lang|sa|नेदं स्थानं विद्यते}} (ne-daṃ sthānaṃ vidyate) — ''this case does not occur''
# [[occasion]], [[opportunity]] for (genitive or compound)
#: {{m|sa|स्थाने}} — ''occasionally''
# [[cause]] or [[object]] of (genitive or compound)
#: {{m|sa|शुल्कस्थान|tr=śulka-sthāna}} — ''an object of toll''
#: {{m|sa|पूजास्थान|tr=pūjā-sthāna}}, {{m|sa|मान्यस्थान|tr=mānya-sthāna}} — ''an object of honour; also applied to persons''
#: {{m|sa|स्थाने}} — ''because of, on account of''
# a [[section]] or [[division]] (e.g. of medicine)
# {{lb|sa|astrology}} a [[mansion]] or its [[subdivision]]
# = {{m|sa|कार्योत्सर्ग|tr=kāryo-tsarga}}
# an [[open]] [[place]] in a town, [[plain]], [[square]]
# a holy place
# an [[altar]]
# name of a [[Gandharva]] king

====Declension====
{{sa-decl-noun-n|sthā́na}}

