==Latvian==
{{slim-wikipedia|Tadžikistāna|lang=lv}}
[[File:LocationTajikistan.png|thumb|200px|Tadžikistāna (Āzijā)]]
[[File:Flag of Tajikistan.svg|thumb|130px|Tadžikistānas karogs]]

===Etymology===
Via other European languages, ultimately borrowed from {{bor|lv|tg|Тоҷикистон}}, from {{der|lv|fa|تاجیک|tr=tâjik}} and {{m|fa|ـستان|tr=stân}}, a common ending for country names. In {{cog|lv|-}}, the word was made into a feminine, 4th-declension noun, following the general pattern for country names.

===Pronunciation===
{{rfap|lv}}

===Proper noun===
{{lv-proper noun|f|4th}}

