==Persian==
{{was fwotd|fa|2023|December|28}}

===Etymology===
From {{af|fa|غلغل<tr:ğolğol><t:cry, tumult>|ـستان<tr:-estân><t:-land>}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{fa-IPA|ğulğulisˈtān}}

===Noun===
{{fa-noun|tr=ğolğolestân}}

# {{lb|fa|poetic}} [[place]] where [[everybody]] is [[cry]]ing or [[shout]]ing
#* {{quote-book|fa|title=fa:شاهنامه|trans-title={{w|Shahnameh|Book of Kings}}|year=c. 1011|author={{w|Ferdowsi|Abu'l-Qāsim Firdawsī}}|chapter=The Tale of Rustam and Isfandiyār|url=https://ganjoor.net/ferdousi/shahname/esfandyar/sh20|text=به رستم چنین گفت کای سرگرای<br>چرا تیز گشتی به پرده‌سرای<br>سزد گر برین بوم زابلستان<br>نهد دانشی نام '''غلغلستان'''|tr=ba rustam čunīn guft k-ay sar-girāy<br>čirā tēz gaštī ba parda-sarāy<br>sazad gar bar-īn būm-i zābulistān<br>nihad dānišē nām-i '''ğulğulistān'''|t=He spoke thus to Rustam: "You confused thing,<br>Why are you getting angry at a tent?<br>It would be fitting if a wise man<br>Were to rename this land of Zābulistān to '''Crybabyland'''.|footer=(Classical Persian romanization)}}
#* {{quote-book|fa|title=fa:شاهنامه|trans-title={{w|Shahnameh|Book of Kings}}|year=c. 1011|author={{w|Ferdowsi|Abu'l-Qāsim Firdawsī}}|chapter=The Tale of Rustam and Shaghād|url=https://ganjoor.net/ferdousi/shahname/shqad/sh5|text=ز کابلستان تا به زابلستان<br>زمین شد به کردار '''غلغلستان'''|tr=zi kābulistān tā ba zābulistān<br>zamīn šud ba kirdār-i '''ğulğulistān'''|t=From Kābulistān to Zābulistān<br>The realm became like '''Tumult-estan'''.|footer=(Classical Persian romanization)}}
#* {{quote-book|fa|title=fa:مسمطات قاآنی|year=mid-1800s|author={{w|Qaani|Qā'ānī}}|url=https://ganjoor.net/ghaani/mosammatgh/sh2|text=یکی بین به شاخ سرو که صلصلستان شده<br>نه صلصلستان شده که '''غلغلستان''' شده|tr=yeki bin be šâx-e sarv ke solsolestân šode<br>na solsolestân šode ke '''ğolğolestân''' šode|t=Look at one of those cypress branches, it's become Wood-Pigeon-Land;<br>No, not just Wood-Pigeon-Land, it's become '''Bird-Chirping-Land'''.}}
-------- end text --------
