{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*kʷ-}}
From {{inh|en|enm|what}}, from {{inh|en|ang|hwæt||what}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*hwat}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*hwat||what}}, from {{inh|en|ine-pro|*kʷód||what}}, neuter form of {{m|ine-pro|*kʷós||who}}. Cognate with {{cog|sco|whit||what}}, {{cog|frr|wat||what}}, {{cog|stq|wat||what}}, {{cog|fy|wat||what}}, {{cog|nl|wat||what}}, {{cog|nds|wat||what}}, {{cog|de|was||what}}, {{cog|da|hvad||what}}, {{cog|nb|hva||what}}, {{cog|sv|vad||what}}, {{cog|nn|kva||what}}, {{cog|is|hvað||what}}, {{cog|la|quod||what, which}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|en|Canada|GA}} 
** {{enPR|wŭt|a=wine-whine}}, {{IPA|en|/wʌt/|/wɑt/<a:sometimes also in <<GA>>>}}
