** {{enPR|hwŭt|a=non-wine-whine}}, {{IPA|en|/ʍʌt/}}
*** {{audio|en|en-ne-what.ogg|a=US,stressed,non-wine-whine}}
** {{IPA|en|[wʌɾ]|[wʌˀ]|q1=[[w:flapping|flapped]]|q2=glottalized|a=unstressed}}
*** {{audio|en|en-US what (flapped).ogg|a=US,unstressed,flapped,wine-whine}}
