==Catalan==

===Pronunciation===
* {{ca-IPA}}

===Etymology 1===
{{inh+|ca|la|mens|mente}}.

====Suffix====
{{head|ca|suffix}}

# {{senseid|ca|adverbial}} {{n-g|Attaches to an adjective in the feminine singular to form the corresponding adverb.}}
#: {{suffixusex|ca|ràpid|ràpidament|t1=rapid|alt1=ràpida|t2=rapidly}}

=====Usage notes=====
The resulting adverb has secondary stress where the corresponding adjective has primary stress, as in {{IPAchar|[ˈrapiðə]}} → {{IPAchar|[ˌrapiðəˈmen]}}.

=====Derived terms=====
{{suffixsee|ca|id=adverbial}}

