==Arabic==
{{wp|Al-}}

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ar|اَمْ||dialectal}}

===Etymology===
{{unc|ar}}; Rubin posits that this is a reduced form of the lost singular of {{cog|ar|أُولَى|tr=ʔulā|t=these}}; compare rare {{cog|he|אֵל|tr=el|t=these}} and {{cog|akk|ullûm|𒌌𒇻𒌑𒌝|tr=ullûm|t=that}}. In this hypothesis, original initial {{IPAchar|/u/}} would be lost due to low stress; the initial {{IPAchar|/a/}} found in phrase-initial position would thus be prothetic.<ref>{{cite-book|year=2005|publisher={{w|Brill}}|author={{w|Aaron D. Rubin|Aaron Rubin}}|chapter=Definite Articles|title=Studies in Semitic Grammaticalization|pages=77-78|isbn=9789004370029|doi=10.1163/9789004370029_005}}</ref>

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|ar|/al-/|/-l-/}}
* {{audio|ar|Ar-ال.ogg}}

===Article===
{{head|ar|article|head=اَلْ}}

# [[the]]

====Usage notes====
* The {{IPAchar|/l/}} of this prefix assimilates to and [[geminates]] the first letter of the base word when it begins with a traditionally-coronal consonant, natively called [[sun letter]]s: {{l|ar|ت}}, {{l|ar|ث}}, {{l|ar|د}}, {{l|ar|ذ}}, {{l|ar|ر}}, {{l|ar|ز}}, {{l|ar|س}}, {{l|ar|ش}}, {{l|ar|ص}}, {{l|ar|ض}}, {{l|ar|ط}}, {{l|ar|ظ}}, {{l|ar|ل}}, and {{l|ar|ن}}. This does not traditionally include {{l|ar|ج}}, as its original pronunciation was palatal rather than coronal, but in regions where it is pronounced {{IPAchar|/d͡ʒ ~ ʒ/}} it can be found assimilating the definite article as well. The {{l|ar|ل}}’s assimilation is not observed by the article's spelling, which is invariably {{l-self|ar|ال}}; however, in fully vocalised texts, a [[shadda]] is written over the following sun letter to reflect gemination.
* The initial vowel ''a-'' is only pronounced when the article occurs either after a pause, at the beginning of an utterance, or after the preposition {{m|ar|مِنْ}}. Otherwise, the article consists solely of the coronal consonant preceded by the final vowel of the previous word; if this previous word is consonant-final, then ''i'' is used as a linking vowel.

====Descendants====
* {{desc|arz|ال|tr=el}}
* {{desc|afb|ال|tr=il}}
* {{desc|mt|il-}}
* {{desc|ary|ال|tr=el}}

====See also====
* {{l|en|moon letter}}
* {{l|en|sun letter}}

====References====
<references/>

