#: {{uxi|afb|فينا|tr=fīna|t=in us}}
# {{lb|afb|with conjugation}} [[how about]] s.th., do you feel like s.th.
#: {{ux|afb|فيكم سينما؟|tr=fīkum sēnima?|Do you feel like going to the cinema?|lit=in you (CPL), is there a cinema?}}
#: {{ux|afb|فيچ نجرب المترو؟|tr=fīc njarrib il-mitro?|Do you feel like trying the metro?|lit=in you (FSG) (we) try the metro?}}
#: {{ux|afb|فيك سفرة؟|tr=fīk safra?|Do you feel like travelling|lit=in you (MSG), is there a trip?}}

