#* {{quote-book|fa|title=fa:شاهنامه|trans-title={{w|Shahnameh|Book of Kings}}|year=c. 1011|author={{w|Ferdowsi|Abu'l-Qāsim Firdawsī}}|chapter=The tale of Siyāwash|url=https://ganjoor.net/ferdousi/shahname/siavosh/sh8|text=نخست آفرین کرد بر کردگار<br>خداوند '''آرامش''' و کارزار|tr=naxust āfarīn kard bar kardgār<br>xudāwand-i '''ārāmiš''' u kārzār|t=He made his first praises to the Creator,<br>The Lord [both] of '''calm''' and of the battlefield.|footer=(Classical Persian romanization)}}
#* {{quote-book|fa|title=fa:دیوان بیدل|trans-title=The Divān of Bēdil|author={{w|Abdul-Qādir Bedil|'Abd al-Qādir Bēdil}}|text=مریض شوق بیدل هرگز آسودن نمی‌خواهد<br>که ‌همچون نبض موج آخر کفن می‌گردد '''آرامش'''|tr=marīz-i šawq-i bēdil hargiz āsūdan na-mē-xwāhad<br>ki hamčūn nabz-i mawj āxar kafan mē-gardad '''ārāmiš'''|t=Those sick with love-yearning which takes their heart away never want to rest;<br>Like the pulse of the wave, the shroud finally becomes their '''repose'''.|year=c. 1720|footer=(Classical Persian transliteration)|url=https://ganjoor.net/bidel/ghazalbi/sh1808|chapter=Ghazal 1808}}

