===Serbian (Cyrillic)===
Serbian is written in the Latin (Roman) script (''[[latinica]]'', see [[#Serbian (Roman)]] above) and in the Cyrillic script ([[ћирилица]], ''[[ćirilica]]'').  The two Serbian scripts have distinct sort orders (''[[abeceda]]'' order for ''[[latinica]]'' and [[азбука]]/''[[azbuka|Azbuka]]'' order for [[ћирилица]]/''[[ćirilica]]'').

