Page 65 آزمایش: Skipped, no changes
Page 65 آزمایش: -------- begin text --------
{{also|آزمائش}}
==Persian==

===Etymology===
From {{af|fa|آزمای|pos1=present stem of {{m|fa|آزمودن|tr=âzmudan||to test, experience}}|tr1=âzmây|ـش|tr2=-eš}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{fa-IPA|āzmāˈyiš}}

===Noun===
{{fa-regional|آزمایش|آزمایش|озмоиш}}
{{fa-noun|tr=âzmâyeš|pl=آزمایش‌ها|pl2=آزمایشات}}

# [[test]], [[trial]], [[ordeal]]
#* {{quote-book|fa|title=fa:شاهنامه|trans-title={{w|Shahnameh|Book of Kings}}|year=c. 1011|author={{w|Ferdowsi|Abu'l-Qāsim Firdawsī}}|chapter=The reign of Zahhāk|url=https://ganjoor.net/ferdousi/shahname/zahak/sh6|text=چنین داد پاسخ به مادر که شیر<br>نگردد مگر ز آزمایش '''دلیر'''|tr=čunīn dād pāsux ba mādar ki šēr<br>na-gardad magar zi '''āzmāyiš''' dalēr|t=He answered his mother like this: "The brave man does not become a lion[-like hero] except by a '''test'''."|footer=(Classical Persian romanization)}}
# [[test]], [[experiment]]
#: {{syn|fa|تست|tr=test}}
# [[test]], [[examination]]
#: {{syn|fa|امتحان|tr=emtehân}}
# [[trial]], [[temptation]]
#: {{syn|fa|وسوسه|tr=vasvase}}

====Derived terms====
{{col2|fa
|آزمایشگاه<tr:âzmâyešgâh>
|آزمایشی<tr:âzmâyeši>
}}

====Related terms====
{{col2|fa
|آزمودگی<tr:âzmudegi>
|آزمودن<tr:âzmudan>
|آزموده<tr:âzmude>
|آزمون<tr:âzmun>
}}

====Descendants====
* {{desc|bn|আজমায়েশ|bor=1}}
* {{desc|gu|અજમાયશ|bor=1}}
* {{desc|inc-hnd|-|bor=1}}
*: {{desc|hi|आज़माइश}}
*: {{desc|ur|آزْمائِش|āzmāiś}}

