Page 66 فهم: Skipped, no changes
Page 66 فهم: -------- begin text --------
==Arabic==
{{ar-rootbox|ف ه م}}
{{etymon|ar|id=to understand}}

===Etymology 1===

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|فَهِمَ}}
* {{audio|ar|Ar-فهم.ogg}}

====Verb====
{{ar-verb|I|i|a}}

# to [[understand]]
#: {{ux|ar|بِفَضْلِ الدُّرُوسِ الْجَيِّدَةِ، يُمْكِنُنِي فَهْمُ اللُّغَةِ الْعَرَبِيَّةِ بِشَكْلٍ أَفْضَلَ الْآنَ.|Thanks to the good lessons, I can understand the Arabic language better now.}}
#* {{quote-book|ar|year=a. 897|author=[[w:en:Al-Buhturi|Al-Buḥturiyy]]|editor= Ḥasan Kāmil Al-Ṣayrafiyy|edition=3rd|publisher=Dār al-Maʿārif|series=Ḏaḵāʾir al-ʿArab|title=ديوان البحتري|page=955|isbn=977-246-839-5|volume=2|passage=عَلَيَّ نَحْتُ ٱلْقَوَافِي مِنْ مَقَاطِعِهَا / وَمَا عَلَيَّ لَهُمْ أَنْ '''تَفْهَمَ''' ٱلْبَقَرُ}}
# to [[learn]]
# to [[observe]]
# to [[comprehend]]

=====Conjugation=====
{{ar-conj|I|i|a|passive=y|vn=فَهْم}}

=====Descendants=====
* {{desc|mt|fehem}}
* {{desc|fa|فهمیدن|tr=fahmidan|bor=1}} {{q|partly also from the noun below}}
* {{desc|sw|fahamu|alt=-fahamu|bor=1}}

===Etymology 2===

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|فَهَّمَ}}

====Verb====
{{ar-verb|II|I=ف|II=ه|III=م}}

# {{label|ar|ditransitive}} to cause to [[understand]]
#* {{RQ:Qur'an|21|79|passage='''فَفَهَّمۡنَـٰهَا''' سُلَيۡمَـٰنَ}}

=====Conjugation=====
{{ar-conj|II|I=ف|II=ه|III=م|passive=y|vn=تَفْهِيم}}

