===Verb===
{{ajp-verb|I|tr=ʔāl|pres=بقول|prestr=biʔūl}}

# {{lb|ajp|transitive}} to [[say]]
#: {{syn|ajp|حكى|tr=ḥaka}}
#: {{ux|ajp|[[شو]] [[قال|بتقول]] [[إمّ]][[ك]]؟|tr=šū '''bitʔūl''' ʔimmak?|t=What does your mother '''say'''?}}
# {{lb|ajp|ditransitive|by extension}} to [[tell]]
#: {{ux|ajp|[[قال|قلت]][[ل|لّه]] [[بد|بدّي]][[ش]] [[راح|اروح]].|tr='''ʔoltillo''' biddīš arūḥ|t='''I told him''' I don't want to go.}}

====Usage notes====
* When the conjugation ends in a consonant cluster, the indirect-object marker {{l|ajp|ـلـ|tr=-l-}} is geminated, causing the stress to shift; additionally, the long vowel is reduced to a short vowel. However, this effect takes place as well simply when the indirect-object marker is attached immediately after the final {{m|ajp|ل}} of the term.
*: {{ux|ajp|شو عم بتقول؟|tr=šū ʕam '''bitʔūl'''?|t=What are '''you saying'''?}}
*: {{ux|ajp|شو عم بتقلّي؟|tr=šū ʕam '''bitʔolli'''?|t=What are '''you saying to me'''?}}
*: {{ux|ajp|شو قلتلّي؟|tr=šū '''ʔoltilli'''?|t=What '''did you say to me'''?}}

====Conjugation====
{{ajp-conj/DW|ق|ل|ʔ|l}}
