{{contraction|ajp|ما[[هو]]ش|tr=mahúš, mahūš|t=it is not}}, obtained by applying the negative circumfix {{m|ajp|[[ما]] ...[[ـش]]|tr=mā ...-š|t=not}} to pronouns like {{m|ajp|هو|tr=hū|t=he; it}}. Can be traced piecewise to {{inh|ajp|ar|[[مَا]] + [[هُوَ]] + [[شَيْء]]|lit=it is not one thing}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ajp-IPA|miš<p:mɪʃ>|muš<p:mʊʃ>}}
