#: {{syn|ajp|بقي|tr=biʔi}}
#: {{ux|ajp|[[إحنا]] [[رح]] [[طلع|نطلع]]، [[ما]] [[رح]] [[ضلّ|نضلّ]] [[ب]][[بيت|البيت]].|tr=ʔiḥna raḥ niṭlaʕ, mā raḥ '''nḍall''' bil-bēt|t=We're going out, we're not going to '''stay''' at home.}}
# {{lb|ajp|by extension, with enclitic determiner}} to [[continue]], to [[keep]] doing
#: {{ux|ajp|[[قال|قلت]][[ل|لّه]] [[ألف]] [[مرّة]] [[ما]] [[ضلّ|يضلّه]] [[سبسب|يسبسب]].|tr=ʔult-illo ʔalf marra ma '''yḍallօ''' ysabsib|t=I told him a thousand times not to '''keep''' cursing.}}
