===Etymology 2===
{{etymid|fa|helmet}}
From {{inh|fa|pal|xwd|tr=xōd|t=helm}}, borrowed from {{bor|fa|xpr|xwwd|tr=*xōδ|gloss=helmet}}, from {{cog|ira-old}}, ultimately from {{der|fa|ine-pro|*kadʰ-||to guard, cover, care for, protect}}. The Parthian word is cognate with {{cog|peo|𐎧𐎢𐎭𐎠|tr=xaudā-||hat}}, {{cog|ae|𐬑𐬀𐬊𐬜𐬀|t=helmet}}, {{cog|os|худ||hat}}, {{cog|en|hat}}, {{m|en|hood}}, etc. The inherited form of the Persian is {{doublet|fa|خوی|tr1=xoy|notext=1}}. Akin to {{cog|xcl|խոյր}}, {{m|xcl|արտախոյր}}, {{cog|ka|ხვირი}}, {{cog|ar|خُوذَة}}, Iranian borrowings.

====Pronunciation====
{{fa-IPA|xōd}}

====Noun====
