==Turkish==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|tr|ota|بڭزه‌مك|tr=beñzemek}}. Akin to {{cog|otk||tr=meŋze-||to look alike}}, derived from {{cog|otk||tr=beŋiz}} / {{m|otk||tr=meŋiz||face, appearance}},<ref>{{R:tr:Nishanyan|benze-}}</ref> from {{inh|tr|trk-pro|*beŋiŕ||face; to be similar; open forestless place on a mountain slope}}. See more at {{m|tr|beniz||face}}. Compare {{cog|az|bənzəmək||to look like}}, {{cog|tk|meňzemek||to resemble}}.

===Verb===
{{tr-verb|benzer}}

# {{lb|tr|intransitive|with dative}} to [[resemble]]; to [[look alike]], [[seem]] like
