Page 137 فستان: Skipped, no changes
Page 137 فستان: -------- begin text --------
==Arabic==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ar|فُسْطَان|فُشْطَان|فُشْطَال||the last two obsolete}}

===Etymology===
Said to be from the Egyptian city {{m|ar|الفُسْطَاط}}, originally being markedly a raiment of Egyptian women, or so called because it was coloured with {{m|en|fustet}}, or related to the fabric {{m|en|fustian}}, the first usually derived as from {{der|ar|ar|فُسْتُق}} with an Occitanized ending and the second word family (see its translations), present in the early Middle Ages, derived sometimes via {{m-self|ar|فُسْتَان}} from {{m|ar|الفُسْطَاط}} but this is probably not the case due to its arising early in the Middle Ages unlike the Arabic which is but known from the end of the European Middle Ages and the {{m|en|fustian}} family is rather from {{der|ar|la|fūstis|t=cudgel}} relating to the fabrication of the material, and from the {{noncog|pro|-}} plant name {{m|pro|fustet}} there is no way to this Arabic form. The appearance of {{m|ar|ش}}, irregular for an Arabic derivation, the mere variation itself, and the ending variation {{l|ar||ـَان}} instead of {{l|ar|ـَال}} hint an adaptation from {{bor|ar|roa}}, by way of the international textiles trade in the Old World – though this must have been the case already as early as the 14<sup>th</sup> century when this word already appears in the {{l|en|Hejaz|Ḥijāz}} –, compare {{m|ar|قُرْصَان}}, {{m|ar|بُرْتُقَان}} and {{m|ar|قَشْقَوَان}}, all with underlying ''-āl'' auslaut, which suggests a first formation in {{bor|ar|ML.|-ālis}}, {{m|la|-āneum}} respectively its Romance equivalents.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|فُسْتَان}}
* {{audio|ar|Ar-فستان.ogg}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|فُسْتَان|m|d=فُسْتَانَانِ|pl=فَسَاتِين}}

# [[dress]]

====Declension====
{{ar-decl-noun|فُسْتَان|pl=فَسَاتِين}}

====Descendants====
* {{desc|acw|فستان|tr=fustān}}
* {{desc|ajp|فستان|tr=fustān|alts=1}}
* {{desc|roa-opt|fustã|fustam|bor=1}}
** {{desc|pt|fustão}}
* {{desc|osp|fustán|bor=1}}
** {{desc|es|fustán|fustal}}

===References===
* {{R:xaa:ELA|II}}
* {{R:ar:Dozy-V|page=337}}
* {{R:ar:Dozy|volume=2|page=266}}

