==Persian==

===Etymology 1===
From earlier {{m|fa|تیرکش|tr=tirkaš||quiver; arrowslit}}, from {{af|fa|تیر|کش|tr1=tir|tr2=kaš|t1=arrow|t2=container}}.

====Pronunciation====
