** {{desc|gkm|ταρκάσιον|bor=1}}
*** {{desc|bor=1|it|turcasso|carcasso}}
*** {{desc|bor=1|fro|carcois|carquais|tarchais|tarquait}}
**** {{desc|fr|carquois|bor=1}}
***** {{desc|ca|carcaix|bor=1}}
***** {{desc|bor=1|es|carcaj|carcax|carcaza}}
**** {{desc|gl|carcás|carcán|bor=1}}
**** {{desc|pt|carcás|bor=1}}
* {{desc|ka|ქარქაში|bor=1}}
* {{desc|gu|તરકશ|bor=1}}
