===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|apc|/ba.ˈlaːʃ/}}
* (''Lebanon'') {{IPA|apc|/ba.ˈleːʃ/}}

===Noun===
{{apc-noun|g=m|tr=balāš}}

# No [[charge]]; no [[money]]; a price of zero; {{q|in context}} [[for free]]; [[gratis]].
#: {{ux|apc|ما في شي ببلاش غير العمى والطراش.|tr=Ma fi ši bi-'''balāš''' ḡayr il-ʿama wi-ṭ-ṭarāš.|t=Nothing is '''for free''' except blindness and deafness. (''A saying.'')}}

==South Levantine Arabic==

===Etymology===
Probably from {{der|ajp|ar|[[بِلَا]] [[شَيْء]]|tr=bi-lā šayʔ|t=for nothing}}. Eventually the ''b-'' was considered part of the word, and the preposition {{m|ajp|ب|tr=b(i)-}} is now added before it again.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ajp-IPA|balāš<p:baˈlæːʃ>}}
* {{audio|ajp|LL-Q55633582 (ajp)-MahmoudM (AdrianAbdulBaha)-بلاش.wav|a=Jerusalem}}

===Pronoun===
{{ajp-pronoun|tr=balāš}}

# [[nothing]]
#: {{syn|ajp|[[ولا]] [[إشي]]|tr=wala ʔiši}}
#: {{ant|ajp|كل إشي|كل شي|tr1=kull ʔiši|tr2=kull ši}}
# [[for free]] {{q|without payment}}
#: {{ux|ajp|[[أخد|أخدت]][[ه]] [[ب]][[بلاش]].|tr=ʔaḵadto '''bi-balāš'''|t=I got it '''for free'''.}}

====See also====
* {{l|ajp|بلا|tr=bala|t=without}}

===Interjection===
{{ajp-interjection|tr=balāš}}

# [[never mind]]!
#: {{syn|ajp|[[ما]] [[على|علي]][[ش]]|tr=ma ʕalēš|lit=there is nothing on it}}
-------- end text --------
