==Persian==

===Etymology===
* From {{m|fa|فش|tr=feš|t=''(archaic)'' a sibilant or hissing sound}}.
* According to Dehkhoda, possibly from {{m|fa|کلفخشنگ|گلفهشنگ|tr=galafahšang, golfahšang|t=[[stalagmite]]}}.
* According to Mo'in Dictionary, via Arabic, supposedly from {{m|fa|پشنگ|tr=pašang|t=splash}}
* A common narrative in the West derives from {{bor|fa|grc|φυσίγγη}}, {{m|grc|φῦσιγξ}}, whence Modern {{cog|el|φυσίγγιο}}.

