===Etymology===
From {{af|fa|اَژدَها|tr1=aždahâ|t1=dragon, serpent|فَش|alt2=ـفَش|tr2=faš|t2=likeness suffix}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{fa-IPA|aždahā`faš}}

===Adjective===
{{fa-regional|اژدهافش|اژدهافش|аждаҳофаш}}
{{fa-noun|tr=aždahâfaš}}

# {{lb|fa|archaic|literary}} [[dragon]]-like, [[draconic]]
#* '''10th Century CE''', [[w:Ferdowsi|Ferdowsi]], ''[[w:Shahnameh|Shahnameh]]''
#*: {{quote|fa|مران '''اَژدَهافَش''' بیامد چو باد<br>به ایران‌زمین تاج بر سر نِهاد|tr=mar ân '''aždahâfaš''' biyâmad čo bâd<br>be iran-zamin tâj bar sar nehâd|t= That '''dragon-like''' ([[w:Zahhak|Zahhak]]) came like the wind and assumed the Iranian throne.}}
