==Persian==
{{was fwotd|fa|2021|May|4}}

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|fa|شیروَش|tr=širvaš}}

===Etymology===
From {{af|fa|شیر|tr1=šir|t1=lion|فَش|alt2=ـفَش|tr2=faš|t2=-like}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{fa-IPA|šērfaš}}

===Adjective===
{{fa-regional|شیرفش|شیرفش|шерфаш}}
{{fa-adj|tr=širfaš}}

# {{lb|fa|archaic|literary}} [[lionlike]], [[leonine]]
#* '''10th Century CE''', [[w:Ferdowsi|Ferdowsi]], ''[[w:Shahnameh|Shahnameh]]''
#*: {{quote|fa|سپاهی که دیدند کوپال اوی / بر و مِغفَر و '''شیرفش''' یال اوی|tr=sepâhi ke didand kupâle 'uy / bar o meqfar o '''širfaš''' yâle 'uy|t= The (''enemy'') army then saw his (''formidable'') mace, / his (''colossal'') build, his (''mighty'') helmet, and his '''leonine''' mane of hair}}
# {{lb|fa|metaphorical|literary}} [[courageous]], [[valiant]], or [[violent]]
#* '''10th Century CE''', [[w:Ferdowsi|Ferdowsi]], ''[[w:Shahnameh|Shahnameh]]''
#*: {{quote|fa|بیارم یکی لشکرِ '''شیرفَش''' / برآرم شما را سر از خوابِ خَوش|tr=biaram yeki laškare '''širfaš''' / bar-âram šomâ râ sar az xâbe xaš|t=I shall gather a '''valiant''' army / and disrupt your peaceful sleep}}
#: {{syn|fa|اَرغَند|tr1=arğand|شُجاع|tr2=šojâ'|دِلیر|tr3=delir}}

====Related terms====
* {{l|fa|اژدهافَش|tr=aždahâfaš}}, {{l|fa|دیوفَش|tr=divfaš}}, {{l|fa|کوه‌فَش|tr=kuh-faš}}

