{{vi-etym-sino|藍}}, from {{der|vi|lzh|藍}}, using the same disambiguation of {{m|zh|青||grue}} with {{m|zh|藍||blue}} and {{m|zh|綠|tr={{m|vi|lục}}||green}}. See also {{m|vi|xanh||grue}}.

====Adjective====
{{vi-adj}}

# {{lb|vi|uncommon}} {{l|en|blue}}
#: {{syn|vi|xanh dương}}

=====Usage notes=====
* The word is not used very often. The most common use of it is to refer to one of the seven [[color]]s of a [[rainbow]], as in the listing "{{l|vi|[[đỏ]], [[cam]], [[vàng]], [[lục]], '''lam''', [[chàm]], [[tím]]}}".

