==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|-t}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/-θ/}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|en|enm|-the|id=abstract nominal}}, {{m|enm|-th}}, {{m|enm|-te}}, {{m|enm|-t|pos=abstract nominal suffix}}, from {{inh|en|ang|-þ}}, {{m|ang|-t}}, {{m|ang|-þu}}, {{m|ang|-tu}}, {{m|ang|-þo}}, {{m|ang|-to||-th|pos=abstract nominal suffix}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*-iþō}}, from {{inh|en|ine-pro|*-iteh₂|}}. Cognate with {{cog|sco|-th}}, {{cog|fy|-te}}, {{cog|nl|-te}}, {{cog|da|-de}}, {{cog|sv|-d}}, {{cog|is|-ð}}, {{m|is|-d}}, {{cog|got|-𐌹𐌸𐌰}}, {{cog|la|-itās||-ty, -ity}}. See {{m|en|-ity}}, {{m|en|-t}}.

====Suffix====
{{en-suffix|cat2=noun-forming suffixes|cat3=unproductive suffixes}}

# {{lb|en|no longer productive}} {{n-g|Used to form nouns from verbs of action.}}
#: {{m|en|berth|ber'''th'''}}, {{m|en|birth|bir'''th'''}}, {{m|en|blowth|blow'''th'''}}, {{m|en|drawth|draw'''th'''}}, {{m|en|flowth|flow'''th'''}}, {{m|en|growth|grow'''th'''}}, {{m|en|sight|sigh'''t'''}}, {{m|en|spilth|spil'''th'''}}, {{m|en|stealth|steal'''th'''}}, {{m|en|tilth|til'''th'''}}, {{m|en|theft|thef'''t'''}}, {{m|en|weight|weigh'''t'''}}, {{m|en|shrift|shrif'''t'''}}
# {{lb|en|no longer productive|except|jocular coinages}} {{n-g|Used to form nouns of quality from adjectives.}}
#: {{m|en|breadth|bread'''th'''}}, {{m|en|chillth|chill'''th'''}}, {{m|en|coolth|cool'''th'''}}, {{m|en|dampth|damp'''th'''}}, {{m|en|dearth|dear'''th'''}}, {{m|en|depth|dep'''th'''}}, {{m|en|filth|fil'''th'''}}, {{m|en|health|heal'''th'''}}, {{m|en|height|heigh'''t'''}}/{{m|en|heighth|heigh'''th'''}}, {{m|en|illth|ill'''th'''}}, {{m|en|length|leng'''th'''}}, {{m|en|roomth|room'''th'''}}, {{m|en|ruth|ru'''th'''}}, {{m|en|strength|streng'''th'''}}, {{m|en|troth|tro'''th'''}}, {{m|en|truth|tru'''th'''}}, {{m|en|sloth|slo'''th'''}}/{{m|en|slowth|slow'''th'''}}, {{m|en|warmth|warm'''th'''}}, {{m|en|wealth|weal'''th'''}}, {{m|en|width|wid'''th'''}}, {{m|en|wrath|wra'''th'''}}, {{m|en|wrength|wreng'''th'''}}, {{m|en|youth|you'''th'''}}/{{m|en|youngth|young'''th'''}}

=====Synonyms=====
