==Hungarian==
{{hu-corr}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|hu|urj-pro|*e-||this}}. Cognates include {{cog|fi|että}}, {{cog|et|et}}, {{cog|myv|эте}}.<ref>{{R:Uralonet|125}}</ref>

===Pronunciation===
* {{hu-IPA}}
* {{audio|hu|Hu-ez.ogg}}
* {{rhymes|hu|ɛz|s=1}}

===Pronoun===
{{hu-pron|demonstrative}}

# {{senseid|hu|this-pronoun}} [[this]], [[it]] {{gloss|used as a pronoun, that is, instead of a noun phrase}}
#: {{cot|hu|az}}
#: {{uxi|hu|'''Ez''' egy szép ház.|'''This''' is a nice house.}}
#: {{uxi|hu|'''Ez''' nem jó.|'''This''' is not good.}}
#: {{uxi|hu|'''Ez''' vagyok én.|'''This''' is me.}}
#: {{uxi|hu|'''Ez''' a kutyám.|'''This''' is my dog.}}
#: {{uxi|hu|'''Ez''' kedves tőled.|'''It''' is nice of you.}}
{{hu-suff-pron}}

====Declension====
{{hu-decl-ez|e|z}}
The possessive forms of this pronoun are not in use. If necessary, the corresponding possessive forms of {{m|hu|ilyen||such [a thing]}} can be used.

====Derived terms====
{{col4|hu|title=Compound words with this term at the beginning
|[[ebbeli]]/[[ebbéli]]
|efféle
|emiatt
|ezáltal
|ezelőtt
|ezóta
|ezután
|ezúton
|ezúttal
}}
{{col4|hu|title=Compound words with this term at the end
|emez
|mindez
|ugyanez
}}
{{col4|hu|title=Expressions
|ez igen
|ez nekem kínai
}}

===Determiner===
{{head|hu|determiner|demonstrative}}

# {{senseid|hu|this-determ}} {{lb|hu|used before a noun phrase with a definite article|gets the case of the noun phrase}} [[this]]
#: {{uxi|hu|'''Ez a''' ház nagyon szép.|'''This''' house is very beautiful.}}
#: {{uxi|hu|'''Ezzel a''' lemezzel nem tudok mit kezdeni.|I cannot do anything with '''this''' disk.}}
# {{lb|hu|archaic|otherwise only in certain fixed phrases beginning with a vowel, as a counterpart of {{m|hu|e}}|followed by no article}} [[this]]
#: {{uxi|hu|'''ez''' ügyben|in '''this''' matter|q=equivalent to ''eb'''ben az''' ügyben''}}
#: {{uxi|hu|'''ez''' esetben|in '''this''' case|q=equivalent to ''eb'''ben az''' esetben''}}
#: {{uxi|hu|'''ez''' évben|in '''this''' year|q=equivalent to ''eb'''ben az''' évben''}}
#: {{uxi|hu|az '''ez''' évi díjak|[“the”] '''this''' year's fees}}
#: {{uxi|hu|'''ez''' alkalommal|on '''this''' occasion}}
#: {{uxi|hu|'''ez''' idő szerint|at '''this''' time, at present, presently}}
#: {{uxi|hu|'''ez''' idő tájt|about '''this''' time, in '''these''' days}}
#: {{uxi|hu|'''ez''' idáig|until '''this''' time, until now, as yet}}

====Usage notes====
* In the first case (which is by far more common), it is declined according to the noun phrase it is applied to:
*: {{uxi|hu|Ez'''ekben''' a ház'''akban''' magyarok laknak.|'''In these''' houses, Hungarian people live.}}

* Because {{m|hu||ez}} takes a definite article ''(the)'' and {{m|hu|van||is, to be}} is omitted in cases of qualification, some terms are ambiguous:
*: “'''Ez a''' ház” can mean both “'''this''' house” as a phrase and “'''This is the''' house” as a whole sentence. The same ambiguity may arise with {{m|hu|az}}.

====Declension====
{{hu-decl-ez|e|z}}

