==Persian==

===Etymology 1===
{{root|fa|ine-pro|*sem-}}
From {{inherited|fa|pal|hm|tr=ham|gloss=also, same}}, from {{inherited|fa|peo|𐏃𐎶|ts=ham(a)|t=same, together}}, from {{inherited|fa|ira-pro|*hamHáh}}, from {{inherited|fa|iir-pro|*samHás}}, from {{inherited|fa|ine-pro|*somHós|gloss=same}}.<ref>{{R:ira:ESIJa|vol=3|page=344}}</ref> Compare {{cog|sa|सम}}, {{cog|en|same}}.

====Alternative forms====
* {{alt|fa|ـم|tr=-am||colloquial}}

====Pronunciation====
{{fa-IPA|ham|teh=am|kbl=am}}
* This word never takes stress.

====Adverb====
{{head|fa|adverb|tr=ham}}<ref>{{R:pal:Mackenzie|ham|page=39}}</ref>

# [[also]], [[too]]; {{lb|fa|in negative constructions, chiefly as a post-positive particle}} [[either]], [[neither]]
#: {{syn|fa|نیز|tr=niz|q=formal}}
#: {{ux|fa|از این کتاب '''هم''' خوشم می‌آید.|tr=az in ketâb '''ham''' xošam mi-âyad.|t=I like this book, '''too'''.}}
#: {{ux|fa|فارسی '''هم''' بلد نیست.|tr=fârsi '''ham''' balad nist.|t=He doesn't speak Persian, '''either'''.}}
#* {{RQ:Selim Divan|79
|هر مرغ شاد و من که ز اندوه مرده‌ام<br>نگشایدم دل از گل و باغ و بهار '''هم'''
|هَر مُرْغ شَاد و مَن کِه زِه اَنْدُوه مُرْدَئَم<br>نَگُشَایَدَم دِل اَز گُل و بَاغ و بَهَار '''هَم'''
|Each of the birds are joyful, and how I have died of grief!<br>My heart does not open to the rose and the garden, '''nor''' to springtime.
}}
# [[even]]; {{n-g|often with {{m|fa|حتی|tr=hatta}}}}
#: {{ux|fa|حتی موش '''هم''' خوردند.|tr=hattâ muš '''ham''' xordand.|t='''Even''' rats were eaten.}}
#* {{RQ:Selim Divan|79
|غیر از حبیب خود نپرستم کس ار برند<br>خلق جهان بقتل مرا سوی دار '''هم'''
|غَیْر اَز حَبِیبِ خْوَد نَپَرَسْتَم کَس اَر بَرَنْد<br>خَلْقِ جَهَان بَ-قَتْل مَ-رَا سویِ دَار '''هَم'''
|I shall  not worship anyone other than my beloved, '''even''' if the people of the world drag me toward the gallows.}}
# {{lb|fa|as {{m|fa||هم|tr=ham}}... {{m|fa||هم|tr=ham}}}} [[both]]
#: {{ux|fa|یک سال بعد '''هم''' من و '''هم''' او ازدواج كرديم.|tr=yek sâl-e ba'd '''ham''' man o '''ham''' u ezdevâj kardim.|t=A year later, he and I married.}}
# {{n-g|Used in the non-initial clause to suggest a contrast.}}
#: {{ux|fa|او گپ می‌زد، من '''هم''' ساکت بودم.|tr=u gap mi-zad, man '''ham''' sâket budam.|t=He talked; '''as for''' me, I was silent.}}
#: {{ux|fa|بد نیست، خیلی '''هم''' خوب است.|tr=bad nist, xeyli '''ham''' xub ast.|t=It's not bad, '''rather''' it's very good.}}

=====Usage notes=====
* {{m|fa||هم|tr=ham}} directly follows the word or phrase it modifies, except in the coordinate construction {{m|fa||هم|tr=ham}}... {{m|fa||هم||tr=ham}} in which case it comes before.
: {{ux|fa|از این کتاب '''هم''' خوشم می‌آید.|tr=az in ketâb '''ham''' xošam mi-âyad.|I like this book, '''also'''. (''In addition to another book that I like, I like this one.'')}}
: {{ux|fa|من '''هم''' از این کتاب خوشم می‌آید.|tr=man '''ham''' az in ketâb xošam mi-âyad.|I '''also''' like this book. (''In addition to someone else who likes this book, I do.'')}}

====Pronoun====
{{head|fa|pronoun|tr=ham}}

# [[each other]]; {{short for|fa|همدیگر|tr=hamdigar}}

