## {{n-g|indicates repeated action}}
##: {{prefixusex|tft|kokehe|makokehe|t1=to cough|t2=to cough repeatedly}}
## {{n-g|indicates habitual action}}
## {{n-g|indicates an action undertaken by multiple subjects}}

