#: {{prefixusex|mqs|dadi|madadi|t1=to become|t2=to be, exist}}

=====Usage notes=====
The prefix ''ma-'' is subject to West Makian [[w:West Makian language#Vowel harmony|vowel harmony]], and as such may surface as ''me-'', ''mi-'', or ''mo-''.

=====Alternative forms=====
* {{alter|mqs|me-|mi-|mo-}}

===Etymology 2===

====Pronunciation====
