# {{lb|en|historical}} A [[traditional]] [[Spanish]] [[unit of measure|unit]] of [[mass]], [[equivalent]] to about 0.6 [[gram|g]].
# {{lb|en|historical}} A [[former]] [[gold]] [[Spanish]] [[gold coin|coin]], [[notionally]] [[equivalent]] to a tomin in [[weight]].
# {{lb|en|historical}} A [[former]] [[silver]] [[colonial]] [[Spanish]] [[coin]], [[notionally]] [[equivalent]] to a [[gold]] tomin in [[value]].

