===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|sa|inc-pro|*maH}}, from {{inh|sa|iir-pro|*maH}}, from {{inh|sa|ine-pro|*meh₁|pos=prohibitive particle}}. Cognate with {{cog|sq|mo||do not}}, {{cog|grc|μή||not, do not}}, {{cog|xcl|մի||no, not}}, {{cog|ae|𐬨𐬁}}, {{cog|peo|𐎶𐎠|ts=mā}} (whence {{cog|fa|مـ|tr=ma-}}).<ref>{{R:sa:EWAia|vol=2|page=343}}</ref>

====Particle====
{{head|sa|particle|tr=mā́}}

# [[don't]] ({{n-g|prohibitive particle}})
#* {{Q|sa||RV|1|5|10|quote='''मा''' नो॒ मर्ता॑ अ॒भि द्रु॑हन्।<br> त॒नूना॑मिंद्र गिर्वणः।<br> ईशा॑नो यवया व॒धम्॥| tr= '''mā́''' no mártā abhí druhan <br> tanū́nām indra girvaṇaḥ <br> ī́śāno yavayā vadhám|trans=O Indra, thou who lovest song, <br> '''do not''' let any man hurt our bodies. <br> Keep slaughter far from us for thou canst.}}

