Ultimately from {{der|chg|trk-pro|-}} {{com|trk-pro|*ka-|*-lig|t1=interrogative stem|t2=adjectival suffix|nocat=1}}

===Pronoun===
{{head|chg|pronoun|tr=qalay}}

# [[how]]
#* {{quote-book|chg|author=[[w:Ahmad Yasawi|Yasawi, Ahmad]]|title=حِکَم حضرت سلطان العارفین خواجه احمد یسوی|trans-title=Words of Wisdom of Hazrat Sultan-al-Arifin Khwaja Ahmad Yasawi|page=77|text=[[اولار]] [[وقت]][[ـده|ده]] '''قلای'''‌[[ـسین|سین]] [[دیماک|دی]][[ـب|ب]] [[حال]][[ـی|ی]][[ـن|ن]] [[سورماق|سور]][[ـدو|دو]][[ـم|م]]|tr=Ular väqtdä '''‌qalay'''‌sin deb halin sordum|url=https://tile.loc.gov/storage-services/service/gdc/gdcwdl/wd/l_/06/93/7/wdl_06937/wdl_06937.pdf|location=Kazan|year_published=1912}}

