====Adverb====
{{en-adv}}

# {{label|en|obsolete|colloquial}} Likely.
#* {{RQ:Shakespeare Much Ado About Nothing|2|3|text=DON PEDRO. May be she doth but counterfeit.<br>CLAUDIO. Faith, '''like''' enough.|footer= Indeed, quite likely.}}
# {{lb|en|archaic|or|rare}} In a like or similar manner.
#* {{RQ:KJV|Psalms|103|13|text='''Like''' as a father pitieth his children, so the Lord pitieth them that fear him.}}

====Noun====
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{senseid|en|the likes of}} ''(sometimes as '''the likes of''')'' Someone similar to a given person, or something similar to a given object; a comparative; a [[type]]; a [[sort]].
#* {{RQ:Doyle Land of Mist|passage="Such things do happen and centre round the wicked medium. You can get down into a region which is akin to the popular idea of witchcraft, it is dishonest to deny it." "'''Like''' attracts '''like'''," explained Mrs. Mailey[.]}}
#* '''1935''', {{w|Winston Churchill}} on {{w|T.E. Lawrence}}
#*: We shall never see his '''like''' again.
#* {{quote-av
|en
|date=August 6, 1945
|author=w:Harry S. Truman
|title=VT2008-9-2 President Truman Announces Bombing of Hiroshima
|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20211102003246/https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=n_A8LPtuX5c
|archivedate=02 November 2021
|publisher=w:Harry S. Truman Presidential Library and Museum
|id=National Archives Identifier: [https://catalog.archives.gov/id/23630 23630]
|time=01:49
|text=It was to spare the Japanese people from utter destruction that the ultimatum of July the 26th was issued at Potsdam. Their leaders promptly rejected that ultimatum. If they do not now accept our terms, they may expect a rain of ruin from the air, the '''like''' of which has never been seen on this Earth.}}
#* {{quote-book|1=en|year=1982|author=w:Douglas Adams|title=Life, the Universe and Everything|page=93|text=In fact it would be fair to say that he had reached a level of annoyance the '''like''' of which had never been seen in the Universe.}}
#: {{ux|en|There were bowls full of sweets, chocolates and the '''like'''.}}
#: {{ux|en|It was something the '''likes''' of which I had never seen before.}}
# {{lb|en|golf}} The [[stroke]] that [[equalize]]s the number of strokes played by the opposing player or side.
#: {{ux|en|to play the '''like'''}}

