* {{desc|ota|مثل|tr=misl|bor=1}}
** {{desc|tr|misil|}}
* {{desc|fa|مثل|tr=mesl|bor=1}}
* {{desc|pa|ਮਿਸਲ|bor=1}}
* {{desc|sw|mithili|bor=1}} 

=====See also=====
* {{l|ar|كَـ}}, {{l|ar|نَظِير}}, {{l|ar|سِيّ}}

