===Etymology 2===
From {{inh|en|enm|min}}, from {{inh|en|ang|min|t=less; small, mean}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*minniz|t=less}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*mey-|t=small, little}}. Cognate with {{cog|sco|min|t=less, lesser}}, {{cog|fy|min|t=small, bad}}, {{cog|nl|min|t=less, small}}, {{cog|nds|minn|t=small, low, lean}}, {{cog|de|minder|t=less}}, {{cog|is|minna|t=less}}, {{cog|la|minus|t=less}}.

====Alternative forms====
