Cognate with {{cog|ofs|mīn}}, {{cog|osx|mīn}} ({{cog|nl|mijn}}), {{cog|goh|mīn}} ({{cog|de|mein}}), {{cog|non|mínn}} ({{cog|sv|min}}), {{cog|got|𐌼𐌴𐌹𐌽𐍃}}.

