==English==
{{Zodiac|en|Image:Pisces.svg|Aquarius|Aries|w=Pisces (astrology)}}

===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*peysḱ-}}
From {{uder|en|la|piscēs}}, the nominative plural of {{m|la|piscis||fish}}.

===Pronunciation===
