Page 32 منہ: Skipped, no changes
Page 32 منہ: -------- begin text --------
==Punjabi==

===Noun===
{{pa-noun|g=m|head=مُن٘ہ}}

# {{alternative form of|pa|مُون٘ہہ}}

==Urdu==
{{wp|lang=ur}}
{{Wiktionary:Picture dictionary/ur:head}}

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ur|منھ|tr=mũh|}}

===Etymology===
{{etydate|c|1503}} as {{inh|ur|hi-mid|مُن٘ہ||[[indifferent]]}}, {{inh+|ur|pra-sau|𑀫𑀼𑀳|nocap=1}}, {{m|pra-sau|𑀫𑀼𑀖}}, from {{inh|ur|sa|मुख|tr=múkha||mouth, face, visage}}. Compare {{cog|pa|مُون٘ہہ}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ur-IPA|mũh}}
* {{rhymes|ur|ʊ̃ɦ|s=1}}

===Noun===
{{ur-noun|g=m|head=مُن٘ہ}}

# {{lb|ur|anatomy}} [[mouth]]
#: {{syn|ur|دَہان}}
#: {{ux|ur|تُمْہارے '''مُن٘ہ''' میں کْیا ہَے؟|What's in your '''mouth'''?}}
# {{lb|ur|anatomy}} [[face]]
#: {{syn|ur|چہرہ|tr=cehrā}}
#: {{ux|ur|اُس نے میرے '''مُن٘ہ''' پَر پانی پھین٘کا۔|He threw water on my '''face'''.}}
# {{lbl|ur|figurative}} [[reputation]]
#: {{ux|ur|سَماج کو کْیا '''مُن٘ہ''' دِکھائیں گے؟|We'll have no '''reputation''' in society!|lit=What '''face''' can we show society?}}
# {{lb|ur|figuratively}} [[bad]] [[mood]]
#: {{ux|ur|اُس کا '''مُن٘ہ''' بَنا ہوا ہَے|He is in a '''bad mood'''.|lit=He has a '''face''' on.|subst=ہوا//ہُئا}}

====Declension====
{{ur-noun-c-m|مُن٘ہ|mũh}}

===Further reading===
* {{R:ur:UDB|w=257225}}
* {{R:ur:Rekhta}}
* {{R:ur:Qureshi}}
