===Etymology===
{{bor+|ur|fa-cls|تشویشناک|tr=tašwīšnāk}}, from {{af|fa|تشویش|ـناک|tr1=tašwīš|tr2=-nāk|nocat=1}}, the first element from {{der|ur|ar|-}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ur-IPA|taśvīśnāk}}

===Adjective===
{{ur-adj|head=تَشْوِیشْناک|tr=tašvīšnāk}}

# [[someone]] who [[creates]] [[distraction]], [[discomfort]], [[nervousness]], [[anxiousness]], [[restlessness]]
# [[fearful]], [[scary]]

===References===
* {{R:ur:Pakistani Dictionary}}
* {{R:ur:Rekhta}}
