==Persian==

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|fa|pal|tr= zy(w)ndk'|ts=zīndag}}. Equivalent to {{af|fa|زی|ـنده|tr1=ziy|tr2=ande}}, with {{m|fa|زی|tr=ziy}} being the present stem of {{m|fa|زیستن|tr=zistan}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{fa-IPA|zin`da}}

====Adjective====
{{fa-adj|tr=zende}}

# [[alive]]
#* '''10<sup>th</sup> Century CE''', [[w:Ferdowsi|Ferdowsi]], ''[[w:Shahnameh|Shahnameh]]''
#*: {{quote|fa|از آن پس نمیرم که من '''زنده'''‌ام<br>که تخم سخن من پراگنده‌ام|tr=az ân pas namiram ke man '''zende'''-am<br>ke toxm-e soxan man parâgande-'am|t=I shall stay '''alive''' for ever<br>for I am the one who has spread the word!}}
# [[living]]
#: {{uxi|fa|درختان هم '''زنده‌'''اند!|tr=deraxtân ham '''zende'''-'and!|t=Trees are '''living''' too!}}

=====Derived terms=====
* {{l|fa|زندگی|tr=zendegi, zendagi|t=life, existence}}
* {{l|fa|زنده باد|tr=zenda bâd, zenda bâd|t=long live, [[zindabad]]}}

=====Descendants=====
* {{desc|bn|জিন্দা|tr=zinda|bor=1}}
* {{desc|ur|زندہ|tr=zinda|bor=1}}

=====References=====
# {{R:fa:Dehkhoda}}
# PAHLAVICA - [https://pahlavica.org/search/view/3/16087/|"'zy(w)ndk'"].

===Etymology 2===
From {{inh|fa|pal|tr=zndk'|ts=zandag}}.

====Adjective====
{{fa-adj|tr=zande|c=+}}

# {{lb|fa|archaic}} [[colossal]] and [[formidable]]
#* '''10<sup>th</sup> Century CE''', [[w:Ferdowsi|Ferdowsi]], ''[[w:Shahnameh|Shahnameh]]''
#*: {{quote|fa|سوی سام نِیرَم نِهادند روی<br>اَبا '''زَنده''' پیلان پرخاشجوی|tr=soy-e sâme neyram nehâdand ruy<br>abâ '''zande''' pilân-e parxâšjuy|t=They embarked upon their campaign towards [[w:Sām|Sām]],<br>with their '''formidable''', rampant war elephants.}}

=====Related terms=====
* {{l|fa|ژَنده|tr=žande}}
* {{l|fa|گُنده|tr=gonde}}

=====References=====
# {{R:fa:Dehkhoda}}
# PAHLAVICA - [https://pahlavica.org/search/view/1/16036/|"zndk'"].
