* {{R:ar:Freytag|volume=4|pages=243–244}}
* {{R:ar:Kazimirski|volume=2|pages=1202–1203}}
* {{R:ar:Steingass|page=1103}}
* {{R:ar:Wehr-4|page=1108}}
* {{R:ar:Wehr-5-de|pages=1248–1249}}
