From {{inh|fa|pal|𐭭𐭥𐭪𐭩|tr=nōg}}, from {{inh|fa|peo|𐎴𐎺|ts=nava}}, from {{inh|fa|ira-pro|*náwah}} (compare {{cog|kmr|nû}}, {{cog|ps|نوی|tr=nëway}}, {{cog|os|ног}}, {{cog|ae|𐬥𐬀𐬎𐬎𐬀}}), from {{inh|fa|iir-pro|-}} (compare {{cog|sa|नव|tr=náva}}, {{cog|hi|नया}}) ultimately from {{inh|fa|ine-pro|*néwos}} (compare {{cog|el|νέος}}, {{cog|ru|но́вый}}, {{cog|it|nuovo}} and {{cog|en|new}}).

===Pronunciation===
{{fa-IPA|naw}}

===Adjective===
{{fa-regional|نو|نو|нав}}
{{fa-adj|tr=now|c=+}}

# [[new]], [[pristine]], [[unused]] (of an item)
# [[fresh]]

====Antonyms====
* {{l|fa|کهنه|tr=kohne}}

====Related terms====
* {{l|fa|نوروز|tr=nowruz}}
* {{l|fa|نوین|tr=navin}}
* {{l|fa|نواختر|tr=now-axtar}}

====Descendants====
* {{desc|ota|نو|tr=nev}}

==Sindhi==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|sd|sa|नवन्}}.

===Numeral===
{{head|sd|numeral|tr=navan}}

# [[nine]]

==Urdu==

===Etymology 1===
{{inh+|ur|sa|नवन्|tr=návan}}. Ultimately from {{inh|ur|iir-pro|-}}, from {{inh|ur|ine-pro|*h₁néwn̥}}.

====Numeral====
{{number box|ur|9}}
{{ur-num-card|tr=nau|hi=नौ}}

# {{cln|ur|cardinal numbers}} [[nine]]

===Etymology 2===
{{bor+|ur|fa-cls|نو|tr=naw}}. {{doublet|ur|نیا|tr1=nayā}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{ur-IPA|nau}}
* {{rhymes|ur|ɔː|s=1}}

====Adjective====
{{ur-adj|head=نَو}}

# {{lb|ur|formal}} [[new]]
#: {{uxa|ur|'''نو''' صدر مملکت|tr='''nau''' sadr mumlikat|'''new''' head of state}}

