==Sanskrit==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|sa|नवीय}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|sa|inc-pro|*náwyas}}, from {{inh|sa|iir-pro|*náwyas}}, from {{inh|sa|ine-pro|*néwyos}}, from {{m|ine-pro|*néwos}}.

===Adjective===
{{sa-adj|tr=návya}}

# [[new]]

====Declension====
{{sa-decl-adj-mfn|návya|návyā|návya}}

====Descendants====
