==Punjabi==

===Etymology===
{{root|pa|ine-pro|*new-|id=new}}
{{inh+|pa|pra-pai}} (compare {{cog|pra-sau|𑀡𑀯𑀺𑀅}}), from {{inh|pa|sa|नविय|tr=náviya}}, {{m|sa|नव्य|tr=návya}}, from {{inh|pa|iir-pro|*náwyas}}, from {{inh|pa|ine-pro|*néwyos}}. Compare {{cog|ur|نیا|tr=nayā}}.

===Pronunciation===
