* {{qual|Singlish and [[Manglish]] particles}}: {{l|en|ah#Particle}}, {{l|en|hor#Etymology 2}}, {{l|en|know#Etymology 3}}, {{l|en|lah#Etymology 2}}, {{l|en|leh}}, {{l|en|liao#Particle}}, {{l|en|lor}}, {{l|en|mah#Etymology 2}}, {{l|en|meh#Etymology 2}}, {{l|en|sia#Particle}}, {{l|en|what#Particle}}

