** {{IPA|en|/ɪt/|a=RP,GA,GenAus}} {{enPR|ĭt}}
** {{audio|en|en-uk-it.ogg|a=UK}}
** {{audio|en|en-us-it.ogg|a=US}}
** {{IPA|en|/ɘt/|a=NZ}}
** {{rhymes|en|ɪt|s=1}}
* {{qualifier|unstressed}}
