===Determiner===
{{head|en|determiner|cat2=possessive determiners}}

# {{lb|en|obsolete}} [[its|Its]].
#* {{RQ:KJV|Leviticus|25|5||That which groweth of '''it''' owne accord of thy haruest, thou ſhalt not reape, neither gather the grapes of thy Uine vndreſſed: for it is a yeere of reſt vnto the land.|footer=replaced by "its" in the 1769 Oxford Standard Text}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# One who is neither a [[he]] nor a [[she]]; a [[creature]]; a [[dehumanize]]d being.
#* {{quote-text|en|year=1920|author=w:Herman Cyril McNeile|title=w:Bulldog Drummond| chapter=1| passage=His master glanced up quickly, and removed the letter from his hands. "I'm surprised at you, James," he remarked severely. "A secretary should control itself. Don't forget that the perfect secretary is an '''it''': an automatic machine—a thing incapable of feeling.…"}}
#* {{quote-text|en|year=1995|author=Neil Weiner; Sharon E. Robinson Kurpius| title=Shattered innocence| page=8| passage=Too often, children become an "'''it'''" in their homes and their humanness is devalued.}}
# {{senseid|en|tag}} The [[person]] who [[chase]]s and tries to [[catch]] the other [[player]]s in the [[playground]] game of [[tag]].
#: {{ux|en|In the next game, Adam and Tom will be '''it'''…}}
#* {{quote-text|en|year=2000|author=Katherine T. Thomas; Amelia M. Lee; Jerry R. Thomas|title=Physical education for children|page=464| passage=When there are only two children left who haven't been tagged, I will stop the game, and we will start over with those children starting as the '''Its'''.}}
# {{lb|en|British}} A game of [[tag]].
#: {{ux|en|Let's play '''it''' at breaktime.}}
# {{lb|en|informal}} A desirable characteristic, as being fashionable.
#: ''Man, he's really got '''it'''.''
#: ''She's the '''it''' girl, at least for this Fall.''
# {{lb|en|informal}} Sexual intercourse.
#: ''OMG, they were doing '''it''' in the storage room.''
# {{lb|en|informal}} Sex appeal.
#: ''She really has '''it''' going on.''
# {{alt case|en|It||force in the [[vitalist]] approach of {{w|Georg Groddeck}}}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=1988|author=Frederic D. Homer|title=The Interpretation of Illness|publisher=Purdue University Press| isbn=9780911198881| page=27| passage=For Groddeck, the '''it''' is given, unknowable, and he does not try to conceptualize drives or forces. Early life and sexuality permeate {{...}}}}
# {{alt case|en|It||the [[id]]}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2015|author=Charis Charalampous|title=Rethinking the Mind-Body Relationship in Early Modern Literature, Philosophy, and Medicine: The Renaissance of the Body| publisher=Routledge| isbn=9781317584209| page=36| passage={{...}} thus reversing the roles of the I and the '''it''', the former now occupying the place of the latter and vice versa. An awareness of our bisubjective nature (it and me) requires thus an I as a third term that slides between&nbsp;{{...}}}}

====Translations====
{{trans-top|The person who chases others in the game of tag}}{{multitrans|data=
* French: {{tt+|fr|chat|m}}, {{tt+|fr|loup|m}}
* German: {{t+|de|Fänger|m}}, ''but mostly expressed with the verb'' {{l|de|sein|t=to be}}, '' e.g.'' Wer ist? – Du bist!
* Polish: {{tt+|pl|berek|m}}
* Swedish: {{t+|sv|datten|c}}
* Tagalog: {{t|tl|taya}}
* Turkish: {{tt+|tr|ebe}}
}}
{{trans-bottom}}

{{trans-see|the game of tag|tag}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

# {{lb|en|colloquial}} Most [[fashionable]], [[popular]]{{,}} or [[in vogue]].
#* {{quote-journal|en|year=2007|month=September|journal=Vibe|volume=15|number=9|page=202
|passage=Going away for the weekend and feel the need to profile en route? This is the "'''it'''" bag.}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2010|author=David Germain|title=[https://web.archive.org/web/20100507032400/http://today.msnbc.msn.com/id/36481998/ns/entertainment-movies/ Hilarious ‘Kick-Ass’ delivers bloody fun]|publisher=Associated Press
|passage=With Hit Girl, Moretz is this year's '''It''' Girl, alternately sweet, savage and scary.}}
#* {{quote-web|date=2021-10-04|en|title=Are Golden Goose Sneakers Worth It? My Honest Review Of Golden Goose Sneakers|author=Robert P|work=Gold Talk Club|url=https://www.goldtalkclub.com/are-golden-goose-sneakers-worth-it/|passage=These Italian made sneakers quickly became an '''it''' shoe and the trend is not going anywhere any time soon!}}

