#* {{quote-book|yol|year=1867|page=53|title=GLOSSARY OF THE DIALECT OF FORTH AND BARGY|passage=Leth '''it''' be.|translation=Let '''it''' be.}}
#* {{quote-book|yol|year=1867|page=56|title=GLOSSARY OF THE DIALECT OF FORTH AND BARGY|passage=Dinna mell wi' '''it'''.|translation=Don't meddle with '''it'''.}}

