#:: It '''is''' winter.
#* {{quote-journal|kl|date=May 7 1998|titleurl=http://timarit.is/view_page_init.jsp?issId=270536&pageId=3849180&lang=da|title=Tasiilami efterskoleqalernissaa Jakob Sivertsen-ip sulissutigaa|journal=Atuagagdliutit / Grønlandsposten
|passage=Inatsisartunut ilaasortaq Jakob Sivertsen Atassum[[-meer|meer]][[-toq|soq]] ilungersornertuu'''ju'''voq.
|translation=MP Jakob Sivertsen, of [[w:Atassut|Atassut]], '''is''' diligent.}}
#* {{quote-text|kl|year=1992|chapter=[http://timarit.is/view_page_init.jsp?issId=269857&pageId=3834041&lang=da Meeqqakka]|title=Atuagagdliutit/Grønlandsposten
|passage=Ernerput anguteqatiminoortartunngorsimavoq (19-inik ukioqarluni paasineqarpoq), niviarsiararlu nukarleq arnaqatiminoortartunngorsimalluni. Akulleq pissusissamisoortu'''u'''voq.
|translation=Our son has become gay (it was discovered when he was 19 years old), and the youngest girl has become a lesbian. The middle [child] '''is''' as she should be [i.e. heterosexual].}}

====Usage notes====
May become additive after a strong ''q'' base.

