==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en|en-au-come of age.ogg|a=AU}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb|head=[[come]] [[of age]]|come<,,came,come> of age}}

# {{lb|en|idiomatic}} To reach a specific age where one is [[legally]] considered to be an [[adult]].
# {{lb|en|idiomatic|by extension}} To [[mature]], or become fully [[developed]].
#* {{quote-video game|en|developer=w:BioWare|title={{w|Mass Effect (video game)|Mass Effect}}|location=Redwood City|publisher=Electronic Arts|year=2008|system=PC|scene=Profile Codex entry|isbn=9780784546642|oclc=246633669|passage=Eager to find a better life, you joined the Alliance military when you '''came of age'''. You volunteered for an expedition to Akuze: a lush world on the outskirts of Alliance space that had suddenly dropped out of contact.}}

