{{also|علي|علی|غلى|غلي}}
==Arabic==
{{ar-rootbox|ع ل ي}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|ar|sem-pro|*ʕalay-|t=on, over}}. Cognate with {{cog|akk|𒌋𒅗|tr=eli}}, {{cog|he|עַל|tr='al}}, {{m|he|עֲלֵי|tr='aléi}}, {{cog|arc|עַל|tr=ʿal}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{ar-IPA|عَلَى}}
* {{audio|ar|Ar-على.ogg}}
* {{rhymes|ar|aː|laː}}
* {{homophones|ar|عَلَا}}

====Preposition====
{{ar-prep|عَلَى}}

# [[on]], [[over]]
# [[against]]
#: {{usex|ar|يَوْمٌ لَكَ وَيَوْمٌ '''عَلَيْكَ'''|one day for you, and one day '''against you'''}}
#: {{usex|ar|سَجَّلَ ٱللَّاعِبُ خَمْسَةَ أَهْدَافٍ '''عَلَى''' خَصْمِهِ|The player scored five goals '''against''' his opponent.}}
# {{n-g|expresses obligation}}
#* {{RQ:Qur'an|24|54|passage=وَمَا عَلَى الرَّسُولِ إلَّا الْبَلَاغُ الْمُبِينُ|translation=And the Messenger's only duty is to deliver messages clearly}}
# [[despite]]
#* {{RQ:Qur'an|13|6
|passage=وَإِنَّ رَبَّكَ لَذُو مَغْفِرَةٍ لِلنَّاسِ '''عَلَى''' ظُلْمِهِمْ
|translation=And indeed, your Lord is full of forgiveness for the people '''despite''' their wrongdoing
|subst=وَإِنَّ/وَ-إِنَّ,لِلنَّاسِ/لِ-ٱلنَّاسِ}}
# [[on condition]], [[provided]]
#* {{RQ:Qur'an|28|27
|passage=قَالَ إِنِّي أُرِيدُ أَنْ أُنْكِحَكَ إِحْدَى ٱبْنَتَيَّ هَاتَيْنِ '''عَلَى''' أَن تَأْجُرَنِي ثَمَانِيَ حِجَجٍ
|translation=He said, "Indeed, I wish to wed you one of these, my two daughters, '''on the condition''' that you serve me for eight years,"}}

=====Inflection=====
{{ar-prep-auto|عَلَى|ʕalā}}

=====Antonyms=====
* {{antsense|against}} {{l|ar|لِـ}}

=====Related terms=====
* {{l|ar|بِنَاءاً عَلَيْهْ}}
* {{l|ar|صَلَّى ٱللّٰهُ عَلَيْهِ وَآلِهِ وَسَلَّمَ|tr=ṣallā llāhu ʕalayhī wa-ʔālihī wa-sallama}}
* {{l|ar|عَلَيْهِ ٱلصَّلَاةُ وَٱلسَّلَامُ|tr=ʕalayhi ṣ-ṣalātu wa-s-salāmu}}
* {{l|ar|عَلَيْهِ ٱلسَّلَامُ}}
* {{l|ar|سَلَامُ ٱللّٰهِ عَلَيْهِ}}
* {{l|ar|عَلَامَ}}

=====Descendants=====
* {{desc|mt|għal}}

{{q|via third-person singular masculine form {{m|ar|عَلَيْهِ}}}}:
* {{desc|az|əleyh|bor=1}}
* {{desc|fa|علیه|tr='aleyh|bor=1}}
* {{desc|uz|alayh|bor=1}}

