==North Levantine Arabic==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|apc|ع|tr=ʕa-}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|apc|ar|عَلَى}}.

===Preposition===
{{head|apc|preposition|tr=ʕala}}

# [[on]]; [[upon]]; [[onto]]
# {{lbl|apc|by extension}} with a [[hint]] of
# [[about]] (a topic)
# [[to]] (a place)
#: {{ux|apc|عم نسافر ع بيروت|tr=ʕam nsāfir '''ʕa''' bayrūt|t=We’re travelling '''to''' Beirut.}}
# {{ngd|Used with an adjective given the definite article, marking it as an adverb}}

====Usage notes====
* The personal forms are built from the stem ''ʕlay-'' or ''ʕalay-'' as in {{m|apc|عليكن|tr=ʕ(a)laykun|t=on you}}.
* Sense 2 is construed as ''"A {{l|apc|على}} B"''; literally, "A on B". A is the dominant element in such a construction, not B, even though this seems to conflict with a literal reading:
*# {{ux|apc|بوظا على جوز
| tr = būẓa ʕala jōz
| t = walnut-flavored ice cream, or ice cream with walnuts
| lit = ice cream on walnuts
| nocat = 1
}}
*# {{ux|apc|جوز على بوظا
| tr = jōz ʕala būẓa
| t = ice-cream-flavored walnuts
| lit = walnuts on ice cream
| nocat = 1
}}

==South Levantine Arabic==

===Etymology 1===
{{Wiktionary:Picture dictionary/ajp:prep-place}}
From {{inh|ajp|ar|عَلَى}}.

====Alternative forms====
* ''Shortened form'': {{alter|ajp|عـ|tr=ʕa-}}

====Pronunciation====
* {{ajp-IPA|ʕala<p:ˈʕa.la>}}
* {{audio|ajp|LL-Q55633582 (ajp)-Muhammad (AdrianAbdulBaha)-على.wav|a=Ramallah}}

====Preposition====
{{head|ajp|preposition|tr=ʕala}}

# [[to]], [[toward]]
#: {{ant|ajp|من|tr=min}}
#: {{ux|ajp|[[ختيار|الختيار]] [[راح]] [[على|ع]][[مستشفى|المستشفى]].|tr=il-ḵityār rāḥ ʕal-mustašfa|t=The old man went '''to''' the hospital.}}
#: {{ux|ajp|[[إمّ|إمّي]] [[دخل|دخلت]] [[على|ع]][[بيت|البيت]].|tr=ʔimmi daḵlat ʕal-bēt|t=My mother went into the house.|lit=My mother entered '''to''' the house.}}
#: {{ux|ajp|[[قدّيش]] [[دفع|دفعت]] [[على|عليه]]؟|tr=ʔaddēš dafaʕt ʕalēh|t=How much did you pay for it?|lit=How much did you pay '''toward''' it?}}
# {{lb|ajp|location}} [[on]], [[onto]], [[over]]
#: {{syn|ajp|فوق|tr=fōʔ|t=above}}
#: {{ux|ajp|[[حطّ]][[ه]] [[على|ع]][[طاولة|الطاولة]].|tr=ḥoṭṭo ʕaṭ-ṭāwle|t=Put it '''on''' the table.}}
# {{lb|ajp|time}} [[at]], [[on]]
#: {{ux|ajp|[[خلّى|خلّينا]] [[التقى|نلتقي]] [[على]] [[ساعة]] [[ستّة]].|tr=ḵallīna niltʔi '''ʕala''' sāʕa sitte|t=Let's meet '''at''' six o'clock.}}
# {{lb|ajp|auxiliary}} [[must]], [[should]]
#: {{syn|ajp|لازم|tr=lāzem}}
#: {{ux|ajp|[[قرّر|قرّرنا]] [[عمل|نعمل]] [[اللي]] [[على|علينا]] [[و]][[اتّكل|نتّكل]] [[على]] [[ربّ|ربّنا]].|tr=ʔarrarna niʕmil illi '''ʕalēna''' w nittakil '''ʕala''' rabbna|t=We resolved to do what '''we must''' and trust '''in''' God.}}
#: {{ux|ajp|[[إل|إلي]] [[على|عليك]] [[ألف]] [[شيكل]].|tr=ʔili '''ʕalēk''' ʔalf šēkel|t=You owe me one thousand shekels.|lit='''You must''' to me one thousand shekels.}}

=====Inflection=====
