==English==
{{wikipedia}}
[[Image:Flickr - cyclonebill - Tabbouleh.jpg|thumb|tabbouleh]]

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|tabboleh}}
* {{l|en|tabooley}}
* {{l|en|tabooli}}
* {{l|en|taboulah}}
* {{l|en|taboule}}
* {{l|en|tabouleh}}
* {{l|en|tabouli}}

===Etymology===
From {{uder|en|ar|تَبُّولَة|}}; the final vowel preceding the usually silent "{{l|ar|ة}}" (also written as "{{l|ar|ه}}" in casual writing) can be pronounced as /e/ or /i/ in [[Levantine]] dialects.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/təˈbuːli/|/təˈbuːleɪ/}}
* {{rhymes|en|uːli|uːleɪ|s1=3}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-|s}}

