*: {{desc|pa|ਬਦ|sclb=1}}
*: {{desc|pa|بد|tr=bad|sclb=1}}

====References====
* {{R:pal:Mackenzie:1971|wad|page=85}}
* {{R:fa:Nourai|page=46}}

===Etymology 2===
From {{inh|fa|pal|-pt'|tr=-bed}}, from {{inh|fa|iir-pro|*pátiš}} (compare {{cog|xcl|պետ|}}, an Iranian borrowing), from {{inherited|fa|ine-pro|*pótis|gloss=master}}.

====Noun====
{{fa-noun|tr=-bad, -bed, -bod}}

# [[lord]], [[master]]

====References====
* {{R:STEIN|بد}}
* {{R:pal:Mackenzie|-bed|page=18}}

==South Levantine Arabic==

===Etymology===
From {{der|ajp|ar|بِوِدِّ}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ajp-IPA|bidd<p:bɪd>}}

===Preposition===
{{ajp-prep|head=بدّ|tr=bidd-}}

# {{lb|ajp|false verb}} to [[want]]
#: {{syn|ajp|حبّ|tr=ḥabb}}
#: {{ux|ajp|[[بدّ]][[ك]] [[قهوة]]؟|tr='''biddak''' ʔahwe?|t='''Do you want''' some coffee?}}
#: {{ux|ajp|[[بد]][[ي]] [[شاف|أشوف]][[ك]] [[كل]] [[يوم]] [[يا]] [[حبيب]][[ي]].|tr='''biddi''' ʔašūfak kull yōm ya ḥabībi.|t='''I want''' to see you every day, my dear.}}
# {{lb|ajp|false verb, by extension}} to [[need]]
#: {{syn|ajp|احتاج|tr=iḥtāj}}
#: {{ux|ajp|[[ابن]][[ي]] [[مريض]] [[كتير]] [[و]][[بدّ|بدّه]] [[دوا]] [[ضروري]].|tr=ibni marīḍ ktīr w '''biddo''' dawa ḍurūri.|t=My son is very sick and '''needs''' medicine.|lit=My son is very sick and '''wants''' medicine necessarily.}}
# {{lb|ajp|auxiliary}} [[will]], [[going to]]
#: {{syn|ajp|رح|tr=raḥ}}
#: {{ux|ajp|[[بد]][[ي]] [[مرق|أمرق]] [[ل]][[عند]][[ه]] [[بكرة]].|tr='''biddi''' ʔamroʔ la-ʕindo bukra.|t='''I'm going to''' go to his house tomorrow.}}

====Usage notes====
* Similar to terms like {{m|ajp|عند|tr=ʕind|t=to have}}, the term {{m|ajp|بدّ|tr=bidd}} is "conjugated" with enclitic pronouns. Unlike {{m|ajp|عند|tr=ʕind}}, however, {{m|ajp|بدّ|tr=bidd}} has no inherent meaning and can never be used entirely by itself.

====Inflection====
{{ajp-prep-inflection
|base={{l-self|ajp|بدّ|tr=bidd}}
|1s={{l|ajp|بدّي|tr=biddi}}
|2ms={{l|ajp|بدّك|tr=biddak}}
|2fs={{l|ajp|بدّك|tr=biddek}}
|3ms={{l|ajp|بدّه|tr=biddo}}
|3fs={{l|ajp|بدها|tr=bidha}}
|1p={{l|ajp|بدنا|tr=bidna}}
|2p={{l|ajp|بدكم|tr=bidkom}}
|3p={{l|ajp|بدهم|tr=bidhom}}
}}

