==Persian==
{{wikipedia|lang=fa}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|fa|pal|tr=čšmk'|ts=čašmag|t=spring, source}}, from {{m|pal|tr=čšm|ts=čašm|t=eye}} + {{m|pal|tr=-k'|ts=-ag}},<ref>{{R:pal:Mackenzie:1971|čšmk'|page=21}}</ref> equivalent to modern {{af|fa|چشم|tr1=čašm|t1=eye|ـه|tr2=-e}}.

A relation between eye and spring seems to be common in the area. Compare {{ncog|bal|چمگ|tr=cammag|t=spring, source}} from {{m|bal|چم|tr=camm|t=eye}}, {{ncog|glk|چمار|tr=čumâr|t=spring}} from {{m|glk|چم|tr=čum|t=eye}}, {{ncog|ar|عَيْن||t=spring, eye}}, and {{ncog|xcl|ակն|t=eye, spring}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{fa-IPA|čaš`ma|ir=čiš`ma, čaš`ma}}
* {{audio|fa|Fa-چشمه.ogg|a=Iran}}

