{{ajp-suffix|head=ـكم|g=p|tr=-kom}}

# {{senseid|ajp|pronoun}} {{form of|ajp|Enclitic form|انتو|إنتو|tr=ʔintu}}
# [[you]], [[your]] {{qual|plural}}

=====See also=====
{{ajp-enclitic pronouns}}

===Etymology 2===
From {{inh|ajp|ar|كَمْ}}.

====Alternative forms====
* {{alter|ajp|أكم|tr=ʔakam}}

====Determiner====
{{ajp-determiner|tr=kam, kamm}}

# [[how many]] {{ajp-cprep|من}}
#: {{ux|ajp|[[كم]] [[مرّة]] [[سمع|سمعت]]: [[شو]] [[ممكن]] [[واحد|الواحد]] [[عمل|يعمل]] [[ب]][[الأردن]]؟|tr='''kam''' marra smeʕt: šu mumken il-wāḥad yaʕmel bil-ʔurdun?|t='''How many''' times did you hear: What can someone do in Jordan?}}
# [[a few]], [[some]], [[several]] {{ajp-cprep|من}}
#: {{syn|ajp|بعض|tr=baʕḍ}}
#: {{ux|ajp|[[خلّى|خلّي]][[نا]] [[التقى|نلتقي]] [[ب]][[القدس]] [[بعد]] [[كم]] [[يوم]].|tr=ḵallīna niltaʔi bil-ʔuds baʕd '''kam''' yōm.|t=Let's meet in Jerusalem after '''a few''' days.}}
# [[how long]] {{ajp-cprep|إلـ}}
#: {{ux|ajp|[[كم]] [[إل]][[ها]] [[تعلم|بتتعلّم]] [[عربي]]؟|tr= '''kam''' ʔilha btitʕallam ʕarabi?|t='''How long''' has she been learning Arabic?}}

=====Usage notes=====
* {{m-self|ajp|كم|tr=kam}} is always followed by a singular noun.

=====Related terms=====
* {{l|ajp|قديش|tr=ʔaddēš|t=how much}}

{{cln|ajp|interrogative determiners}}
