From {{inh|ajp|ar|اِسْتَقْبَلَ}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ajp-IPA|istaʔbal<p:ɪsˈtaʔ.bal>}}
* {{audio|ajp|LL-Q55633582 (ajp)-Khalil.rantissi-استَقبَل.wav|a=al-Lidd}}

===Verb===
{{ajp-verb|X|tr=istaʔbal|pres=بستقبل|prestr=bistaʔbel}}

# to [[receive]]
#: {{ux|ajp|[[استقبل]][[ني]] [[في]] [[مكتب]][[ه]].|tr='''istaʔbal'''ni fī maktabo|t='''He received''' me in his office.}}

====Conjugation====
