# {{active participle of|ar|هَدَى}}: [[guiding]]; [[guide]]
#* {{RQ:Qur'an|13|7|passage=وَيَقُولُ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا لَوْلَا أُنْزِلَ عَلَيْهِ آيَةٌ مِنْ رَبِّهِ إِنَّمَا أَنْتَ مُنْذِرٌ وَلِكُلِّ قَوْمٍ '''هَادٍ'''|t=And those who disbelieved say, "Why has a sign not been sent down to him from his Lord?" You are only a warner, and for every people is a '''guide'''.}}
