====Conjunction====
{{ajp-conjunction|tr=ʔiza}}

# [[if]], [[whether]]
#: {{syn|ajp|إن|إنكنّـ|tr1=ʔin|tr2=ʔin-kann-}}
#: {{ux|ajp|[[سأل|إسأل]][[ه]] [[إذا]] [[مدير|المدير]] [[موجود]].|tr=ʔisʔalo '''ʔiza''' l-mudīr mawjūd|t=Ask him '''if''' the manager is there.}}
#: {{ux|ajp|[[ما]] [[عرف|بعرف]] [[إذا]] [[رجع|برجع]] [[ولّا]] [[لأ]].|tr=ma baʕref '''ʔiza''' birjaʕ willa laʔ|t=I don't know '''whether''' he's coming back or not.}}
#: {{ux|ajp|[[إذا]] [[رجع]] [[بكير]]، [[قال|بقل]][[ل|ّك]].|tr='''ʔiza''' rijeʕ bakkīr, baʔul-lak|t='''If''' he gets back early, I'll tell you.}}

=====Usage notes=====
* {{m-self|ajp|إذا|tr=ʔiza}} may be followed by a past tense verb referring to a future action.

=====See also=====
* {{l|ajp|لو|tr=law|t=if (hypothetical)}}, {{l|ajp|لونّـ|tr=lawenn-|t=if (hypothetical)}}

===Etymology 2===
{{lbor|ajp|ar|إِذًا}}.

====Adverb====
{{ajp-adverb|tr=ʔiḏan}}

# [[so]], [[then]], [[therefore]]
#: {{syn|ajp|فـ|tr=fa-}}

