==Persian==

===Etymology 1===
Attested as {{inh|fa|xmn|tr=drwng|ts=drōnag|t=rainbow}}, but without {{cog|ira-mid}} attestation in the sense of leopardsbane which has been borrowed as {{cog|syc|ܕܪܘܢܓ|tr=drwng}} and {{cog|ar|دَرَوْنَج}}, {{unc|fa|nocap=1}} whether it is a distinct word; the rainbow meaning at least is from {{cog|pal||tr=dlwn'|ts=drōn|sc=Phlv|t=bow}}, which is inherited from {{inh|fa|ira-pro|*dráwnam}}, from {{inh|fa|iir-pro|*dráwnam}}.

====Alternative forms====
* {{alt|fa|درونک|tr=darunak, dorunak||doronicum}}

====Pronunciation====
{{fa-IPA|darū`na,durū`na|tg=darū`na}}

====Noun====
{{fa-noun|tr=darune, dorune}}

# [[bow]]
# [[rainbow]]
# [[leopardsbane]], [[doronicum]]

===Etymology 2===
{{clipping|fa|اندرونه|tr=andarune}}, from {{af|fa|اندرون|ـه|tr1=andarun|tr2=-e}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{fa-IPA|darū`na}}

====Noun====
{{fa-noun|tr=darune}}

# [[inside]]
# [[belly]]

=====Related terms=====
* {{l|fa|درون|tr=darun}}

===References===
