Page 222 بطخ: Skipped, no changes
Page 222 بطخ: -------- begin text --------
==Urdu==
{{wp|lang=ur}}

===Etymology===
Hypercorrection of {{bor|ur|fa-cls|بطک|tr=bat̤ak||duck}}, a [[Wanderwort]] related to {{bor|ur|ar|بَطَّة}}, {{m|ar|بَطّ}} (which itself is from {{der|ur|fa-cls|بت|tr=bat}}, perhaps with the diminutive suffix {{m|fa|ـه|tr=-a}}), and {{cog|xcl|բադ}}, among others. {{doublet|ur|بَط|tr1=baṭ|بدک|tr2=badak}}.

Cognate with {{cog|pa|ਬੱਤਕ}}, {{m|pa|ਬੱਤਖ਼}} / {{m|pa|بَطَّخ}}, {{cog|gu|બતક}}, {{cog|sd|بَدَڪَ|tr=badaka}} / {{cog|sd|बदक|tr=badaka}}, {{cog|mr|बदक}}, {{cog|kok|बदक}}, {{cog|or|ବତକ}}, {{cog|ks|بَطُخ|tr=batux}}, and perhaps in the Dravidian languages, {{cog|te|బాతు}}, {{cog|kn|ಬಾತುಕೋಳಿ}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ur-IPA|batː.ax}}
* {{audio|ur|LL-Q1617 (urd)-نعم البدل-بطخ.wav|a=Pakistan}}
* {{rhymes|ur|əx|s=2}}

===Noun===
{{ur-noun|g=f|head=بَطَّخ|tr=bat̤t̤ax}}

# [[duck]] – {{alternative form of|ur|بَط|tr=bat̤||{{gloss|aquatic bird of the family Anatidae}}|nocap=1}}
