====Adverb====
{{ajp-adverb|head=هلّأ|tr=hallaʔ|head2=هلّا|tr2=halla}}

# [[now]], [[just]]
#: {{syn|ajp|هسا|tr=hassa}}

=====Usage notes=====
* There are many words for "now". {{m-self|ajp|هلا|tr=halla, hallaʔ}} is the most common word in urban dialects, also used in North Levantine Arabic.

=====See also=====
{{col4|ajp
