# [[something]], [[anything]]

==North Levantine Arabic==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|apc|ar|شَيْء}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{IPA|apc|/ʃiː/}}

===Noun===
{{apc-noun|g=m|tr=šī|pl=إشيا|pltr=ʾišya|pl2=أشيا|pl2tr=ʾašya}}

# [[thing]]
#: {{ux|apc|هيدي اشيا كتير مهمة|tr=haydi '''ʾišya''' ktīr mhimme.|t=These are very important '''things.'''}}

====Usage notes====
Only when plural or construed with the definite article. The predominant term for ''thing'' otherwise is {{m|apc|شغلة|t=thing|tr=šaḡle}}.

===Pronoun===
{{head|apc|pronoun|tr=šī|g=m}}

# [[something]], [[anything]]
#: {{ux|apc|بدك شي تاني، حبيبتي؟|tr=baddik '''šī''' tāni, ḥabībti?|t=Do you want '''anything''' else, honey?}}
#: {{ux|apc|بدي عطيك شي.|tr=baddi ʿaṭīk '''šī'''.|t=I want to give you '''something'''.}}

===Determiner===
{{head|apc|determiner|tr=šī}}

# [[some]], [[any]]
#: {{ux|apc|في شي مشكلة؟|tr=fī '''šī''' miškle?|t=Is there '''any''' [kind of] problem?}}
#: {{ux|apc|رح يرجع شي يوم|tr=raḥ yirjaʿ '''šī''' yōm.|He’ll come back '''some''' day.}}

===Adverb===
{{head|apc|adverb|tr=šī}}

# [[circa]], [[about]]
#: {{ux|apc|لازم تنطرلك شي عشرين دقيقه|tr=lāzim tunṭurlak '''šī''' ʿišrīn-i dʾīʾa.|You have to wait for '''about''' twenty minutes.}}
# [[just]], [[barely]]
#: {{ux|apc|
 ما بدها هالقد شرح يعني شي إنك توصلهن الفكرة
|tr=ma badd(h)a hal-ʾadd šarḥ yaʿni '''šī''' ʾinnak twaṣṣell(h)on l-fikra
|t=It doesn't need this much explaining, like it's '''enough just''' to get the idea across to them
}}
#: {{ux|apc|لسا شي طلعت من البيت |tr=lissa '''šī''' ṭliʿt mni l-bēt|t={{a|apc|Syrian}} I only '''just''' left the house.}}

===Particle===
{{head|apc|particle|tr=šī}}

# {{ngd
|Optionally marks a yes-or-no question, used with intransitive verbs or after the object of a transitive verb
}}
#: {{ux|apc|عنا حليب شي؟|tr=ʿinna ḥalīb '''šī'''?|t=Do we have milk?}}

==South Levantine Arabic==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|ajp|ar|شَيْء}}.

===Noun===
{{ajp-noun|g=m|tr=šī|pl=أشيا|pltr=ʔašya|pl2=إشيا|pl2tr=ʔišya}}

# {{alternative form of|ajp|إشي|tr=ʔiši}}: [[thing]]

====Derived terms====
* {{l|ajp|كل شي|tr=kull ši|t=everything}}
* {{l|ajp|ولا شي|tr=wala ši|t=nothing}}

===Pronoun===
{{head|ajp|pronoun|tr=šī|tr2=ši}}

# {{alternative form of|ajp|إشي|tr=ʔiši}}: [[something]]; [[anything]]

===Determiner===
{{ajp-determiner|tr=ši}}

# {{ngd|akin to an indefinite article}}: [[some]], [[any]], [[one]]
#: {{ux|ajp|[[يا ريت]] [[شاف|أشوف]][[ه]] [[إذا]] [[رجع|برجع]] [[شي]] [[يوم]].|tr=yā rēt ʔašūfo ʔiza birjaʕ '''ši''' yōm|t=I would love to see him if he comes back '''some'''day.}}
