# to [[entrust]], to [[commend]]
# to [[determine]] or [[institute]] as guardian

====Conjugation====
{{ar-conj|II|III=ي}}

====Descendants====
* {{desc|mt|wissa}}
* {{desc|ary|وصى|tr=waṣṣa}}
* {{desc|ajp|وصى|tr=waṣṣa}}

