* {{R:ar:Almaany}}

==Moroccan Arabic==
{{ary-root|و ص ي}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|ary|ar|وَصَّى}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ary-IPA|waṣṣa}}

===Verb===
{{ary-verb|II|tr=waṣṣa|np=يوصي|nptr=ywaṣṣi|vn=توصية|vntr=tawsya|ap=موصي|aptr=mwaṣṣi}}

# to [[recommend]], to [[advise]]
#: {{syn|ary|نصح<tr:nṣaḥ>}}
#: {{uxa|ary|'''كنوصي'''ك تمشي للطبيب فأقرب وقت.|tr='''kanwaṣṣī'''k temši le-ṭbīb f-ʔaqrab waqt.|I advise you to go to the doctor as soon as possible.}}
# to [[order]], to put an [[order]] {{+obj|ary|:على}}
#: {{syn|ary|طلب<tr:ṭlab>}}
#: {{uxa|ary|'''وصيت''' على طابلة فالمطعم الجديد لغدا.|tr='''waṣṣīt''' ʕla ṭābla f-el-maṭʕam le-jdīd l-ḡadda.|t=I ordered a table in the new restaurant for tomorrow.}}
#: {{uxa|ary|'''وصى''' الوالد على تلاجة جديدة من مرجان.|tr='''waṣṣa''' l-wālid ʕla tallāja jdīda men marjān.|t=My father ordered a new fridge from Marjane.}}
# to [[entrust]], to [[commend]] {{+obj|ary|:على}}
#: {{syn|ary|أمن<tr:ʔamman>}}
#: {{uxa|ary|'''وصيت''' عليك هاد الأمانة.|tr='''waṣṣīt''' ʕlīk hād el-ʔamāna|t=I entrust with you this trust.}}

====Conjugation====
{{ary-conj/II-weak|و|ص|w|ṣ}}

==South Levantine Arabic==
{{ajp-root|و ص ي}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|ajp|ar|وَصَّى}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ajp-IPA|waṣṣa<p:ˈwɑsˤːɑ>}}
* {{audio|ajp|LL-Q55633582 (ajp)-Khalil.rantissi-وَصّى.wav|a=al-Lidd}}

===Verb===
{{ajp-verb|head=وصّى|II|tr=waṣṣa|pres=بوصّي|prestr=biwaṣṣi}}

# to [[recommend]] {{gloss|that someone to do something}}
#: {{syn|ajp|اقترح|tr=iqtaraḥ}}
#: {{uxa|ajp|[[وصّى|بوصّي]][[ك]] [[إنّ|انّك]] [[توجّه|تتوجّه]] [[ل]][[دكتور|لدكتور]].|tr='''bawaṣṣī'''k ʔinnak titwajjah lad-doktōr.|t=I recommend that you go to the doctor.|lit='''I ask''' you that you direct yourself to the doctor.}}
# to [[recommend]] {{gloss|someone to another}} {{+obj|ajp|:على}}
#: {{uxa|ajp|[[وصّى|وّصا]][[هم]] [[على|علي]] [[ل]][[وظيفة|لوضيفة]].|tr='''waṣṣā'''hom ʕalay lil-waẓīfe.|t=He recommended me to them for the position.|lit='''He asked''' them for me for the position.}}
# to [[request]], to [[order]], to [[ask]] {{gloss|someone to do something}} {{+obj|ajp|:على}}
#: {{syn|ajp|طلب|tr=ṭalab}}
#: {{uxa|ajp|[[وصّى|وصّيت]] [[على]] [[طاولة]]؟|tr='''waṣṣēt''' ʕala ṭāwle?|t=Did '''you order''' a table?}}
#: {{uxa|ajp|[[آه]]، [[وصّى|وصّيت]][[ه]] [[على]] [[طاولة]].|tr=ʔā, '''waṣṣēt'''o ʕala ṭāwle|t=Yes, '''I asked''' him for a table.}}

====Usage notes====
* Grammatically, {{m|ajp||وصّى|tr=waṣṣa}} is akin to English “to ask” (in the sense of “to request”): the direct object of {{m|ajp||وصّى}} is that ''from which'' something is requested ({{uxi|ajp|[[وصّى|وصّيته]]|tr=waṣṣēto|I asked him}}), whereas the indirect object is ''that which'' is requested ({{uxi|ajp|[[على]] [[طاولة]]|tr=ʕala ṭāwle|for a table}}). Neither object is required, but whether they are used influences the interpretation of the sentence. Without a direct object, {{m|ajp||وصّى}} simply means “to [[put in]] a request”. Without an indirect object, it connotes a recommendation or a suggestion given to another.

====Conjugation====
{{ajp-conj/2B|و|ص|w|ṣ}}
-------- end text --------
