==Hindi==

===Pronunciation===
* {{hi-IPA}}

===Etymology 1===
From a merger of two sources, but in both cases from {{inh|hi|iir-pro|*-kas#Derived terms|*-akas}}, from {{inh|hi|ine-pro|*-kos}}:
* {{inh+|hi|inc-ohi|-आ}}, a contraction or dialectal variant of {{m|hi|-औ}}, from {{inh|hi|inc-sap|-औ|tr=-au}}, from {{m|pra-sau|-𑀅𑀕}}, {{m|inc-pra|-𑀅𑀬}} (nominative {{inh|hi|pra-sau|-𑀅𑀕𑁄}}, {{m|inc-pra|-𑀅𑀬𑁄}}, seen in words like {{m|inc-pra|𑀔𑀼𑀮𑁆𑀮𑀬}} and {{m|inc-pra|𑀔𑀼𑀟𑁆𑀟𑀕}}), from {{inh|hi|inc-ash|-𑀅𑀓}} (nominative {{m|inc-ash|-𑀅𑀓𑁄}}, seen in words like {{m|inc-ash|𑀔𑀼𑀤𑀓}}), from {{inh|hi|sa|-अक}} (nominative {{m|sa|-अको}}, {{m|sa|-अकः}}), from {{inh|hi|inc-pro|*-akas}}.<ref>{{R:inc-ohi:Kabir|187}}</ref> {{doublet|hi|-अक}}.
* {{bor+|hi|fa-cls|ـه|tr=-â}}, from {{der|hi|pal|-k'|tr=-ag}}, from {{der|hi|ira-pro|*-akah}}.

====Suffix====
{{hi-suffix|g=m}}

# {{n-g|suffix found in many [[masculine]] [[noun]]s of both [[Indo-Aryan]] and [[Perso-Arabic]] origin}}
# {{n-g|forms some nouns with [[agentive]] meaning from verbs or nouns}}
#: {{suffixusex|hi|उचकना|उचक्का|t1=to jump, leap|t2=thief, pickpocket}}
#: {{suffixusex|hi|रसोई|रसोइया|t1=kitchen|t2=chef}}
# {{n-g|forms some nouns with [[possessive]] meaning}}
#: {{m|hi|बहु-|t=multi-}} + {{m|hi|मंज़िल|t=storey}} + {{m|hi||-आ}} → {{m|hi|बहुमंज़िला|t=multi-storey}} {{q|lit. "having many storeys"}}
# {{n-g|forms [[adjectives]] from [[noun]]s, showing a [[property]]}}
#: {{suffixusex|hi|झूठ|झूठा|t1=[[lie]]|t2=[[false]], [[fake]], [[liar]]}}
#: {{suffixusex|hi|भूख|भूखा|t1=[[hunger]]|t2=[[hungry]], [[famished]]}}

=====Declension=====
As a noun:
{{hi-ndecl|<M>}}

An an adjective:
{{hi-adecl}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{suffixsee|hi}}

===Etymology 2===
{{inh+|hi|inc-ohi|-आ}}, {{m|inc-ohi|-या}}, from {{inh|hi|pra-sau|-𑀇𑀤𑀕}}, {{m|inc-pra|-𑀇𑀅𑀬}}, {{m|inc-pra|-𑀇𑀬𑀬}}, from {{inh|hi|inc-ash|-𑀇𑀢}} {{inc-ext|hi|ka}}, from {{inh|hi|sa|-इत}}, the variant of {{m|sa|-त}} for [[seṭ]] roots commonly found in Later Sanskrit, from {{inh|hi|iir-pro|*-tás}}, from {{inh|hi|ine-pro|*-tós}}.<ref>{{R:inc-ohi:Kabir|423}}</ref> {{doublet|hi|-इत}} and {{m|hi|-त}}. Cognate with {{cog|pa|-ਈਆ}} and distantly {{cog|en|-ed}}.

====Alternative forms====
* {{alt|hi|-या}} {{q|after vowels}}

====Suffix====
