{{lbor+|hi|sa|-आ}}, from {{der|hi|iir-pro|*-aH}}, from {{der|hi|ine-pro|*-éh₂}}.<ref>{{R:hi:McGregor|page=77}}</ref> Distantly cognate with {{cog|la|-a}}.

====Suffix====
