# {{n-g|forms the [[feminine]] form of the [[noun]]s}}
#: {{suffixusex|hi|पुष्प|पुष्पा|t1=[[flower]]|t2=[[flower]], [[female]] [[given name]]}}
# {{n-g|forms [[feminine]] form of the [[adjective]]s}}
#: {{suffixusex|hi|हरित|हरिता|t1=[[green]]|t2=[[green]]}}

=====Declension=====
