Page 282 هات: Skipped, no changes
Page 282 هات: -------- begin text --------
==Arabic==

===Etymology===
Apparently from an earlier form *{{m|ar||هَأْتِ}}, imperative of *{{m|ar||هَأْتَى|t=to bring, to give}}, formed as {{m|ar|هـ|pos=obsolete Form IV causative prefix}} + {{m|ar|أَتَى|t=to come}}. The imperative subsequently lost its glottal stop — compare {{m|ar|مَاسُورَة}}, {{m|ar|رَايَة}} — and was fossilized before the causative prefix further developed to {{m|ar|أَ|tr=ʔa-}}. {{doublet|ar|آتِ}} and other imperative conjugations of {{m|ar|آتَى|t=to bring, to give}}.

===Verb===
