****: {{desc|arc-cpa|ܝܰܘܢܳܐ|tr=yawnā}}, notably absolute state {{l|arc-cpa|ܝܰܘܢ}}, {{l|arc-cpa|ܝܐܘܢ|tr=yawn}}
****: {{desc|tmr|יוֹנָא|tr=yōnā}}
