===Etymology===
Alternative plural form of {{m|ajp|مصري|tr=maṣri|t=Egyptian}}, originally referred to “Egyptian coins”.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ajp-IPA|maṣāri<p:mɑˈsˤɑː.ri>}}
* {{audio|ajp|LL-Q55633582 (ajp)-Muhammad (AdrianAbdulBaha)-مصاري.wav|a=Ramallah}}

===Noun===
{{ajp-noun|g=p|tr=maṣāri|cons=مصريّات|constr=maṣriyyāt}}

