Page 377 -ܗ: Skipped, no changes
Page 377 -ܗ: -------- begin text --------
==Assyrian Neo-Aramaic==

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|aii|arc|־ֵה|tr=-ēh}}, analogical consonantism after the independent personal pronoun {{m|arc|הוּ|tr=hū}}; cognate to {{cog|he|־וֹ|tr=-ó}} and {{cog|ar|ـهُ}}

====Pronunciation====
* {{IPA|aii|[-eːh]|a=Standard}}
* {{IPA|aii|[-eːh]|[-eħ]|a=Nineveh Plains}}

====Particle====
{{aii-particle|-ܹܗ}}

# {{ngd|attached to prepositions to indicate a male or masculine object in the [[3rd person]]}}; [[him]], [[it]]
#: {{uxi|aii|ܐܸܠ'''ܹܗ'''|to '''him'''}}
#: {{uxi|aii|ܥܲܡ'''ܹܗ'''|with '''him'''}}
# {{ngd|attached to nouns to indicate possession by a male or masculine noun in the [[3rd person]]}}; [[his]], [[its]]
#: {{uxi|aii|ܒܪܵܬ'''ܹܗ'''|t='''his''' daughter}}
# {{ngd|attached to progressive verbs to indicate an action being directed to a male or masculine noun in the [[3rd person]]}}
#: {{uxi|aii|ܗ̇ܝ ܝܠܵܗ̇ ܒܸܙܒ݂ܵܢ'''ܹܗ''' ܡܹܐܟ݂ܘܼܠܬܵܐ|t=She is buying '''him''' food.}}
# {{ngd|attached to passive and past participles to indicate an action being directed to a male or masculine noun in the [[3rd person]]}}
#: {{uxi|aii|ܗ݇ܘܹܐ ܠܹܗ ܐ݇ܡܝܼܪ'''ܹܗ'''|t=He has told '''him'''.}}

=====Synonyms=====
* {{sense|indicating possession}} {{m|aii|ܕܝܼܹܗ}}

===Etymology 2===
From {{inh|aii|arc|־ָהּ|tr=-āh}}, analogical consonantism after the independent personal pronoun {{m|arc|הִי|tr=hī}}; cognate to {{cog|he|־ָהּ|tr=-áh}} and {{cog|ar|ـهَا}}

====Pronunciation====
* {{IPA|aii|[-aːh]|a=Standard}}
* {{IPA|aii|[-aːh]|[-aħ]|a=Nineveh Plains}}

====Particle====
{{aii-particle|-ܵܗ̇}}

# {{ngd|attached to prepositions to indicate a female or feminine object in the [[3rd person]]}}; [[her]], [[it]]
#: {{uxi|aii|ܐܸܠ'''ܵܗ̇'''|to '''her'''}}
#: {{uxi|aii|ܥܲܡ'''ܵܗ̇'''|with '''her'''}}
# {{ngd|attached to nouns to indicate possession by a female or feminine noun in the [[3rd person]]}}; [[her]], [[its]]
#: {{uxi|aii|ܟܲܠܒ'''ܵܗ̇'''|t='''her''' dog}}
# {{ngd|attached to progressive verbs to indicate an action being directed to a female or feminine noun in the [[3rd person]]}}
#: {{uxi|aii|ܝܼܢܵܐ ܒܸܒܢܵܝ'''ܵܗ̇''' ܒܲܝܬܵܐ|t=They are building '''her''' a house.}}
# {{ngd|attached to passive and past participles to indicate an action being directed to a female or feminine noun in the [[3rd person]]}}
#: {{uxi|aii|ܗ݇ܘܹܐ ܠܹܗ ܐ݇ܟ݂ܝܼܠ'''ܵܗ̇'''|t=He has eaten '''it''' ('''her''')}}

=====Synonyms=====
* {{sense|indicating possession}} {{m|aii|ܕܝܼܵܗ̇}}

=====See also=====
* {{l|aii|-ܝܼ}}
* {{l|aii|-ܲܢ}}
* {{l|aii|-ܵܵܟ݂ܝ}}
* {{l|aii|-ܘܿܟ݂}}
* {{l|aii|-ܲܘܟ݂ܘܿܢ}}
* {{l|aii|-ܗܘܿܢ}}
-------- end text --------
