* {{desc|el|έιτς|bor=1}}
* → Japanese: {{ja-r|エイチ}}, dated {{ja-r|エッチ}}
* {{desc|ko|에이치|bor=1}}
* {{desc|ms|hec|bor=1}}
* {{desc|fa|اِچ<tr:eč><t:English letter H>|اِیچ<tr:eyč><t:English letter H>|bor=1}}
* {{desc|ru|эйч|t=English letter H|bor=1}}
* {{desc|tl|eyts|bor=1}}
* {{desc|th|เอช|เฮช|bor=1}}

