====Verb====
{{en-verb}}

# To use the interjection [[#Interjection|eh]].

====Adjective====
{{en-adj|-}}

# {{lb|en|informal|predicative|_|only}} Of [[mediocre]] quality; [[unremarkable]].
#: {{ux|en|My French fries were '''eh'''.}}

