* {{ajp-IPA|ʕajjab<p:ˈʕaʒ.ʒab><p:ˈʕad.d͡ʒab>}}
* {{audio|ajp|LL-Q55633582 (ajp)-Khalil.rantissi-عَجَّب.wav|a=al-Lidd}}

