{{also|steam roller}}
==English==
[[File:Compressore_stradale_a_vapore_FS_38601_2.jpg|thumb]]

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|steam roller}}

===Etymology===
{{compound|en|steam|roller}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|historical}} A [[steam]]-[[powered]] [[heavy]] [[road roller]].
# {{lb|en|by extension|informal}} Any heavy [[road roller]].
# {{lb|en|figurative}} Any seemingly [[irresistible]] [[force]].
#* {{quote-song|en|title=Steamroller Blues|author=w:James Taylor|year=1970|passage=Well, I'm a '''steamroller''', babe / I'm bound to roll all over you}}
# {{lb|en|slang}} A [[pipe]], used for [[smoking]] [[cannabis]], open at both ends and having a [[bowl]] near one end.
#* {{quote-book|en|editors=Jane Smiley; John Kulka; Natalie Danford|title=Best New American Voices 2006|year=2005|publisher=Houghton Mifflin Harcourt|page=242|pageurl=https://books.google.com/books?id=DNZZAAAAMAAJ&q=%22steamroller%22+bong&dq=%22steamroller%22+bong&hl=en&cd=9&source=gbs_api|isbn=978-0-15-602901-8|passage=It's more about him testing his wares. He rolls joints. He doesn't own a bong, hookah, smoking pipe, chillum, vaporizer, scale, dugout system, grinder, or '''steamroller'''.}}

====Translations====
{{trans-top|steam-powered road roller}}
* Arabic: {{t|ar|هَرَّاس|m}}
* Catalan: {{t+|ca|corró|m}}
* Czech: {{t|cs|parní válec}}
* Esperanto: {{t|eo|vaporcilindro}}
* Finnish: {{t|fi|höyryjyrä}}
* French: {{t+|fr|rouleau compresseur|m}}
* German: {{t+|de|Dampfwalze|f}}
* Hungarian: {{t+|hu|gőzhenger}}, {{t+|hu|úthenger}}
* Italian: {{t|it|rullo compressore|m}}
* Japanese: {{t|ja|[[蒸気]][[ローラー]]|tr=jōki-rōrā}}
* Macedonian: {{t|mk|ва́лјак|m}}
* Spanish: {{t|es|apisonadora|f}}
* Swedish: {{t|sv|ångvält|c}}
* Tagalog: {{t|tl|pison}}
{{trans-bottom}}

{{trans-see|road roller}}

{{trans-top|figurative: irresistible force}}
* Finnish: {{t|fi|höyryjyrä}}
* Hungarian: {{t+|hu|gőzhenger}}
{{trans-bottom}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# To [[level]] a [[road]] using a steamroller.
#: {{syn|en|steamroll}}
# To [[proceed]] [[ruthlessly]] against all [[opposition]] as if with an [[overwhelming]] force.
#: {{syn|en|overpower|steamroll}}

====Translations====
{{trans-top|to level with a steamroller}}
* Finnish: {{t+|fi|jyrätä}}
{{trans-bottom}}

{{trans-top|to proceed ruthlessly}}
* Finnish: {{t+|fi|jyrätä}}
{{trans-bottom}}

