{{also|phobia}}
==English==
{{slim-wikipedia|Phobia (disambiguation)}}

===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*bʰegʷ-}}
From {{bor|en|NL.|-}}, from {{der|en|la|-}}, from {{der|en|grc|-φοβία|}}, from {{m|grc|φόβος||fear}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/-ˈfəʊ.bi.ə/|a=RP}}
* {{IPA|en|/-ˈfoʊ.bi.ə/|a=GA}}
* {{hyphenation|en|-phob|ia}}
* {{rhymes|en|əʊbiə}} <!--varying number of syllables-->

===Suffix===
{{en-suffix}}

# Used to form nouns meaning [[fear]] of a specific thing.
#: e.g. {{m|en|claustrophobia}}
# Used to form nouns meaning [[hate]], [[dislike]], or [[repression]] of a specific thing.
#: e.g. {{m|en|homophobia}}, {{m|en|xenophobia}}, {{m|en|chemophobia}}

====Antonyms====
* {{l|en|-philia}}

====Derived terms====
{{suffixsee|en}}
* See [[:Category:en:Phobias]].
* {{l|en|phobia}}

====Related terms====
* {{l|en|-phobe}}
* {{l|en|-phobic}}

