#: {{ux|az|― Düyü var? ― Bəli, '''var'''.|―'''Is there''' any rice? ―Yes, '''there is'''.
}}
# {{non-gloss definition|Expressing [[possession]]}}: to [[have]]
#: {{ux|az|Üç qardaşım '''var'''.|I have three brothers.|lit='''There are''' three of my brothers}}
#: {{ux|az|― Gedim çörək alım? ― Yox, hələ '''var'''ımızdır.|―Shall I go and buy bread? ―No, we still '''have''' [some].
}}

