* {{R:ar:Freytag|volume=4|page=455b}}
* {{R:ar:Kazimirski|volume=2|pages=1519b}}
* {{R:ar:Lane|pages=2936b–2937a}}
* {{R:arc:Löw-Flora|volume=2|pages=26–27}}
* {{R:ar:Schönig|pages=297–308}}

