==Bengali==

===Alternative forms===
*{{alter|bn|খুশ}}

===Etymology===
{{bor+|bn|fa-cls|خوش|tr=xʷuš, xʷaš}}, which is from {{der|bn|pal||tr=xwš|ts=xwaš|sc=Phlv|t=pleasant, sweet, nice}}. Cognate with {{cog|bal|وش}} and {{cog|tr|hoş}}. Compare {{cog|inc-hnd}} {{m|hi|ख़ुश|tr=-}} / {{m|ur|خوش|tr=xuś}}. Related to {{m|bn|খুশি}}, {{m|bn|খুশবু|tr=khuśbu}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{bn-IPA}}

===Adjective===
{{bn-adj}}

# [[pleasant]], [[delightful]], [[amusing]]

====Synonyms====
* {{l|bn|আনন্দময়}}

====Derived terms====
*{{l|bn|খোশ আমদেদ}}
*{{l|bn|খোশমেজাজ}}
*{{l|bn|খোশামোদ}}

