* {{IPA|ady|[wan]}}

===Verb===
{{ady-verb}}

# to [[hit]] someone or something physically and directly (not by throwing for example)
#: {{ux|ady|кӏалэр дэпкъым '''ео'''|the boy '''is hitting''' the wall. (transitive)}}
#: {{ux|ady|'''усэоныу''' уфая?|Do you want '''me to hit you'''? (transitive)}}
#: {{ux|ady|Кӏалэм '''уемэу'''|'''Don't hit''' the boy. (transitive)}}
#: {{ux|ady|А кӏалэхэр '''къуотых'''|Those boys '''will hit you'''. (transitive)}}
#: {{ux|ady|Кӏалэр '''мао'''|The boy '''is hitting'''. (intransitive)}}
# to [[eat]] with gusto
#: {{ux|ady|нэкӏо пицэ '''ткъеот'''|Let's '''eat''' a pizza! (with gusto) (transitive)}}
#: {{ux|ady|пицэ '''укъеота'''?|'''Are you going to eat''' a pizza? (with gusto) (transitive)}}
#: {{ux|ady|кӏалэр пицэ '''ео'''|The boy '''is eating''' a pizza (with gusto) (transitive)}}
# to [[play]] music
#: {{ux|ady|кIалэр гитарым '''къео'''|the boy is playing the guitar (transitive)}}
#: {{ux|ady|пяноуым '''шъукъеуа'''?|Do you (plural) play the piano? (transitive)}}
#: {{ux|ady|пшынэм '''еу'''|'''Play''' the accordion. (transitive)}}
# to [[shake]] (milk)
# to [[shoot]] (кӏэрахъомкӏэ еон)
#: {{ux|ady|кӏалэр кӏэрахъомкӏэ '''ео''' тгъужъым|The boy '''is shooting''' the wolf with the gun. (transitive)}}
# to spend [[money]] thriftily
# to [[sting]]
# to [[weed]]
# to [[smoke]]
#: {{ux|ady|лӏэр хьащищ '''ео'''|The man '''is smoking''' hashish. (transitive)}}
# {{lb|ady|mathematics}} to [[multiply]]
#: {{ux|ady|щым плӏыкӏэ '''уеомэ''' пшӏыкӏутӏу къычӏэкьижьыт|'''If you multiply''' three times four it will make twelve. (transitive)}}

