{{bor+|id|bew|-in}}, from {{der|id|ban|-in}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|id|/ɪn/}}
* {{hyph|id|in}}

===Suffix===
{{head|id|suffix|non-active/imperative/basic|{{color|black|-in}}|active|nge- -in|passive|di- -in|perfective passive|ke- -in}} {{tlb|id|colloquial|dialectal}}

# {{ngd|used to form [[benefactive]] aspect on a verb}}
#: {{m|id|beli|t=to buy}} → {{m|id|beliin|t=to buy (for)}}
#: {{m|id|bikin|t=to make}} → {{m|id|bikinin|t=to make (for)}}
# {{ngd|used to [[intensify]] a verb}}
#: {{m|id|liat|t=to see}} → {{m|id|liatin|t=to look}}
#: {{m|id|denger|t=to hear}} → {{m|id|dengerin|t=to listen}}
# {{ngd|used to form [[causative]] aspect on a verb}}
#: {{m|id|besar|t=big}} → {{m|id|besarin|t=to make big; to enlarge; to raise}}
#: {{m|id|panjang|t=long}} → {{m|id|panjangin|t=to make long; to extend}}
# {{ngd|used to [[transitivize]] a verb}}
