# {{lb|sa|Vedic}} a [[tree]]
#: {{syn|sa|वृक्ष}}
# a [[forest]], [[wood]], [[grove]], [[thicket]], quantity of lotuses or other plants growing in a thick cluster
#* {{Q|sa||RV|6|60|10|quote=तमी॑ळिष्व॒ यो अ॒र्चिषा॒ '''वना॒''' विश्वा॑ परि॒ष्वज॑त्।<br> कृ॒ष्णा कृ॒णोति॑ जि॒ह्वया॑॥|t=Glorify that Agni who envelopes all the '''forests''' with flame, who blackens them with (his) tongue.}}
