From {{inh|ira-pro|iir-pro|*sapátniH}} (whence {{cog|sa|सपत्नी|t=co-wife}}), from {{prefix|iir-pro|*sa-|*pátniH|t1=together, co-|t2=wife|nocat=1}}, from {{der|ira-pro|ine-pro|*pótis|*pótnih₂|t=wife}}. Cognate with {{cog|grc|πότνια|t=mistress, lady}}.

===Noun===
{{head|ira-pro|noun|g=f}}<ref>{{R:ira:Windfuhr:2010|341}}</ref><ref>{{R:ira:ESIJa|vol=III|pages=349–350}}</ref><ref>{{R:ira:ESIJa|vol=VI|pages=252–254}}</ref>

