====Conjunction====
{{en-con}}

# The manner or way in which.
#: ''I remember '''how''' I solved this puzzle.''
# In any way in which; in whatever way; [[however]].
#: ''People should be free to live '''how''' they want.''
# [[that|That]], the fact that.
#* {{quote-journal|en|date=April 24 2010|author=Jesse McKinley|title=Don’t Call It ‘Pot’ in This Circle; It’s a Profession|titleurl=http://www.nytimes.com/2010/04/24/us/24pot.html|journal=w:The New York Times|page=A1
|passage=“There’s this real Al Capone fear that they’re going to get our guys, not on marijuana, but on something else,” Mr. Edson said, referring to '''how''' Capone was eventually charged with tax evasion rather than criminal activity.}}
#: ''She told me '''how''' her father was a doctor.''

