# {{lb|fa|with subjunctive}} [[whatever]]
#* {{RQ:Masnavi|V|3410|'''هرچه''' آوردی تلف کردیش زن<br>مرد مضطر بود اندر تن زدن|'''harče''' âvardi talaf kardiš zan<br>mard moztarr bud andar tan zadan.|'''Whatever''' [food] he brought [home], his wife would consume it, and the man was forced to keep silence.}}
# {{lb|fa|with indicative}} [[everything]]
#: {{ux|fa|'''هرچه''' دوست دارید بخورید.|q=more literary|tr='''harče''' dust dârid be-xorid.|Eat '''everything''' you want.}}
#: {{ux|fa|'''هرچی''' دوس دارین بخورین.|q=more colloquial|tr='''harči''' dus dârin bo-xorin.|Eat '''everything''' you want.}}
# {{n-g|Used to form constructions equivalent to English [[the#Etymology 2|the more... the more]].}}
#: {{uxi|fa|'''هرچه''' بیشتر بهتر|tr='''harče''' bištar behtar|the more, the better}}
#: {{ux|fa|'''هرچه''' سریع‌تر دوید، خسته‌تر شد.|tr='''harče''' sari'-tar david, xaste-tar šod.|The faster he ran, the more tired he got.}}
# {{lb|fa|followed by a comparative adjective}} as possible
#: {{coi|fa|'''هرچه''' زودتر|tr='''harče''' zudtar|[[as soon as possible|as soon as '''as possible''']]}}
