A partial list of pages where at least one language section simply states, in plain text, without using {{temp|etyl}}, that it derives from German, French, Latin, Greek, Ancient Greek, Chinese or Spanish. [[User:-sche|- -sche]] [[User talk:-sche|(discuss)]] 17:43, 25 January 2015 (UTC)
