=== Terms from Webster's 1913 dictionary ===

Thousands of them are at [[:Category:Webster 1913]] (and have been around since almost the beginning of Wiktionary!). Often only one or two terms in Webster's dictionary have not been assimilated and modernized into Wiktionary, sometimes more. [[User:GreyishWorm|GreyishWorm]] ([[User talk:GreyishWorm|talk]]) 17:51, 22 October 2022 (UTC)
