* Indonesian: {{t+|id|domisili}}, {{t+|id|tempat tinggal}}
* Italian: {{t+|it|domicilio|m}}
* Japanese: {{t+|ja|住所|tr=じゅうしょ, jūsho|sc=Jpan}}, {{t+|ja|住居|tr=すまい, sumai, じゅうきょ, jūkyo|sc=Jpan}}, {{t+|ja|住宅|tr=じゅうたく, jūtaku|sc=Jpan}}
* Latin: {{t+|la|domicilium|n}}
* Macedonian: {{t+|mk|живеалиште|n}}
