==Persian==

===Etymology===
{{dercat|fa|ira-pro}}
From {{der|fa|pal|𐭥𐭡𐭩𐭣𐭥𐭭𐭲𐭭𐭩|tr=OBYDWN-tn’|sc=Phli}}, {{m|pal|𐭪𐭥𐭲𐭭𐭩|tr=krtn’|ts=kardan|sc=Phli}}, from {{der|fa|peo|tr=kar-|||to do, make, build}}, from {{der|fa|iir-pro|*kar-||to do, make}}, from {{der|fa|ine-pro|*kʷer-||to do, make, construct}}.

Modern Indo-Iranian cognates include {{cog|os|кӕнын}}, {{m|os|конд}}, {{cog|ps|کول|tr=kawël, krël}}, {{cog|bal|tr=kan-, ku(r)t-}}, {{cog|kmr|kirin}}, {{cog|zza|tr=kerdiš, ken-}}, {{cog|hi|करना}}, and {{cog|ur|کرنا|tr=karnā}}.

The generic root for "to do, make" has developed in a wide range of specific activities, which have been preserved in old derivations such as: {{m|fa|سگالیدن|tr=segâlidan||to think, meditate}}, {{m|fa|پیکر|tr=peykar||picture, statue}}, {{m|fa|نگاشتن|tr=negâštan||to paint}}, {{m|fa|انگاشتن|tr=engâštan||to suppose; believe, consider}}, {{m|fa|پنگاشتن|tr=pengâštan||paint, figure, write}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{fa-IPA|kar`dan|kbl=ka`dan|haz=ka`dā}}
* {{audio|fa|LL-Q9168 (fas)-Darafsh-کردن.wav|a=Iran}}
* {{audio|fa|Fa-كردن.ogg|a=Iran}}
** {{q|dialectal Iranian, especially Mashhad, Yazd, Shiraz}}: {{IPA|fa|/keɾˈdæn/}}

===Verb===
{{fa-regional|کردن|کردن|кардан}}
{{fa-verb|head=کَرْدَن|tr=kardan|prstem=کُن|tr2=kon}}

# to [[do]]
#: {{syn|fa|انجام دادن|tr1=anjâm dâdan}}
# to [[make]]
# {{n-g|A highly [[productive]] [[light verb]] that derives verbs from nouns and adjectives.}}
#: {{syn|fa|انجام دادن|tr1=anjâm dâdan|فرمودن|tr2=farmudan|pos2=honorific}}
#: {{suffixusex|fa|معرفی|t1=introduction|tr1=mo'arrefi|کردن|tr2=kardan|معرفی کردن|tr3=mo'arrefi kardan|t3=to introduce|lit3=to make introduction}}
#: {{suffixusex|fa|پیشرفت|t1=progress|tr1=pišraft|کردن|tr2=kardan|پیشرفت کردن|tr3=pišraft kardan|t3=to progress|lit3=to make progress}}
#: {{suffixusex|fa|باز|t1=open|tr1=bâz|کردن|tr2=kardan|باز کردن|tr3=bâz kardan|t3=to open|lit3=to make open}}
#: {{suffixusex|fa|تمیز|t1=clean|tr1=tamiz|کردن|tr2=kardan|تمیز کردن|tr3=tamiz kardan|t3=to clean|lit3=to make clean}}
#: {{suffixusex|fa|گوش|t1=ear|tr1=guš|کردن|tr2=kardan|گوش کردن|tr3=guš kardan|t3=to listen}}
# {{lb|fa|vulgar}} to [[fuck]]

