==Southern Kurdish==

===Etymology===
From {{der|sdh|ira-pro|*kar-}}, from {{der|sdh|iir-pro|*kar-||to do, make}}, from {{der|sdh|ine-pro|*kʷer-||to do, make, construct}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|sdh|/kɪrdɪn/}}

===Verb===
