** {{desc|hu|ház}}
** Khanty:
*** {{desc|kca-eas|кат}}
*** {{desc|kca-nor|хат}}
* Permic:
** Komi:
*** {{desc|kpv|керка|t=house|вичко|t2=church|der=1}}
*** {{desc|koi|керку|t=house|вичку|t2=church|der=1}}
** {{desc|udm|корка|t=house|вуко|t2=mill|der=1}}
* {{desc|chm-pro|*kudə}} {{see desc}}
* {{desc|urj-mdv-pro|*kudə}} 
** {{desc|myv|кудо}}
** {{desc|mdf|куд}}
