==Pashto==
{{was fwotd|ps|2016|March|10}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|ps|/koʈ/}}
* {{audio|ps|کوټ.ogg}}

===Etymology 1===
Alternative form of {{l|ps|کوټه|tr=koʈa}} . Akin to {{cog|ira-pro|*kátah}} (compare {{cog|ae|𐬐𐬀𐬙𐬀|t=house/home, pit}}, {{cog|fa|کده|tr=kade|gloss=house}}).

====Noun====
{{ps-noun|g=m|tr=koṭ}}
[[File:Ruins of old Kandahar Citadel in 1881.jpg|thumb|کوټ]]

# [[fort]]
# [[stronghold]]
# [[citadel]], [[fortress]]
# [[house]], [[room]]

=====References=====
# [http://qamosona.com/G/index.php/term/,6f57b19b61545aaa9b9ea5afad5e5da7.xhtml Pashto-English Dictionary, Academy of Sciences Kabul]
# {{R:ps:Raverty}}

===Etymology 2===
From {{der|ps|en|coat}}, from {{der|ps|enm|coate}}, from {{der|ps|fro|cote}}, from {{der|ps|frk|*kotta|t=coat}}, from {{der|ps|gem-pro|*kuttô}}, {{m|gem-pro|*kuttǭ|t=cowl, woolen cloth, coat}}.

====Noun====
[[File:Trenchcoat worn by President Gerald R. Ford.jpg|thumb|کوټ]]
{{ps-noun|g=m|tr=koṭ}}

# [[coat]], [[overcoat]]

====Further reading====
* [http://qamosona.com/G/index.php/term/,6f57b19b61545aaa9b9ea5afad5e5dac.xhtml Pashto-English Dictionary, Academy of Sciences Kabul]

===Etymology 3===
{{unk|ps}} origin.

====Noun====
{{ps-noun|g=m|tr=koṭ}}

# kind of [[alloy]]

=====References=====
# [http://qamosona.com/G/index.php/term/,6f57ae9b61545aaf9b9ea5afaa5d5bb0.xhtml Pashto-English Dictionary, Qamosona.com]
