==Proto-Slavic==

===Etymology===
{{bor+|sla-pro|xsc|-}} {{m|und|*xata}}, from {{der|sla-pro|ira-pro|*kátah}} (compare {{cog|ae|𐬐𐬀𐬙𐬀||room, hut, cellar}}, {{cog|fa|کده|tr=kade||house}}, {{cog|pal|𐭪𐭩‎𐭪𐭲|tr=ktk'|ts=kadag|t=house}}).

A possible {{w|Wanderwort}}, see {{cog|urj-pro|*kota}} (compare {{cog|fi|kota||hut, house}} and {{cog|hu|ház||house}}) for more.

===Noun===
{{sla-noun|head=*xata|f}}

# [[house]], [[home]], [[hut]]

====Declension====
{{sla-decl-noun}}

====Related terms====
