==Proto-Iranian==

===Etymology===
{{unk|iir-pro}}; often compared to {{cog|sa|चतति|tr=cátati}}, {{m|sa|चातयति|t=to escape}},<ref>{{R:kho:Bailey|kata-|50}}</ref> and {{cog|sa|खनति|t=to dig}}<ref>{{R:ira:AiW|j. kata-|432|zu ai. catant- Adj. ‘sich versteckend’. Die Verbindung mit dem V. ²kan- ist ohne Wert; vgl. *kanta-.}}</ref>,<ref>{{R:ira:Novak:2013|pages=62; 202|passage=*ką́ta-; Ide. *kn̥ta- : *kan- ‘to dig’}}</ref> but perhaps more likely a {{bor|ira-pro|qfa-sub}} borrowing or {{glossary|wanderwort}}, compare {{cog|urj-pro|*kota|t=hut, tent}}, {{cog|gem-pro|*kutą|t=hut, shed}}.

===Noun===
{{head|ira-pro|noun|g=m}}<ref>{{R:wbl:ESVJa|kut|213|Др.-ир. *kata-}}</ref><ref name="ESIJa">{{R:ira:ESIJa|*kata- / *xata-, *kana- / *xana-|340}}</ref>

# [[house]]
# [[roof]]

