==Bavarian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|bar|gian||Southern|Tyrol}}

===Etymology===
{{root|bar|ine-pro|*ǵʰeh₁-|*ǵʰengʰ-}}
From {{inh|bar|gmh|gān}}, {{m|gmh|gēn}}, from {{inh|bar|goh|gān}}, {{m|goh|gēn}}, from {{inh|bar|gmw-pro|*gān}}, from {{inh|bar|gem-pro|*gāną}}, from {{der|bar|ine-pro|*ǵʰeh₁-||to leave}}. Cognates include {{cog|de|gehen}}, {{cog|nl|gaan}}, {{cog|yi|גיין}}, {{cog|en|go}}, {{cog|non|gá}}, {{cog|got|𐌲𐌰𐌲𐌲𐌰𐌽}}.   

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|bar|Verb}}
** {{IPA|bar|/ɡ̊eː/}}
* {{a|bar|Interjection}}
** {{IPA|bar|/ɡ̊ɛ/|/ɡ̊ɛː/}}

===Verb===
{{bar-verb|pp=gångan}}

# {{lb|bar|intransitive}} to [[walk]], to [[go]]
#: {{uxi|bar|Heit wui i nimmer '''geh'''.|I don't walk to '''walk''' anymore today.}}
#: {{uxi|bar|Gemma, gemma!|Let's go!}}
# {{lb|bar|auxiliary||with an infinitive}} to [[go]] and perform the action denoted by the infinitive
#: {{uxi|bar|I '''geh''' mi wåschn.|I'll '''go''' and wash myself.}}
#: {{uxi|bar|'''Geh''' di schaman!|'''Go''' and be ashamed of yourself!}}
#: {{uxi|bar|'''Gehst''' heit spuatln?|Are you '''going''' to do sport today?}}
# {{lb|bar|transitive}} to [[go]], to [[take]]
#: {{uxi|bar|Heit '''geh''' ma de schware Streckn.|Today we'll '''take''' the difficult route.}}
# {{lb|bar|intransitive}} to [[leave]], to [[go]]
#: {{uxi|bar|So, mia miassn '''geh'''.|Alright, we have to '''leave'''.}}
# {{lb|bar|impersonal|intransitive}} to be going; to be [[all right]]; {{non-gloss definition|indicates how the dative object fares}}
#: {{uxi|bar|Wia '''geht''''s? - Jå, '''geht''' eh.|How's it '''going'''? - It's '''going''' alright.}}
# {{lb|bar|intransitive|often|impersonal}} to be [[possible]], to [[work]]
#: {{uxi|bar|Dad des '''geh'''?|Would that '''be possible'''?}}
#: {{uxi|bar|'''Geht''' des so?|Does it '''work''' that way?}}
# {{lb|bar|intransitive}} to [[work]], to [[function]] {{gloss|of a machine, method or the like}}
#: {{uxi|bar|De Maschin '''geht''' scho wieder.|The machine is '''working''' again.}}
# {{lb|bar|intransitive}} to [[sit]], to [[rise]], to [[expand]] {{gloss|of dough etc.}}
#: {{uxi|bar|Der Toag muaß oa Stund''' geh'''.|The dough has to '''sit''' for one hour.}}
# {{lb|bar|intransitive|derogatory|with {{m|bar|auf}} or {{m|bar|åm}}}} to [[get on someone's nerves]] ({{non-gloss definition|object variable}})
#: {{uxi|bar|Des '''geht''' ma '''auf''' d'Nervn.|This is getting on my nerves.|lit=This is going on my nerves.}}
#: {{uxi|bar|Der '''geht''' ma '''åm''' Beidl.|He's getting on my nerves.|lit=He is going on my dick.}}
#: {{uxi|bar|Du '''gehst''' ma '''åm''' Oasch.|You are getting on my nerves.|lit=You are going on my arse.}}

====Conjugation====
{{bar-conj
<!--Present-->
|pres-sg1=geh
|pres-sg2=gehst
|pres-sg3=geht
|pres-pl=gengan
|pres-pl2=gehts
<!--Subjunctive-->
|subj-sg1=gangad
|subj-sg2=gangadst
|subj-sg3=gangad
|subj-pl=gangan
|subj-pl2=gangats
<!--Imperative-->
|imp-sg=geh
|imp-pl=gehts
<!--Participles-->
|part-past=gånga
}}

===Interjection===
{{head|bar|interjection}}

# {{verb form of|bar|geh||s|imp}}
# {{non-gloss definition|interjection preceding a request or an objection:}} [[will]] [[you]], [[would]] [[you]], [[come on#Interjection|come on]]
#: {{uxi|bar|'''Geh''', gimma bitte no a Glasl.|Give me another glass, '''would you?'''}}
#: {{uxi|bar|'''Geh''', hoid de Goschn!|Shut your trap, '''will you'''!}}
#: {{uxi|bar|'''Geh''', des kånnst do ned måcha.|'''Come on''', you can't do that.}}
# {{non-gloss definition|interjection indicating or reinforcing disbelief or doubt:}} [[no]], [[nah]], [[no way]], [[get out of here]]
#: {{uxi|bar|'''Geh''', des håd s' sicher ned gsågt!|'''Nah''', she certainly didn't say that!}}
#: {{uxi|bar|Håst scho gheat? Da Mayer håd se derstessn. - '''Geh'''!|Have you heard? Mayer has died in an accident. - '''No way'''!}}
#: {{uxi|bar|I bi scho siebnmoi um d'Wöd gfoan. - '''Geh''', Gschichtldrucker.|I've travelled around the world seven times. - '''Get out of here''', you storyteller.}}
# {{non-gloss definition|interjection preceding and reinforcing a reply or retort to previously voiced doubt:}} [[no]], [[not at all]], [[by no means]]
#: {{uxi|bar|Is des ned gfährlich, wia du des måchst? - '''Geh''', i måch des scho immer so.|Isn't how you do that dangerous? - '''Not at all''', I've always done it this way.}}

====Derived terms====
