==Assyrian Neo-Aramaic==

===Etymology 1===
From {{bor|aii|pal|tr=gʾs|sc=Phlv}}, {{m|pal|𐫃𐫀𐫍|t=place, throne, bed; time|ts=gāh|sc=Mani}}; compare {{cog|fa|گاه|tr=gâh}}, {{cog|kmr|-geh}}, {{cog|xcl|գահ}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{IPA|aii|[ɡɑːhɑː]|a=Standard}}
* {{IPA|aii|[ɡaːj]|a=Nineveh Plains}}
* {{IPA|aii|[d͡ʒejː]|a=Urmian}}

====Noun====
{{aii-noun|ܓܵܗܵܐ|f|pl=ܓܵܗܹ̈ܐ|pl2=ܓܵܗ̈ܵܬ݂ܵܐ}}

# [[time]] {{gloss|an instance or repetition of something happening}}
#: {{ux|aii|ܟܹܐ ܐܵܙܹܠ݇ܢ ܬܵܡܵܐ ܬܲܪܬܹܝܢ '''ܓܵܗܹ̈ܐ''' ܒܝܲܪܚܵܐ.|t=I go there two '''times''' a month.}}
#: {{ux|aii|ܗܘܼܡܙܸܡ ܠܝܼ ܥܲܡܹܗ ܒ'''ܓܵܗܵܐ''' ܩܲܕ݇ܡܵܝܬܵܐ ܒܫܹܢ݇ܬܵܐ ܕܥܒ݂ܝܼܪܵܗ̇.|subst=ܥܲܡܹܗ ܒ//ܥܲܡܹܗ ܒ-|t=I talked to him for the first '''time''' last year.}}

=====Inflection=====
{{aii-infl-noun-m|ܓܵܗ}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{col2|aii
|ܓܵܗܵܐ ܐ݇ܚܹܪ݇ܬܵܐ<t:another time, one more time>
|ܬܵܘܕܝܼ ܐܲܠܦܵܐ ܓܵܗܹ̈ܐ<t:thank you so much><lit:thank you a thousand times>
|ܚܲܕ݇ܟܡܵܐ ܓܵܗܹ̈ܐ<t:sometimes>
|ܟܠ ܓܵܗܵܐ<t:every time>
|ܚܕܵܐ ܓܵܗܵܐ<t:once>
|ܗ̇ܝܼܓܵܗ<t:so, then, at that time>
}}

=====See also=====
* {{l|aii|ܙܲܒ݂ܢܵܐ}}
* {{l|aii|ܥܸܕܵܢܵܐ}}
* {{l|aii|ܫܵܥܬܵܐ}}

====Preposition====
{{aii-prep|ܓܵܗܹ̈ܐ}}

