===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|fa|pal||tr=kaž, gaz}}, from {{der|fa|ine-pro|*kog-}}, {{m|ine-pro|*keg-}}, {{m|ine-pro|*keng-|t=peg, hook, claw}}. Related to {{l|fa|چنگ|tr=čang}}. Cognate with {{cog|en|hook}}.

