#: {{sufex|de|Putsch|t1=putsch, coup|Putschist|t2=putschist, coupist}}

====Usage notes====
* The suffix is productive in German, but generally only with non-native words or proper nouns. Exceptions include {{m|de|Harfenist}}, {{m|de|Lagerist}}, {{m|de||Putschist}}.

