====Preposition====
{{en-prep}}

# {{lb|en|rare|_|in US}} {{alternative form of|en|around}}
#: {{ux|en|I look '''round''' the room quickly to make sure it's neat.}}
#* {{quote-text|en|year=1782|author=w:William Cowper|title=The Progress of Error|passage=The serpent Error twines '''round''' human hearts.}}
# {{lb|en|used postpositively|rare|_|in US}} {{alternative form of|en|around}}
#: {{ux|en|The farmer fed his cow hay all the year '''round'''.}}

