{{der2|en|title=phrasal verbs|ask round|bet round|bring round|call round|cast round|come round|drop round|fuck round|get round|get round to|go round|hand round|look round|pass round|rally round|ring round|show round|spin round|talk round|win round|work round|wheel round|put round}}
{{der2|en|title=other multiword phrases|albatross round one's neck|flog someone round the fleet|go all round the houses|go round the houses|pass round the hat|rally round the flag|round the bend|round the corner|round the Horn|round the twist|round the wicket|shot heard round the world|swing round the circle|let the grass grow round one's feet|giddy-go-round|merry-go-round|pinch-me-round|round-the-clock|run circles round|run round in circles|sushi-go-round|beat someone round the ears}}
