Page 32 𐭪𐭫𐭲: -------- begin text --------
==Middle Persian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|pal|𐭪𐭥𐭲|ts1=-kirt, -gird|𐭪𐭥𐭲𐭩|ts2=-kirt, -gird|𐭪𐭫𐭲𐭩|ts3=-kirt, -gird|tr1=-krt|tr2=-krty||Inscriptional Pahlavi}}
* {{alter|pal|tr=-krt'|ts=-kirt, -gird|sc=Phlv|||Book Pahlavi}}
* {{alter|pal|-𐫃𐫏𐫡𐫅||Manichaean}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|pal|peo|𐎣𐎼𐎫|ts=karta|t=made, done}} (compare {{m|peo|ts=duškarta|t=ill-done}}),<ref>http://www.kavehfarrokh.com/wp-content/uploads/2009/07/index3.pdf</ref><ref name=armenia/> from {{inh|pal|iir-pro|*kr̥tás|t=done, made}}, from {{der|pal|ine-pro|*kʷer-|t=to do, make, construct}}; see {{m|fa|کردن|tr=kardan}} for more. Compare {{cog|grc|Ζαδρακάρτα|t=[[Zadracarta]]}},<ref>{{w|Josef Wiesehöfer|Wiesehöfer, Josef}} (Kiel), “Zadracarta”, in: Brill’s New Pauly, Antiquity volumes edited by: Hubert Cancik and , Helmuth Schneider. Consulted online on 24 June 2017 <http://dx.doi.org/10.1163/1574-9347_bnp_e12214250></ref> an Old Iranian borrowing.

Akin to Inscriptional {{cog|xpr|-𐭊𐭓𐭕|ts=-kirt, -gird}}, {{m|xpr|𐭃𐭎𐭕𐭊𐭓𐭕|ts=dastgird|t=estate}}, {{m|xpr|𐭇𐭔𐭕𐭓𐭊𐭓𐭕|ts=Šahrgird|t=a Sasanian fortress}}, Manichaean {{cog|sog|𐫡𐫟𐫘𐫏𐫗𐫤𐫀𐫏𐫐𐫏𐫡𐫔|ts=əraxsinder-kird|t=[[Alexandria]] [in Roman Egypt]}},<ref name=gazetteer/> and the Iranian borrowings: {{cog|xcl|-կերտ|lit=made, done}}, {{m|xcl|դաստակերտ|դաստ-ա-կերտ|t=possession, property; building, village|lit=handmade}}, {{m|xcl|ձեռակերտ|ձեռ-ա-կերտ|t=manufacture}}, {{m|xcl|Տիգրանակերտ|Տիգրան-ա-կերտ|t=[[Tigranocerta]]|lit=founded by Tigran}}, {{m|xcl|Խոսրովակերտ|Խոսրով-ա-կերտ|lit=founded by Khosrov}},<ref name=armenia>{{w|Rüdiger Schmitt}} (December 15, 1986), [http://www.iranicaonline.org/articles/armenia-iv "ARMENIA AND IRAN iv. Iranian influences in Armenian Language"], in ''{{w|Encyclopaedia Iranica}}''</ref> {{m|xcl|Ալաշկերտ}}, {{m|xcl|Մանազկերտ}}, {{m|xcl|Մանաւազակերտ}}, {{cog|grc|Μαντζικέρτ}}, {{cog|tr|Malazgirt}}, {{cog|grc|[[φρούριον]] [[Γιλιγέρδων]]}}.<ref>''Welt des Orients'' '''19''', 96-101, ISSN 0043-2547</ref>

Compare [[kltk']].

===Suffix===
{{head|pal|suffix|ts=-kirt, -gird}}

# {{lb|pal|literally}} [[made]] by
