* {{l|pal|tr=ʾlxsyndrgyrd|ts=Alaxsindargird|t=Alexandria in Roman Egypt|sc=Phlv}}<ref name=gazetteer>Places and people in Central Asia and in the Graeco-Roman Near East : a multilingual gazetteer from select Pre-Islamic sources</ref>
* {{l|pal|tr=plʾhwklt|ts=Frāxkard|sc=Phlv}}
