{{bor+|bn|fa-cls|شرمندگی}}, a compound of {{l|fa-cls|شرمنده|t=ashamed}} (which is taken from {{der|bn|fa-cls|شرم}}, which is ultimately from {{der|bn|pal|𐭱𐭥𐭬|tr=šarm}}, from {{der|bn|ae|𐬟𐬱𐬀𐬭𐬆𐬨𐬀}}, from {{der|bn|ine-pro|*ḱormo-||suffering, pain}}. Cognate with {{cog|kho|tr=kṣär-|t=be ashamed}} and {{cog|en|harm}}) and the suffix {{l|fa-cls|گی}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{bn-IPA}}
* {{bn-IPA|type=vanga}}

===Noun===
{{bn-noun}}

# [[embarrassment]], [[shame]]
#: {{ux|bn|'''শারমেন্দাগী''' হবে হাশরের মাঝে|tr='''śarmendagi''' hôbe haśôrer majhe|There will be '''embarrassment''' in the [[day of judgement|Final Gathering]].}} - [[w:Kazi Nazrul Islam|Kazi Nazrul Islam]]

====Inflection====
{{bn-noun-v-inan|śaromendagi}}

===See also===
*{{l|bn|শরম}}
-------- end text --------
