{{tg-noun|fa=ـگی}}

# {{alt form of|tg|-ӣ|pos=noun forming suffix|nocap=1}} used for words ending with the vowel {{l|tg|а}}.
#: {{l|tg|мардона|t=manly, masculine}} + {{l|tg|-гӣ}} = {{l|tg|мардонагӣ|t=masculinity}}
#: {{l|tg|бараҳна|t=nude}} + {{l|tg|-гӣ}} = {{l|tg|бараҳнагӣ|t=nudity}}
# {{lb|tg|less common}} {{alt form of|tg|-ӣ|pos=adjective forming suffix|nocap=1}} used for words ending with the vowel {{l|tg|а}}.
#: {{l|tg|хона|t=home}} + {{l|tg|-гӣ}} = {{l|tg|хонагӣ|t=domestic}}

====Usage notes====
* Usually only forms nouns, with most formed adjectives using {{l|tg|-ӣ}} irregardless of the final vowel. However, there are some adjectives that use {{l-self|tg|-гӣ}}.

