{{bor+|ms|ar|-}} [[نسبة|nisba]] suffix {{m|ar|ـِيّ}}.

====Suffix====
{{head|ms|suffix|Jawi spelling|-ي}}

# {{n-g|Forms an adjective that is related to the base word.}}
#: {{suffixusex|ms|abad|abadi|t1=century|t2=eternal, everlasting}}
#: {{suffixusex|ms|bahar|bahari|t1=sea|t2=sea-related}}

=====Alternative forms=====
