==Turkish==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|tr|[i]|q=senses 1, 2, 3, and 6}}
* {{IPA|tr|[iː]|q=senses 4 and 5}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|tr|ota|ـی|tr=-i}}, from {{inh|tr|trk-pro|*-ni||accusative suffix}}.

====Suffix====
{{tr-suffix|inflectional}}

# Accusative suffix
#: {{suffixusex|tr|gelin|gelini}}

===Etymology 2===
{{inh+|tr|ota|ـی|tr=-i}}, from {{inh|tr|trk-pro|*-si||third-person singular possessive suffix}}.

====Suffix====
{{tr-suffix}}

# {{senseid|tr|possessive}} Third-person singular possessive suffix denoting singular possession.
#: {{suffixusex|tr|ev|gloss1=house|evi|gloss2=his/her/its house}}
#: {{suffixusex|tr|ofis|gloss1=office|ofisi|gloss2=his/her/its office}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{suffixsee|tr|-i (possessive)}}

===Etymology 3===
{{inh+|tr|ota|ی|tr=-i}}, from {{inh|tr|trk-pro|*-g|*-ig}}.

====Suffix====
{{tr-suffix-forms|ı=ı|i=i|u=u|ü=ü}}
{{tr-suffix|noun}}

# {{senseid|tr|deverbal nominal}} [[Suffix]] creating nouns from verbs
#: {{suffixusex|tr|[[vermek|ver-]]|gloss1=to give|veri|gloss2=datum}}
#: {{suffixusex|tr|[[dizmek|diz-]]|gloss1=to align|dizi|gloss2=sequence, set, series}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{suffixsee|tr|-i (deverbal nominal)}}

===Etymology 4===
{{inh+|tr|ota|ـی|tr=-î}}, from {{der|tr|ar|ـِيّ}}.

====Alternative forms====
* {{alter|tr|-î}}

====Suffix====
{{tr-suffix}}

# {{senseid|tr|nisba}} {{ng|Nisba suffix; creates adjectives.}}

=====Usage notes=====
* The alternative form ''-î'' is used when the resulting adjective would otherwise be identical to the definite accusative form (e.g. {{afex|tr|resim<t:picture>|altaff=-î|resmî<t:official, formal>}}, not {{m|tr|resmi}}, which is the definite accusative form of the same noun).

=====Derived terms=====
{{suffixsee|tr|-i (nisba)}}

===Etymology 5===
{{inh+|tr|ota|ـی|tr=-i}}, from {{der|tr|fa|ـی}}.

====Suffix====
{{tr-suffix}}

# {{senseid|tr|Persian abstract suffix}} {{ng|Suffix creating abstract nouns from nouns or adjectives}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{suffixsee|tr|-i (Persian abstract suffix)}}

===Etymology 6===
{{inh+|tr|ota|ـِ|tr=-i}}, from {{der|tr|fa-cls|ـِ|tr=-i}}.

====Suffix====
{{tr-suffix}}

# {{senseid|tr|ezafe}} {{ng|the [[ezafe]] particle}}

===Further reading===
* https://www.nisanyansozluk.com/ek/%2B%C4%AB

