{{bor+|ur|fa-cls|ترکی|tr=turkī}}. {{surf|ur|ترک<tr:turk>|ـی<tr:-ī>}}.

====Adjective====
{{ur-adj|head=تُرْکِی|tr=turkī}}

# of or belonging to a [[Turk]]; [[Turkish]], Turk-like
# a [[horse]] of Turkish breed

====Noun====
{{ur-noun|head=تُرْکِی|g=f}}

{{slim-wikipedia|ترکی زبان|lang=ur}}
# the [[Turkish]] language {{c|ur|Languages}}
# Turk-like [[qualities]] or [[habits]], [[oppression]], [[haughtiness]], [[insolence]], etc. (see {{m|ur|ترک|tr=turk}})

=====Derived terms=====
* {{l|ur|ترکی بہ ترکی|tr=turkī ba-turkī||insolence for insolence, etc.; tit for tat; a Rowland for an Oliver (e.g. {{m|ur|جواب ترکی بہ ترکی دینا|tr=jawāb turkī ba-turkī denā||to answer insolence with insolence, to give tit for tat}}}}
* {{l|ur|ترکی تمام ہونا|tr=turkī tamām honā (-kī)||one's pride or haughtiness to come to an end; to be humbled or abased; to be undone or ruined; to be all over (with)}}

====Related terms====
