* {{R:Platts|ترکي}}
* {{R:Rekhta}}

===Etymology 2===
{{wp|lang=ur}}
{{Wiktionary:Picture dictionary/ur:map/Europe}}
{{Wiktionary:Picture dictionary/ur:map/Middle East}}
{{phono-semantic matching|ur|en|Turkey}}.

====Proper noun====
{{ur-proper noun|g=m|head=تُرْکی}}

# {{place|ur|country|continent/Asia|and|continent/Europe|t=Turkey}} {{century|20}}, [[Republic of Turkey]]
#: {{syn|ur|ترکیہ<tr:turkiyah>|ترکیے<tr:turkīye>}}

=====Usage notes=====
{{m|ur|ترکی|tr=turkī}} is the most common way to refer to the [[w:Turkey|Republic of Turkey]]. However, the [[w:Government of Pakistan|Government of Pakistan]] has started using {{m|ur|تُرْکِیَہ}} more frequently upon the change of the official English name to the [[Republic of Türkiye]], with an alternative spelling of {{m|ur|ترکیے|tr=turkīye}}.

=====Related terms=====
* {{l|ur|جمہوریہ ترکی|t=[[Republic of Turkey]]|tr=jamhūriya-e-turkī}}

