===Pronunciation===
* {{ur-IPA|xudkuśī}}
* {{IPA|ur|/xʊd̪.kə.ʃiː/|a=common,Feminine}}
* {{rhymes|ur|iː|s=3}}

===Noun===
{{ur-noun|tr=xudkuśī|head=خود کُشی|g=f|hi=ख़ुदकुशी}}

# [[suicide]]
#: {{uxa|ur|'''خودکشی''' کرنا گناۂ عظیم ہے|tr='''xudkuśī''' karnā gunāh-e-azīm hai|To commit '''suicide''' is a great sin.}}
#: {{syn|ur|آتْم ہَتّیا}}

====Related terms====
* {{l|ur|خودکش|tr=xudkuś|t=suicidal}}
* {{l|ur|خودکشی کرنا|tr=xudkuśī karnā|t=[[commit suicide]]}}

===References===
* {{R:ur:Pakistani Dictionary}}
* {{R:ur:Rekhta}}

