==Turkish==

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|tr|ota|ـی|tr=-ï|t=accusative case marker}}, itself from either {{inh|tr|trk-cmn|*-g}}, {{m|trk-pro|*-ïg|t=accusative case marker}} or simplified from {{der|tr|trk-cmn|*-ni|*-nï|t=accusative case marker}} to suit where oblique case is unnecessary for the accusative case, since the oblique case {{m|trk-pro|*-n-}} is not productive by itself and requires other cases. Compare {{cog|otk|𐰍|ts=-(ï)ɣ}}, {{m|otk|𐰃𐰍|ts=-ïɣ}}.

====Suffix====
{{head|tr|suffix}}

# [[definitive]] [[accusative]] [[suffix]]
#: {{uxi|tr|sen'''i''' seviyorum|I like '''you'''}}
#: {{uxi|tr|Kitab'''ı''' istiyorum|I want [[the]] book(accusative used)}}
#: {{uxi|tr|Kitap istiyorum|I want [[a]] book(accusative not used)}}

=====Usage notes=====
* It becomes {{m|tr|-yı}} if the word ends with a vowel.
* It becomes {{m|tr|-nı}} when preceded by third person singular possessive suffix {{m|tr|-ı}}.

=====Related terms=====
* {{l|tr|-i}}
* {{l|tr|-nı}}

===Etymology 2===
From {{inh|tr|ota|ی|tr=-ï|t=possesive marker}}, from {{inh|tr|trk-pro|*-si|*-ï|t=possesive marker}}. Cognate with {{cog|otk|𐰃|ts=-ï}}.

====Suffix====
{{head|tr|suffix}}

# 3rd person singular [[possessive]] [[suffix]]

=====Usage notes=====
* Although it is believed to become {{m|tr|-sı}} when the word ends with a vowel, this suffix probably comes from a different root.

=====Related terms=====
* {{l|tr|-i}}

===Etymology 3===
From {{inh|tr|ota|ی|tr=-ï|t=adverbial suffix}}, from {{inh|tr|trk-pro|*-u}}. Cognate with {{cog|otk|𐰆|ts=-u}}.

====Suffix====
{{head|tr|suffix}}

# {{lb|tr|unproductive and limited to certain pattern and copula}} Makes [[adverbs]] out of [[verbs]]

=====Related terms=====
* {{l|tr|-i}}
* {{l|tr|-u}}
* {{l|tr|-yı}}

===Etymology 4===

====Alternative forms====
* {{alter|tr|-u|-i|-ü}}

From {{inh|tr|ota|ی|tr=-ï}}, from {{inh|tr|trk-pro|*-g|*-ïg}}.

====Suffix====
{{head|tr|suffix}}

# [[Suffix]] creating nouns out of [[verbs]]
#: {{suffixusex|tr|[[takmak|tak-]]|gloss1=to put on, attach|takı|gloss2=ornament, jewellery}}
#: {{suffixusex|tr|[[saymak|say-]]|gloss1=to count|sayı|gloss2=number}}
