Page 109 بین الاقوامی: Skipped, no changes
Page 109 بین الاقوامی: -------- begin text --------
==Urdu==

===Etymology===
Coined in Urdu from {{suffix|ur|lang1=ar|[[بَيْنَ]] [[أقوام|الأَقْوَام]]|alt1=بَيْنَ الأَقْوَام|t1=between the peoples|ی|tr2=ī|pos=adjective}}, by analogy with [[Classical Persian]] {{m|fa-cls|بین‌المللی|tr=baynalmilalī}}. The Arabic word {{m|ar|قَوْم}} is used (loaned via Classical Persian) in the sense of "[[nation]]" as is standard in Urdu. In Arabic itself, the word {{m|ar|دُوَلِيّ}} has become standardised for "[[international]]". Also compare {{nc|ota|بین‌الملل|tr=beyn-elmilel}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ur-IPA|bainal-aqvāmī}}

===Adjective===
{{ur-adj|head=بَیْنَ ال[[اَقْوام]]ی|tr=bainal-aqvāmī|hi=बैनल-अक़वामी}}

# [[international]]
#: {{uxa|ur|'''بَیْنَ الاَقْوامی''' تَعْلُقات|tr='''bainal-aqvāmī''' tāluqāt|'''international''' relations}}

====Synonyms====
* {{l|ur|عَالمِی|t=[[global]]}}
* {{l|ur|عَالَمگِیر|t=[[worldwide]]}}

===References===
* {{R:Rekhta|بین+الاقوامی}}
* {{R:ur:UDB|بین+الاقوامی}}
-------- end text --------
