|passage=The metals are gold and silver, these being termed "'''or'''" and "argent".}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=1889|author=Charles Norton Elvin|title=A Dictionary of Heraldry|passage=In engraving, "'''Or'''" is expressed by dots.}}
#: {{color panel|FFD700}}

