==Persian==

===Etymology 1===
From {{af|fa|بر|tr1=bar|t1=on; upon|ـین|tr2=-in|pos2=[[elative]] suffix}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{fa-IPA|barīn}}

====Adjective====
{{fa-adj|head=بَرین|tr=barin}}

# [[high]]est; [[sublime]]
#* {{quote-book|fa|author=w:Hafez|trans-title={{w|The Divan of Hafez}}|title=fa:دیوان حافظ|year=c. 1390|chapter=Ghazal 317|url= https://ganjoor.net/hafez/ghazal/sh317|text=‌ من ملک بودم و فردوسِ برین جایم بود<br> آدم آورد در این دیرِ خراب آبادم|tr=man malak bûdam u firdaws-i '''barîn''' jâ-yam bûd<br>âdam âward dar în dayr-i xarâb âbâd-am|t=I was an angel, and the '''highest''' heaven was my place;<br>Man brought me into this monastery built amid ruins.|footer=(romanization in Classical Persian)}}

===Etymology 2===
