{{fa-noun|tr=pustin}}

# [[winter]] [[fur]] or [[leather]] [[coat]]
#* {{quote-book|fa|title=fa:دیوان سعدی|trans-title=The Divān of Saʿdī|author={{w|Saadi Shirazi|Saʿdī}}|year=c. 1260|url=https://ganjoor.net/saadi/divan/robaees/sh18|chapter=Rubaʿī 18|text=آن ماه که گفتی ملک رحمانست<br>این بار اگرش نگه کنی شیطانست<br>رویی که چو آتش به زمستان خوش بود<br>امروز چو پوستین به تابستانست|tr=ān māh ki guftī malak-i rahmān ast<br>īn bār agar-aš nigah kunī šaytān ast<br>rōyē ki čō ātiš ba zimistān xwaš būd<br>imrōz čō '''pōstēn''' ba tābistān ast|t=That beauty whom you said was the angel of the Lord:<br>If you see him this time, he is the Devil!<br>That face which was pleasant like fire in winter,<br>Is today like a '''fur coat''' in summer.|footer=(Classical Persian transliteration.)<br>(The poem references the growth of facial hair, which spoils the beauty of the adolescent male beloved.)}}

===Adjective===
{{fa-adj|tr=pustin}}

# {{lb|fa|obsolete}} [[made]] of [[leather]]

