* {{sense|letter name}} {{IPA|ug|/i/}}
* {{sense|phoneme}} {{IPA|ug|/i/}}

===Letter===
{{head|ug|letter|tr=i}}

# The thirty-first letter of the Uyghur alphabet.

====Forms====
{| class="wikitable"
|-
! Isolated form !!Final form !! Medial form !! Initial form
|- style="font-size:300%; text-align:center; line-height:100%; font-family: Scheherazade, Lateef, 'Times New Roman';"
| ئى || ـى || ـىـ || ئىـ
|}

====See also====
* Previous letter: {{l|ug|ئې}}
* Next letter: {{l|ug|ي}}

====Usage notes====
* In UEY(Uyghur Ereb Yëziqi), if a word begin with a vowel, there will always a hamza before the vowel letter. e.g. {{l|ug|ئېغىز}}. And when there is no consonant between two vowels, a hamza is always placed between them. e.g. {{l|ug|سائەت}}.
